msgstr "<link=\"CO2SCRUBBER\">リーガルニュートロニウム 炭素スキマー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.DESC"
msgid "The smoky flavor is intentional."
msgstr "スモーキーな風味は意図的です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COOKINGSTATION\">Backcountry Grill</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COOKINGSTATION\">田舎グリル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.DESC"
msgid "It makes quality meal recipes feel more...approachable."
msgstr "質の高い食事のレシピがより身近になります。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOURMETCOOKINGSTATION\">Rustic Gas Range</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOURMETCOOKINGSTATION\">素朴ガスレンジ</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Someone once suggested that ornate corner trim tiles be called \"cornate\" tiles. Thankfully, they were overruled."
msgstr "かつて誰かが、装飾的なコーナー縁タイルを「コーネート」タイルと呼ぶべきだと提案しました。ありがたいことに、却下されました。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">Regal Neutronium Corner Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">リーガルニュートロニウム コーナー縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "A rising tide directs all eyes to the ceiling, where they'll land on this magnificent maritime corner trim."
msgstr "満ち潮のように人々の視線は天井へと向けられ、この壮麗な海をイメージしたコーナー装飾に自然と引きつけられるでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">Nautical Corner Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">航海 コーナー縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.DESC"
msgid "Building a better tomorrow, today."
msgstr "よりよい明日を今日築きます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.NAME"
msgid "Retro LED Crafting Table"
msgstr "レトロLED作業台"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Installing elegant crown moulding is a clever way to distract visitors from unswept tunnel floors."
msgstr "エレガントな廻り縁を設置することは、、散らかった床から訪問者の注意をそらすための賢い方法です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">Regal Neutronium Ceiling Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">リーガルニュートロニウム 廻り縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Top-notch deckhead decor fit for a captain's quarters."
msgstr "船長室にふさわしい、最高級のデッキヘッド装飾です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">Nautical Ceiling Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">航海 廻り縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.DESC"
msgid "Handcrafted from decommissioned rockets."
msgstr "廃止されたロケットから手作りされています。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.NAME"
msgid "Sculpted Steel Dress"
msgstr "彫刻されたスチールドレス"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Expert pleating ensures this skirt maintains its shape no matter what the universe throws at it."
msgstr "熟練の技術によるプリーツ加工により、このスカートはどんな状況下でもその形状を保ちます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "Sailor Dress"
msgstr "航海ドレス"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "The oxygenated air produced by this building smells...superior, somehow."
msgstr "この設備から産出される酸素を含んだ空気は、何だか…素晴らしい香りがします。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ELECTROLYZER\">Regal Neutronium Electrolyzer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ELECTROLYZER\">リーガルニュートロニウム 電解装置</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.DESC"
msgid "Whoever sleeps here will wake up happy as a clampum."
msgstr "ここで眠る人は誰でも、目覚めた時にはクランパンと同じくらい幸せな気分になれるでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Pearly Pillowtop Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">パール調ピロートップベッド</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.DESC"
msgid "It is extremely unlikely to close while someone is inside."
msgstr "中に人が居る状態で閉められる可能性は極めて低いです。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Hatch Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">ハッチベッド</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.DESC"
msgid "Perfect for side sleepers and little spoons."
msgstr "横向きで寝たり、抱締められながら寝る人に最適です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Pipsqueak Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">ピップベッド</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.DESC"
msgid "Too bad there's no widely known term for underwater vehicles in this particular color."
msgstr "残念ながら、この手の水中車両を的確に表す色名はありません。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Aquatic Rocket Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">水中ロケットベッド</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.DESC"
msgid "It makes Duplicants feel like they're about to be read a bedtime story."
msgstr "複製人間はまるで就寝前に絵本を読んでもらっているかのような気分になります。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FLOORLAMP\">Storytime Lamp</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FLOORLAMP\">お話ランプ</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.DESC"
msgid "It is safe to say that no critter ever mocked the Jawbo for having four eyes."
msgstr "ジョーボが四つの目を持っているからといって、それを嘲笑する生き物はいなかったと言っても過言ではないでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.NAME"
msgid "The Dangler"
msgstr "空中ブランコ"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.DESC"
msgid "This display model's open jaw makes it an unsuitable shape for after-hours bowling."
msgstr "この展示モデルは顎が開いているため、営業時間外のボウリングには適していません。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.NAME"
msgid "Roar O'Saurus"
msgstr "恐竜の叫び"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.DESC"
msgid "It's unclear whether this sculpture is based on a long-extinct creature, or a very vivid dream."
msgstr "この彫刻が、はるか昔に絶滅した生物をモチーフにしているのか、非常に鮮明な夢をモチーフにしているのかは不明です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.NAME"
msgid "Uncanny Carapace"
msgstr "不気味な甲殻"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "Some Duplicants like to crawl into this Lumb sculpture and run a spoon over the ribs like a musical instrument."
msgstr "複製人間の中には、このラムの彫刻の中に潜り込み、肋骨の上で楽器のようにスプーンを動かすのが好きな者もいます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "Pointy Plates"
msgstr "尖ったプレート"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "It's so polished that there's a chance Duplicants might get lost in their own reflection."
msgstr "良く研磨されているおかげで、複製人間が反射された自分の姿を見失うことがあります。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">Regal Neutronium Refrigerator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">リーガルニュートロニウム 冷蔵庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Because Duplicants will keel over if they don't get enough calories."
msgstr "複製人間は十分なカロリーが摂取できないと倒れてしまうでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">Nautical Stripe Refrigerator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">航海 縞模様冷蔵庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC"
msgid "Holds enough food to tide over a small colony."
msgstr "小規模なコロニーが当面の間食料を賄えるだけの量を収納できます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">Ripple Refrigerator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">さざ波 冷蔵庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.DESC"
msgid "The splotchy parts have an unsettlingly leather-like texture."
msgstr "斑点状の部分は不気味なほど革のような質感をしています。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Dartle Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">ダートル気体貯蔵庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.DESC"
msgid "Does not stomp."
msgstr "踏みつけないで。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Lumb Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">ラム気体貯蔵庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Classically striped storage is a mainstay of marine colony management."
msgstr "従来からある縞模様の貯蔵庫は、海洋生物群集管理の基本的手法です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Nautical Stripe Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">航海 縞模様 気体貯蔵庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC"
msgid "This style has been making waves in colonies across the universe since time began."
msgstr "このスタイルは、有史以来、宇宙中のコロニーで大きな話題を呼んでいます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Ripple Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">さざ波 気体貯蔵庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.DESC"
msgid "Clean lines, clean energy...as long as the operator doesn't sweat all over the wheel."
msgstr "クリーンなライン、クリーンなエネルギー。(操縦者が汗をかかない場合に限る)"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Sleek Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">スリーク 人力発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.DESC"
msgid "It looks like someone dug this out of an old rocket hangar."
msgstr "誰かが古いロケットハンガーからこれを掘り出したようです。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Clunky Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">ガタガタの人力発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.DESC"
msgid "Take a spin on the party wheel! It generates raver vibes as well as power."
msgstr "パーティーホイールを回しましょう！どんちゃん騒ぎの雰囲気とパワーが得られます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Retro LED Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">レトロLED 人力発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Time spent operating this building does nothing to help Duplicants get their sea legs."
msgstr "この設備を運用するのに費やす時間は、複製人間が船旅に慣れるのに貢献しません。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Nautical Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">航海 人力発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Some folks climb up the corporate ladder, others race on the aristocratic wheel."
msgstr "企業で出世階段を登る人も居れば、貴族階級の輪の中で競争する人も居ます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Regal Neutronium Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">リーガルニュートロニウム 人力発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.DESC"
msgid "It gets off to a rocky start, but it works so well that there's no point reinventing it."
msgstr "最初はうまくいきませんでしたが、非常にうまく機能したので、やり直す必要はありませんでした。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Rustic Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">錆びた人力発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.DESC"
msgid "Out here, \"all hands on deck\" also means \"all feet on generator pedals.\""
msgstr "ここでは「全員で力を合わせる」とは「全員で発電機のペダルを踏む」という意味でもあります。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Ripple Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">さざ波 人力発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "This building's high-gloss finish never loses its shine, no matter how many layers of coal dust it's coated in."
msgstr "この設備の高光沢仕上げは、石炭の粉塵が何層にも重ねられても輝きを失うことはありません。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GENERATOR\">Regal Neutronium Coal Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GENERATOR\">リーガルニュートロニウム 石炭発電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.DESC"
msgid "Soft blue overhead light uplifts the Duplicant soul."
msgstr "柔らかな青い天井照明が、複製人間の魂を高揚させます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GLASSCEILINGLIGHT\">Hush Jelly Ceiling Light</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">ハッシュくらげ 天井灯</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_PINK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_PINK.DESC"
msgid "It's like rose-colored glasses for the whole room."
