msgid "An aquatic wallpaper featuring just the very top of a lush kelp forest."
msgstr "緑豊かな昆布の森の頂上部分だけを描いた、水中用壁紙です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_KELP_TOP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_KELP_TOP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Tower Kelp Canopy</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">タワーケルプキャノピー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PACU.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PACU.DESC"
msgid "The slightly judgy side-eye is actually this critter's invitation to play."
msgstr "少し批判的な横目で見るその視線は、実はこの動物からの遊びへの誘いなのです。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PACU.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PACU.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Playful Pacu</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">遊び盛りのパクー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PUFFER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PUFFER.DESC"
msgid "It's hard to resist the urge to pinch the cheeks."
msgstr "頬をつねりたくなる衝動を抑えるのは難しいものです。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PUFFER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PUFFER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Big-Cheeked Blowter</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ぷっくりブローター</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT.DESC"
msgid "A warm sandy wallpaper that makes Duplicants feel like they're on vacation."
msgstr "複製人間たちがまるで休暇中のような気分になれる、温かみのある砂色の壁紙です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Just Beachy</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ジャストビーチ</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT_TOP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT_TOP.DESC"
msgid "An organically shaped sandy strip with speckled aqua blue above."
msgstr "有機的な形状の砂浜で、上部には斑点状のアクアブルーが広がっています。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT_TOP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT_TOP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Sand Bar</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">サンドバー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_TURTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_TURTLE.DESC"
msgid "An overhead view of this critter taking up as much space as it possibly can."
msgstr "この動物が可能な限り多くのスペースを占拠している様子を上から見た図です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_TURTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_TURTLE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">All-Out Orehull</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">全力オレハル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_ARCADE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_ARCADE.DESC"
msgid "For those who miss the carpet-burned elbows of their home planet."
msgstr "故郷の惑星のカーペットで焼けた肘を懐かしむ人々へ。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_ARCADE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_ARCADE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Arcade</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">アーケード</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_BASIC_BLUE_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_BASIC_BLUE_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "A smooth-sailing solid blue wallpaper."
msgstr "滑らかで落ち着いた印象の、無地の青い壁紙です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_BASIC_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_BASIC_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Solid Nautical</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ソリッドノーティカル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CHAMELEO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CHAMELEO.DESC"
msgid "The only known image of an adult Dartle with both eyes wide open. So awake!"
msgstr "両目を大きく見開いた成体のダートルの画像です。お目目パッチリ！"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CHAMELEO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CHAMELEO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Pixel Dartle</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ピクセルダートル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC"
msgid "It can be arranged into giant polka dots...or scalloped edges."
msgstr "巨大な水玉模様にしたり、波型の縁取りにしたりすることもできます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Nautical Wedge</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ノーティカル ウェッジ</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_WHITE_BLUE_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_WHITE_BLUE_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "A white wedge with just the tiniest bit of blue in one corner."
msgstr "白いウェッジ型で、片隅にほんの少しだけ青色が入っています。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_WHITE_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_WHITE_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Nautical Curved Corner</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ノーティカル カーブコーナー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_BOGEY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_BOGEY.DESC"
msgid "Physicists say it changed color the moment it was observed."
msgstr "物理学者らは、観測された瞬間に色が変わったと述べています。"

# Satsuma(サツマ)は温州ミカンのこと
#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_BOGEY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_BOGEY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Quantum Circuit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">量子回路</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_LIGHTCOBALT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_LIGHTCOBALT.DESC"
msgid "It really makes power plants feel like h-Ohm."
msgstr "本当に発電所がΩのように感じられます。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_LIGHTCOBALT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_LIGHTCOBALT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Mech Circuit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">メカ回路</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_PUNK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_PUNK.DESC"
msgid "Named for the designer's favorite bacteria-munching virus."
msgstr "デザイナーのお気に入りの細菌を食べるウイルスにちなんで名付けられました。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_PUNK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCUIT_PUNK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Phage Circuit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ファージ回路</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_DIAGONAL_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_DIAGONAL_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC"
msgid "A maritime wallpaper with a diagonal stripe."
msgstr "斜めストライプが入った海をモチーフとした壁紙です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_DIAGONAL_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_DIAGONAL_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Nautical Diagonal</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ノーティカル ダイアゴナル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOREST.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOREST.DESC"
msgid "Sustainable forest bathing."
msgstr "持続可能な森林浴です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOREST.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOREST.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Forest</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">森林</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_CHAMELEO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_CHAMELEO.DESC"
msgid "Viewers remark upon this carving's age, but the real wonder is that its top-heavy subject matter didn't fall on its face more often."
msgstr "鑑賞者はこの彫刻の古さに驚きますが、本当に不思議なのは、頭でっかちの題材があまり頻繁に倒れなかったということです。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_CHAMELEO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_CHAMELEO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Dartle Carving</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ダートルの彫刻</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_PACULACANTH.DESC"
msgid "A visual retelling of the terrifying creature that once ate an entire fish farm population without even calling dibs."
msgstr "かつて、権利を主張することさえせずに養殖場の全魚群を食べ尽くした恐ろしい生き物を、視覚的に再現した作品です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_PACULACANTH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_PACULACANTH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Jawbo Carving</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ジョーボの彫刻</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_RAPTOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_RAPTOR.DESC"
msgid "The omission of a prey animal in the creature's jaws is an intentional dig at its famously subpar hunting skills."
msgstr "この生き物の顎に獲物がいないのは、その劣悪な狩猟技術を意図的に揶揄しているのです。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_RAPTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_RAPTOR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Rhex Carving</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">レックスの彫刻</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "This carving was originally found at the site of one of the most renowned farms on the planetoid."
msgstr "この彫刻はもともと、小惑星上で最も有名な農場のひとつの跡地で発見されました。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Lumb Carving</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ラムの彫刻</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_IGLOO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_IGLOO.DESC"
msgid "Snow tile style that won't melt!"
msgstr "解けることの無いスノータイル！"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_IGLOO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_IGLOO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Ice Panel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">アイスパネル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PACULACANTH.DESC"
msgid "It's just so dang cute without its rows and rows of jagged teeth."
msgstr "ギザギザの歯が何列も並んで「いない」のが、本当にかわいいです。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PACULACANTH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PACULACANTH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Pixel Jawbo</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ピクセルジョーボ</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PLUS_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PLUS_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC"
msgid "A world without swimming? Does not compute."
msgstr "泳げない世界？ありえません。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PLUS_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_PLUS_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Digital Nautical</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">デジタルノーティカル</link>"

