msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SEA_LIFEPRESERVER.DESC"
msgid "An unfussy floatie amid bubbles and waves."
msgstr "泡と波の中を漂う、気取らない浮き輪です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SEA_LIFEPRESERVER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SEA_LIFEPRESERVER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Minimalist Floatie</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ミニマリスト浮輪</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SEA_WHEEL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SEA_WHEEL.DESC"
msgid "An unfussy ship's wheel amid bubbles and waves."
msgstr "泡と波の中に佇む、飾り気のない船の舵輪です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SEA_WHEEL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SEA_WHEEL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Minimalist Ship's Wheel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ミニマリスト舵輪</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SILHOUETTE_PREHISTORICCRITTERS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SILHOUETTE_PREHISTORICCRITTERS.DESC"
msgid "A subtle nod to all prehistoric critters great and small."
msgstr "大小さまざまな先史時代の生き物たちへのさりげない敬意です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SILHOUETTE_PREHISTORICCRITTERS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SILHOUETTE_PREHISTORICCRITTERS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Shadowy Figures</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">影絵</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SOUTHWEST.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SOUTHWEST.DESC"
msgid "Southwest of <i>what</i>, Duplicants aren't sure. But they like it."
msgstr "<i>どこの</i>南西かは分かりませんが、複製人間達はそれが気に入っています。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SOUTHWEST.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SOUTHWEST.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Southwest</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">南西</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC"
msgid "It's hip to be square. Or so they say."
msgstr "ダサいってことはイケてるってこと。少なくともそう言われています。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARE_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Nautical Square</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ノーティカルスクエア</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARES_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARES_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC"
msgid "Ideal for marine-themed kitchens."
msgstr "海洋をテーマにしたキッチンに最適です。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARES_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_SQUARES_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Nautical Checkers</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ノーティカル チェッカー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "Instead of having blank walls, consider blank-stare walls!"
msgstr "何もない壁の代わりに、何もない状態の壁を検討してください！"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">Pixel Lumb</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXTERIORWALL\">ピクセルラム</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STRIPES_CIRCLE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STRIPES_CIRCLE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.DESC"
msgid "Alternating blue and white curves, with blue on the outside."
msgstr "青と白の曲線が交互に並び、外側が青色になっています。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STRIPES_CIRCLE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_STRIPES_CIRCLE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME"
