#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH"
msgid "Launch Rocket"
msgstr "ロケット発射"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_ACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b>: Launch rocket"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>: ロケット発射"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_INACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b>: Awaits launch command"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_off\">レッド</style></b>: 発射命令待ち"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY"
msgid "Rocket Checklist"
msgstr "ロケットチェックリスト"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_ACTIVE"
msgid "Sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> when its rocket launch checklist is complete"
msgstr "ロケットチェックリストが全件消化済みの場合<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>になります"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_INACTIVE"
msgid "Otherwise, sends a <b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b>"
msgstr "そうでない場合、<b><style=\"logic_off\">レッド</style></b>になります"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE\">Command Capsule</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CLUSTERCOMMANDMODULE\">制御カプセル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR.DESC"
msgid "A hatch for getting in and out of the rocket."
msgstr "ロケットに乗り降りするためのハッチです。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Warning: Do not open mid-flight."
msgstr "警告: 航行中は開けないでください。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR\">Interior Hatch</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CLUSTERCRAFTINTERIORDOOR\">室内ハッチ</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.DESC"
msgid "Telescopes are necessary for studying space, allowing rocket travel to other worlds."
msgstr "観測望遠鏡はロケット旅行や星図を作るために必要です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Reveals visitable Planetoids in space, producing <link=\"DATABANK\">Data Banks</link> in the process.\n"
"\n"
"Assigned Duplicants must possess the <link=\"ASTRONOMY\">Astronomy</link> skill.\n"
"\n"
"Building must be exposed to space to function."
msgstr ""
"宇宙にある有望な小惑星を明らかにし、その過程で<link=\"DATABANK\">データバンク</link>を生産します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"ASTRONOMY\">天文学</link>スキルを持った複製人間を観測に従事させる必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"機能するためには宇宙に面している必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CLUSTERTELESCOPE\">Telescope</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CLUSTERTELESCOPE\">観測望遠鏡</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.REQUIREMENT_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPE.REQUIREMENT_TOOLTIP"
msgid "A steady {0} supply is required to sustain working Duplicants."
msgstr "複製人間が働き続けるために、{0}の安定供給が必要です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.DESC"
msgid "It's easier to focus on work when shielded from the vacuum of space."
msgstr "宇宙空間の真空から保護されていれば、仕事に集中しやすくなります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Reveals visitable Planetoids in space and produces <link=\"DATABANK\">Data Banks</link>... in comfort!\n"
"\n"
"Assigned Duplicants must possess the <link=\"ASTRONOMY\">Astronomy</link> skill.\n"
"\n"
"Excellent sunburn protection (100%), partial <link=\"RADIATION\">Radiation</link> protection (50%) .\n"
"\n"
"Building must be exposed to space to function."
msgstr ""
"宇宙にある有望な小惑星を明らかにし、<link=\"DATABANK\">データバンク</link>を製造します。それも快適に！\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"ASTRONOMY\">天文学</link>スキルを持った複製人間を観測に従事させる必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"ひどい日焼けを完全に防ぎ、<link=\"RADIATION\">放射線</link>被曝を 50% に抑えます。\n"
"\n"
"機能するためには宇宙に面している必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED\">Enclosed Telescope</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED\">密閉型観測望遠鏡</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.REQUIREMENT_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CLUSTERTELESCOPEENCLOSED.REQUIREMENT_TOOLTIP"
msgid "A steady {0} supply is required to sustain working Duplicants."
msgstr "複製人間が働き続けるために、{0}の安定供給が必要です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2ENGINE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2ENGINE.DESC"
msgid "Rockets can be used to send Duplicants into space and retrieve rare resources."
msgstr "ロケットは複製人間を宇宙に送り出し、貴重な資源を回収します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2ENGINE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2ENGINE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Uses pressurized <link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">Carbon Dioxide</link> to propel rockets for short range space exploration.\n"
"\n"
"Carbon Dioxide Engines are relatively fast engine for their size but with limited height restrictions.\n"
"\n"
"Engine must be built via <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link>. \n"
"\n"
"Once the engine has been built, more rocket modules can be added."
msgstr ""
"圧縮された<link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">二酸化炭素</link>を活用し、宇宙探索ロケットの推進力とします。\n"
"\n"
"二酸化炭素エンジンは大きさの割に高速なエンジンですが、ロケットの全長に制限があります。\n"
"\n"
"ロケットのエンジンは<link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">ロケット発射台</link>経由で建築する必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"一度エンジンが建築されれば、さらなるロケットモジュールが追加できます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2ENGINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2ENGINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CO2ENGINE\">Carbon Dioxide Engine</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CO2ENGINE\">二酸化炭素エンジン</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2SCRUBBER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2SCRUBBER.DESC"
msgid "Skimmers remove large amounts of carbon dioxide, but produce no breathable air."
msgstr "炭素スキマーは二酸化炭素を大量に除去しますが、呼吸可能な気体は生産しません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2SCRUBBER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2SCRUBBER.EFFECT"
msgid "Uses <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> to filter <link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">Carbon Dioxide</link> from the air."
msgstr "<link=\"WATER\">水</link>を使って空気中の<link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">二酸化炭素</link>を濾過します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2SCRUBBER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CO2SCRUBBER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CO2SCRUBBER\">Carbon Skimmer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CO2SCRUBBER\">炭素スキマー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMETDETECTOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMETDETECTOR.DESC"
msgid "Networks of many scanners will scan more efficiently than one on its own."
msgstr "多数のスキャナーを並べてネットワーク化すれば、単体のスキャナーよりも効果的に探査できます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMETDETECTOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMETDETECTOR.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> to its automation circuit when it detects incoming objects from space.\n"
"\n"
"Can be configured to detect incoming meteor showers or returning space rockets."
msgstr ""
"飛来物を検知すると<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>を論理回路に送信します。\n"
"\n"
"飛来する流星群と帰還してきたロケットのどちらを検知するか設定できます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMETDETECTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMETDETECTOR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COMETDETECTOR\">Space Scanner</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COMETDETECTOR\">宇宙スキャナー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.DESC"
msgid "At least one astronaut must be assigned to the command module to pilot a rocket."
msgstr "ロケットを操縦するためには、最低一人の宇宙飛行士を制御モジュールに割り当てる必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Contains passenger seating for Duplicant <link=\"ASTRONAUTING1\">Astronauts</link>.\n"
"\n"
"A Command Capsule must be the last module installed at the top of a rocket."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"ASTRONAUTING1\">宇宙飛行士</link>の複製人間が座れる席があります。\n"
"\n"
"制御カプセルはロケットの先端に取り付けなければなりません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH"
msgid "Launch Rocket"
msgstr "ロケット発射"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_ACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b>: Launch rocket"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>: ロケット発射"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_LAUNCH_INACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b>: Awaits launch command"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_off\">レッド</style></b>: 発射命令待ち"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY"
msgid "Rocket Checklist"
msgstr "ロケットチェックリスト"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_ACTIVE"
msgid "Sends a <b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b> when its rocket launch checklist is complete"
msgstr "ロケットチェックリストが全件消化済みの場合<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>になります"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.LOGIC_PORT_READY_INACTIVE"
msgid "Otherwise, sends a <b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b>"
msgstr "そうでない場合、<b><style=\"logic_off\">レッド</style></b>になります"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMMANDMODULE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COMMANDMODULE\">Command Capsule</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COMMANDMODULE\">制御カプセル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMPOST.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMPOST.DESC"
msgid "Composts safely deal with biological waste, producing fresh dirt."
msgstr "堆肥置き場は生物学的廃棄物を安全に処理し、新鮮な土を生産します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMPOST.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMPOST.EFFECT"
msgid "Reduces <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Polluted Dirt</link>, rotting <link=\"FOOD\">Foods</link>, and discarded organics down into <link=\"DIRT\">Dirt</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"TOXICSAND\">汚染土</link>、腐った<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>、有機廃棄物を<link=\"DIRT\">土</link>に分解します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMPOST.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COMPOST.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COMPOST\">Compost</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COMPOST\">堆肥置き場</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONDUIT.STATUS_ITEM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONDUIT.STATUS_ITEM.NAME"
msgid "Marked for Emptying"
msgstr "掃除用にマーク済"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONDUIT.STATUS_ITEM.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONDUIT.STATUS_ITEM.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Awaiting a <link=\"PLUMBER\">Plumber</link> to clear this pipe"
msgstr "配管掃除のために<link=\"PLUMBER\">配管工</link>を待っています"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE.DESC"
msgid "It can transfer heat effectively even if no liquid is passing through."
msgstr "熱を受け取る液体が無い場合でも高効率の熱交換ができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Carries <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link>, allowing extreme <link=\"HEAT\">Temperature</link> exchange with overlapping buildings.\n"
"\n"
"Can function in a vacuum.\n"
"\n"
"Can be run through wall and floor tiles."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液体</link>を通し、重なった設備と<link=\"HEAT\">温度</link>を交換します。\n"
"\n"
"真空でも機能します。\n"
"\n"
"壁や床タイルの裏にも貼ることができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE\">Conduction Panel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CONTACTCONDUCTIVEPIPEBRIDGE\">伝導パネル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COOKINGSTATION.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COOKINGSTATION.DESC"
msgid "Proper cooking eliminates foodborne disease and produces tasty, stress-relieving meals."
msgstr "料理することで食品由来の病気を排除し、温かく美味しい食事を生産します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COOKINGSTATION.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COOKINGSTATION.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Cooks a wide variety of improved <link=\"FOOD\">Foods</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued."
msgstr ""
"改善された様々な<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>を調理します。\n"
"\n"
"レシピがセットされていないと複製人間は製作作業をしません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COOKINGSTATION.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COOKINGSTATION.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COOKINGSTATION\">Electric Grill</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COOKINGSTATION\">電気グリル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.DESC"
msgid "Corner trim is a purely decorative addition for ceiling corners."
msgstr "コーナー縁は天井の隅を飾り付けることができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Used to decorate the ceiling corners of rooms.\n"
"\n"
"Increases <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>, contributing to <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>."
msgstr ""
"天井の隅を飾り付けるために使えます。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"DECOR\">装飾値</link>を増加させ、<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>を高めます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CORNERMOULDING.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CORNERMOULDING.DESC"
msgid "It really dresses up a ceiling corner."
msgstr "天井の隅をとても華やかにします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CORNERMOULDING.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CORNERMOULDING.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">Corner Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">コーナー縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.DESC"
msgid "Why deck the halls, when you could <i>festoon</i> them?"
msgstr "ホール自体を飾り付けられるのに、何故飾るのですか？"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">Fancy Bug Corner Garland</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">ファンシーバグ コーナー用花輪</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CORNERMOULDING.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">Corner Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">コーナー縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.DESC"
msgid "Planetariums allow the simulated exploration of locations discovered with a telescope."
msgstr "仮想プラネタリウムは観測望遠鏡で発見した宙域の探索シミュレートを可能とします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Conducts <link=\"RESEARCH\">Interstellar Research</link> to unlock new technologies.\n"
"\n"
"Consumes data from <link=\"RESEARCHMODULE\">Research Modules</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Assigned Duplicants must possess the <link=\"ASTRONOMY\">Astronomy</link> skill."
msgstr ""
"新たな技術を開発するために、<link=\"RESEARCH\">星間研究</link>を行います。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"RESEARCHMODULE\">研究モジュール</link>から取得したデータを消費します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"ASTRONOMY\">天文学</link>スキルを持った複製人間を研究に従事させる必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COSMICRESEARCHCENTER\">Virtual Planetarium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COSMICRESEARCHCENTER\">仮想プラネタリウム</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.DESC"
msgid "Crafting stations allow Duplicants to make oxygen masks to wear in low breathability areas."
msgstr "工作端末は呼吸困難な場所で着用するための酸素マスクを複製人間が作成できるようになります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Produces items and equipment for Duplicant use.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued."
msgstr ""
"複製人間が着用するための装備やアイテムを製造します。\n"
"\n"
"レシピがセットされていないと複製人間は製造作業をしません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">Crafting Station</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">工作端末</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRAFTINGTABLE.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Converts {0} to {1}"
msgstr "{0}から{1}を製作します"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREAIRTRAP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREAIRTRAP.DESC"
msgid "It needs to be armed prior to use."
msgstr "使用するには事前に準備しておく必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREAIRTRAP.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREAIRTRAP.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Attracts and captures airborne <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Only Duplicants with the <link=\"RANCHING1\">Critter Ranching I</link> skill can arm this trap. It's reusable!"
msgstr ""
"浮遊<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>をおびき寄せ、捕獲します。\n"
"\n"
"この罠を準備できるのは、<link=\"RANCHING1\">畜産 I</link>スキルを習得済みの複製人間だけです。再利用可能！"

# Airborne Critter Bait から名称変更された
#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREAIRTRAP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREAIRTRAP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CREATUREAIRTRAP\">Airborne Critter Trap</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CREATUREAIRTRAP\">浮遊動物捕獲罠</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT.DESC"
msgid "Duplicants automatically bring captured critters to these relocation points for release."
msgstr "複製人間は捕獲した動物をこの場所へ放ちます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Releases trapped <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> back into the world.\n"
"\n"
"Can be used multiple times."
msgstr ""
"捕獲した<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>を自然へ帰します。\n"
"\n"
"何度でも使うことができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT\">Critter Drop-Off</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CREATUREDELIVERYPOINT\">動物解放地点</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREFEEDER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREFEEDER.DESC"
msgid "Wild critters who use feeders get accustomed to the cushiness of domesticated life."
msgstr "給餌機を使う野生動物は、飼い慣らされた生活に適応します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREFEEDER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREFEEDER.EFFECT"
msgid "Automatically dispenses food for hungry <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link>."
msgstr "お腹を空かせた<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>に自動で餌をやります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREFEEDER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREFEEDER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CREATUREFEEDER\">Critter Feeder</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CREATUREFEEDER\">給餌機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREGROUNDTRAP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREGROUNDTRAP.DESC"
msgid "It's designed for land critters, but flopping fish sometimes find their way in too."
msgstr "陸上動物用に設計されていますが、時折ぴちぴち跳ねる魚も入ってきます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREGROUNDTRAP.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREGROUNDTRAP.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Captures a living <link=\"CREATURES\">Critter</link> for transport.\n"
"\n"
"Only Duplicants with the <link=\"RANCHING1\">Critter Ranching I</link> skill can arm this trap. It's reusable!"
msgstr ""
"運搬のために<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>を捕獲します。\n"
"\n"
"この罠を準備できるのは、<link=\"RANCHING1\">畜産 I</link>スキルを習得済みの複製人間だけです。再利用可能！"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREGROUNDTRAP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATUREGROUNDTRAP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CREATUREGROUNDTRAP\">Critter Trap</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CREATUREGROUNDTRAP\">動物捕獲罠</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATURETRAP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATURETRAP.DESC"
msgid "Critter traps cannot catch swimming or flying critters."
msgstr "罠は遊泳動物、浮遊動物を捕獲できません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATURETRAP.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATURETRAP.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Captures a living <link=\"CREATURES\">Critter</link> for transport.\n"
"\n"
"Single use."
msgstr ""
"運搬のために<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>を捕獲します。\n"
"\n"
"使い切りです。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATURETRAP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CREATURETRAP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CREATURETRAP\">Critter Trap</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CREATURETRAP\">動物捕獲罠</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERCONDO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERCONDO.DESC"
msgid "It's nice to have nice things."
msgstr "素敵なものがあると嬉しいですね。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERCONDO.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERCONDO.EFFECT"
msgid "Provides a comfortable lounge area that boosts domesticated <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters'</link> happiness."
msgstr "<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>の幸福感を上昇させる快適なラウンジエリアを供給します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERCONDO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERCONDO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRITTERCONDO\">Critter Condo</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRITTERCONDO\">動物ハウス</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.DESC"
msgid "Duplicants automatically bring captured critters to these relocation points for release."
msgstr "複製人間は捕獲した動物をこの場所へ放ちます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Releases trapped <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> back into the world.\n"
"\n"
"Monitoring and drop-off are limited to the specified species."
msgstr ""
"捕獲した<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>を自然へ帰します。\n"
"\n"
"観測および解放は特定の種に限定されています。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.LOGIC_INPUT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.LOGIC_INPUT.DESC"
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "有効化/無効化"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b>: Enable critter drop-off"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>: 動物の解放を有効化"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b>: Disable critter drop-off"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_off\">レッド</style></b>: 動物の解放を無効化"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERDROPOFF.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRITTERDROPOFF\">Critter Drop-Off</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRITTERDROPOFF\">動物解放地点</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.DESC"
msgid "Duplicants will automatically wrangle excess critters."
msgstr "複製人間は過多となった動物を自動的に縄掛けします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Ensures the prompt relocation of <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> that exceed the maximum amount set.\n"
"\n"
"Monitoring and pick-up are limited to the specified species."
msgstr ""
"設定された最大頭数を超えた<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>が速やかに再配置されるようにします。\n"
"\n"
"観測および解放は特定の種に限定されています。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.LOGIC_INPUT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.LOGIC_INPUT.DESC"
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "有効化/無効化"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b>: Wrangle excess critters"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>: 過多となった動物を縄掛けする"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.LOGIC_INPUT.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b>: Ignore excess critters"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_off\">レッド</style></b>: 過多となった動物を放置する"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRITTERPICKUP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRITTERPICKUP\">Critter Pick-Up</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRITTERPICKUP\">動物捕捉地点</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.DESC"
msgid "Ceiling trim is a purely decorative addition to one's overhead area."
msgstr "廻り縁は天井の隅を飾り付けることができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Used to decorate the ceilings of rooms.\n"
"\n"
"Increases <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>, contributing to <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>."
msgstr ""
"天井を飾り付けるために使えます。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"DECOR\">装飾値</link>を増加させ、<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>を高めます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CROWNMOULDING.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CROWNMOULDING.DESC"
msgid "Ceiling trim is a purely decorative addition to one's overhead area."
msgstr "廻り縁は頭上の領域を純粋に飾るための追加物です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CROWNMOULDING.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.DEFAULT_CROWNMOULDING.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">Ceiling Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">廻り縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.DESC"
msgid "Someone spent their entire weekend gluing ribbons to paper Shine Bug cut-outs, and it shows."
msgstr "シャインバグの切り抜きにリボンをくっつける作業に週末を費やした人が居るようです。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.FACADES.SHINEORNAMENTS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">Fancy Bug Ceiling Garland</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">ファンシーバグ 廻り縁用花輪</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CROWNMOULDING.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">Ceiling Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">廻り縁</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.DEFROSTBUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.DEFROSTBUTTON"
msgid "Defrost Friend"
msgstr "友達を解凍"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.DEFROSTBUTTONTOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.DEFROSTBUTTONTOOLTIP"
msgid "A new pal is just an icebreaker away"
msgstr "新人は緊張を解きほぐしています"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.DESC"
msgid ""
"The tank appears impossibly old, but smells crisp and brand new.\n"
"\n"
"A silhouette just barely visible through the frost of the glass."
msgstr ""
"タンクは極めて古びて見えますが、爽やかで真新しい匂いがします。\n"
"\n"
"凍り付いたガラスを通し、辛うじてシルエットが確認できます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CRYOTANK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRYOTANK\">Cryotank 3000</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRYOTANK\">クリオタンク 3000</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.DESC"
msgid "Data banks can also be used to program robo-pilot rocket modules."
msgstr "データバンクは、ロケットのロボ操縦士モジュールをプログラムするために使用することもできます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Mass-produces <link=\"DATABANK\">Data Banks</link> that can be processed into <link=\"RESEARCHDLC1\">Data Analysis Research</link> points.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"RESEARCHDLC1\">データ分析研究</link>を進めるための<link=\"DATABANK\">データバンク</link>を量産します。\n"
"\n"
"レシピがセットされていないと複製人間は製作作業をしません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DATAMINER\">Data Miner</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DATAMINER\">データマイナー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DATAMINER.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Turns {0} into {1}."
msgstr "{0}を{1}にします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER.DESC"
msgid "Don't forget to decontaminate behind your ears."
msgstr "耳の後ろも忘れずに除染してください。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Uses <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> to remove <link=\"DISEASE\">Germs</link> and <link=\"RADIATION\">Radiation</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Decontaminates both Duplicants and their <link=\"EQUIPMENT\">Clothing</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"WATER\">水</link>を使って<link=\"DISEASE\">病原菌</link>と<link=\"RADIATION\">放射能</link>を除去します。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間および<link=\"EQUIPMENT\">衣類</link>を除染します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER\">Decontamination Shower</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DECONTAMINATIONSHOWER\">除染シャワー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.DESC"
msgid "Everything tastes better when it's deep-fried."
msgstr "何でも揚げ物にすると美味しくなります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Uses <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link> to cook a wide variety of improved <link=\"FOOD\">Foods</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued."
msgstr ""
"改善された様々な<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>を調理するために<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>を使用します。\n"
"\n"
"レシピがセットされていないと複製人間は製作作業をしません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DEEPFRYER\">Deep Fryer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DEEPFRYER\">フライヤー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.STATUSITEMS.OUTSIDE_KITCHEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.STATUSITEMS.OUTSIDE_KITCHEN.NAME"
msgid "Outside of Kitchen"
msgstr "キッチン外設置"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.STATUSITEMS.OUTSIDE_KITCHEN.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEEPFRYER.STATUSITEMS.OUTSIDE_KITCHEN.TOOLTIP"
msgid "This building must be in a Kitchen before it can be used"
msgstr "この設備を使用するには、キッチン内に設置する必要があります"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DESALINATOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DESALINATOR.DESC"
msgid "Salt can be refined into table salt for a mealtime morale boost."
msgstr "塩は食事中の士気向上につながる食卓塩へ精製することができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DESALINATOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DESALINATOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Removes <link=\"SALT\">Salt</link> from <link=\"BRINE\">Brine</link> or <link=\"SALTWATER\">Salt Water</link>, producing <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"BRINE\">濃塩水</link>または<link=\"SALTWATER\">塩水</link>から<link=\"SALT\">塩分</link>を除去し、<link=\"WATER\">水</link>を生産します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DESALINATOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DESALINATOR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DESALINATOR\">Desalinator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DESALINATOR\">淡水化装置</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVGENERATOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVGENERATOR.DESC"
msgid "Runs on coffee."
msgstr "コーヒーで駆動します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVGENERATOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVGENERATOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates testing power for late nights."
msgstr "夜遅くまでテスト用電力を生成します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVGENERATOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVGENERATOR.NAME"
msgid "Dev Generator"
msgstr "開発者用 発電機"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEATER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEATER.DESC"
msgid "Did someone touch the thermostat?"
msgstr "誰かがサーモスタットに触れましたか？"

# Toasty surroundings: 暑苦しい環境
#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEATER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEATER.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates on-demand heat for testing toastiness."
msgstr "必要な量の熱を生成して、暑苦しい環境をテストします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEATER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEATER.NAME"
msgid "Dev Heater"
msgstr "開発者用 ヒーター"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.DESC"
msgid "Radbolts are necessary for producing Materials Science research."
msgstr "RADボルトは材料工学の研究に必要です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates Radbolts."
msgstr "RADボルトを生成します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.LOGIC_PORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.LOGIC_PORT"
msgid "Do not emit Radbolts"
msgstr "RADボルトを投射しない"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.LOGIC_PORT_ACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_on\">Green Signal</style></b>: Emit Radbolts"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_on\">グリーン</style></b>: RADボルトを投射する"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.LOGIC_PORT_INACTIVE"
msgid "<b><style=\"logic_off\">Red Signal</style></b>: Do not emit Radbolts"
msgstr "<b><style=\"logic_off\">レッド</style></b>: RADボルトを投射しない"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVHEPSPAWNER.NAME"
msgid "Dev Radbolt Generator"
msgstr "開発者用 RADボルト生成装置"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIFESUPPORT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIFESUPPORT.DESC"
msgid "Keeps Duplicants cozy and breathing."
msgstr "複製人間達に居心地の良さと快適な空気を提供します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIFESUPPORT.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIFESUPPORT.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates warm, oxygen-rich air."
msgstr "暖かく酸素が豊富な空気を生成します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIFESUPPORT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIFESUPPORT.NAME"
msgid "Dev Life Support"
msgstr "開発者用 生命維持装置"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.BRIGHTNESS_LABEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.BRIGHTNESS_LABEL"
msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "明るさ"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.DESC"
msgid "Brightens up a dev's darkest hours."
msgstr "開発者の最も暗い時間帯を照らします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates dimmable light on demand."
msgstr "オンデマンドで調光可能な光を生成します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.FALLOFF_LABEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.FALLOFF_LABEL"
msgid "Falloff Rate"
msgstr "減衰率"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.NAME"
msgid "Dev Light Source"
msgstr "開発者用 光源"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.RANGE_LABEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVLIGHTGENERATOR.RANGE_LABEL"
msgid "Range"
msgstr "範囲"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPGAS.DESC"
msgid "Piping a pump's output to a building's intake will send gas to that building."
msgstr "設置された場所の空気を吸気口から吸い込み、他の設備の出力に移送します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPGAS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPGAS.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Draws in <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gas</link> and runs it through <link=\"GASPIPING\">Pipes</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be immersed in <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gas</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>を吸い上げ、<link=\"GASPIPING\">パイプ</link>へ流します。\n"
"\n"
"周囲に<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>が必要です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPGAS.NAME"
msgid "Dev Pump Gas"
msgstr "開発者用 気体ポンプ"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPLIQUID.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPLIQUID.DESC"
msgid "Piping a pump's output to a building's intake will send liquid to that building."
msgstr "設置された場所の液体を給水口から吸い込み、他の設備の出力に移送します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPLIQUID.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPLIQUID.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Draws in <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> and runs it through <link=\"LIQUIDPIPING\">Pipes</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be submerged in <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液体</link>を吸い上げ、<link=\"LIQUIDCONDUIT\">パイプ</link>へ流します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液体</link>の中に沈めなければなりません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPLIQUID.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPLIQUID.NAME"
msgid "Dev Pump Liquid"
msgstr "開発者用 液体ポンプ"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPSOLID.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPSOLID.DESC"
msgid "Piping a pump's output to a building's intake will send solids to that building."
msgstr "ポンプの出力を設備の入力に繋げると、設備に固体が送られるようになります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPSOLID.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPSOLID.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates chosen <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid Materials</link> and runs it through <link=\"SOLIDCONDUIT\">Conveyor Rail</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SOLIDCONDUIT\">コンベアレール</link>上の<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固形素材</link>を自身の内容物として受け取ります"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPSOLID.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVPUMPSOLID.NAME"
msgid "Dev Pump Solid"
msgstr "開発者用 固体ポンプ"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVRADIATIONGENERATOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVRADIATIONGENERATOR.DESC"
msgid "That's some <i>strong</i> coffee."
msgstr "とても<i>濃い</i>コーヒーです。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVRADIATIONGENERATOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVRADIATIONGENERATOR.EFFECT"
msgid "Generates on-demand radiation to keep things clear. <i>Nu-</i>clear."
msgstr "必要な量の放射線を生成し、クリアな状態を保ちます。ニュークリア。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVRADIATIONGENERATOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DEVRADIATIONGENERATOR.NAME"
msgid "Dev Radiation Emitter"
msgstr "開発者用 放射線源"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.DESC"
msgid "Crushes refined carbon into diamond."
msgstr "石炭を砕いてダイヤモンドにします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Uses <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> and <link=\"RADIATION\">Radbolts</link> to crush <link=\"REFINEDCARBON\">Refined Carbon</link> into <link=\"DIAMOND\">Diamond</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued and <link=\"REFINEDCARBON\">Refined Carbon</link> has been discovered."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>と<link=\"RADIATION\">RADボルト</link>を使い、<link=\"REFINEDCARBON\">精錬炭素</link>を砕いて<link=\"DIAMOND\">ダイヤモンド</link>にします。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"REFINEDCARBON\">精錬炭素</link>が発見済みで、レシピがセットされていないと複製人間は製作作業をしません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DIAMONDPRESS\">Diamond Press</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DIAMONDPRESS\">ダイヤモンドプレス機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.REFINED_CARBON_RECIPE_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIAMONDPRESS.REFINED_CARBON_RECIPE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Converts {1} to {0}"
msgstr "{1}を{0}に変換します"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DININGTABLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DININGTABLE.DESC"
msgid "Duplicants prefer to dine at a table, rather than eat off the floor."
msgstr "複製人間は床よりも食卓で食事を取ることを好みます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DININGTABLE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DININGTABLE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Gives one Duplicant a place to eat.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will automatically eat at their assigned table when hungry."
msgstr ""
"複製人間に食事場所を与えます。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間は空腹時に割り当てられたテーブルで食事をとります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DININGTABLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DININGTABLE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DININGTABLE\">Mess Table</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DININGTABLE\">食卓</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID.DESC"
msgid "Channels move more volume than pumps and require no power, but need sufficient pressure to function."
msgstr "チャネルはポンプより大量の液体を汲み上げることができ、電源を必要としません。しかし、機能するためには十分な圧力が必要です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Directionally moves large volumes of <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">LIQUID</link> through a channel.\n"
"\n"
"Can be used as floor tile and rotated before construction."
msgstr ""
"チャネルを通して大量の<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液体</link>を一方向に流します。\n"
"\n"
"床材としても使用でき、建築する前に向きを変えることができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID\">Liquid Channel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DIRECTIONALWORLDPUMPLIQUID\">液体チャネル</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DISTILLATIONCOLUMN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DISTILLATIONCOLUMN.DESC"
msgid "Gets hot and steamy."
msgstr "蒸し暑くなってきた。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DISTILLATIONCOLUMN.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DISTILLATIONCOLUMN.EFFECT"
msgid "Separates any <link=\"DIRTYWATER\">Contaminated Water</link> piped through it into <link=\"STEAM\">Steam</link> and <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Polluted Dirt</link>."
msgstr "パイプを通して送られた<link=\"DIRTYWATER\">汚染水</link>を<link=\"STEAM\">蒸気</link>と<link=\"TOXICSAND\">汚染土</link>に分離します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DISTILLATIONCOLUMN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DISTILLATIONCOLUMN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DISTILLATIONCOLUMN\">Distillation Column</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DISTILLATIONCOLUMN\">蒸留塔</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.DESC"
msgid "Planetariums allow the simulated exploration of locations recorded in <link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHDATABANK\">Data Banks</link>."
msgstr "プラネタリウムは<link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHDATABANK\">データバンク</link>に記録された宙域の探索シミュレートを可能にします。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Conducts <link=\"RESEARCH\">Data Analysis Research</link> to unlock new technologies.\n"
"\n"
"Consumes <link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHDATABANK\">Data Banks</link> generated by exploration."
msgstr ""
"新たな技術を開発するために、<link=\"RESEARCH\">データ分析研究</link>を行います。\n"
"\n"
"探索によって得られた<link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHDATABANK\">データバンク</link>を消費します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER\">Virtual Planetarium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DLC1COSMICRESEARCHCENTER\">仮想プラネタリウム</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC2POITECHUNLOCKS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.DLC2POITECHUNLOCKS.DESC"
msgid ""
"A functional research decrypter with one transmission remaining.\n"
"\n"
"It was designed to support colony survival."
msgstr ""
"あと1回送信が可能な研究用解読器です。\n"
"\n"
"コロニーの生存をサポートするために設計されました。"

