#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MILKPRESS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MILKPRESS.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Crushes organic materials to extract liquids such as <link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link> or <link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</link>.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link> can be used to refill the <link=\"MILKFEEDER\">Critter Fountain</link>."
msgstr ""
"有機素材を砕いて<link=\"MILK\">モー乳</link>や<link=\"PHYTOOIL\">植物油</link>を抽出します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MILK\">モー乳</link>は<link=\"MILKFEEDER\">動物用噴水</link>に使うことができます。"

