#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SETLOCKER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SETLOCKER.DESC"
msgid ""
"A basic metal locker.\n"
"\n"
"It contains an assortment of personal effects."
msgstr ""
"基本的な金属製のロッカー。\n"
"\n"
"私物の類が入っている。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SETLOCKER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SETLOCKER.NAME"
msgid "Locker"
msgstr "ロッカー"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHEARINGSTATION.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHEARINGSTATION.DESC"
msgid "Those critters aren't gonna shear themselves."
msgstr "これらの動物は自ら換毛することはありません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHEARINGSTATION.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHEARINGSTATION.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Shearing stations allow eligible <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> to be safely sheared for useful raw materials.\n"
"\n"
"Visiting this building restores <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters'</link> physical and emotional well-being."
msgstr ""
"毛刈り端末は、適格な<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>を安全に毛刈りし、有用な原材料を得ることができます。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>がこの設備を訪れると、身体的および精神的な健康が回復します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHEARINGSTATION.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHEARINGSTATION.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SHEARINGSTATION\">Shearing Station</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SHEARINGSTATION\">毛刈り端末</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHELF.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHELF.DESC"
msgid "It looks great even when it's empty."
msgstr "空っぽの状態でも素晴らしく見えます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHELF.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHELF.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Displays cherished items and increases <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>, contributing to <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be installed on a back wall."
msgstr ""
"大事な品を展示することで<link=\"DECOR\">装飾値</link>を増加させ、<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>を高めます。\n"
"\n"
"裏壁に設置する必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHELF.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHELF.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SHELF\">Display Shelf</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SHELF\">陳列棚</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHOWER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHOWER.DESC"
msgid "Regularly showering will prevent Duplicants spreading germs to the things they touch."
msgstr "シャワーの習慣は複製人間があちこち触ることによる病原菌の蔓延を防ぎます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHOWER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHOWER.EFFECT"
msgid "Improves Duplicant <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> and removes surface <link=\"DISEASE\">Germs</link>."
msgstr "複製人間の<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>を改善し、表面上の<link=\"DISEASE\">病原菌</link>を除去します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHOWER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SHOWER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SHOWER\">Shower</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SHOWER\">シャワー</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SINGLEPLAYERARCADE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SINGLEPLAYERARCADE.DESC"
msgid "Space Brawler IV! For one player."
msgstr "スペースブラウラー４！一人用です。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SINGLEPLAYERARCADE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SINGLEPLAYERARCADE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Allows a Duplicant to play video games solo on their breaks.\n"
"\n"
"Increases Duplicant <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>."
msgstr ""
"休憩中に複製人間がビデオゲームで遊ぶことができます。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間の<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>を高めます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SINGLEPLAYERARCADE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SINGLEPLAYERARCADE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SINGLEPLAYERARCADE\">Single Player Arcade</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SINGLEPLAYERARCADE\">一人用アーケード</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.DESC"
msgid "What Duplicant doesn't love playing with mud?"
msgstr "泥んこ遊びが嫌いな複製人間が居ますか？"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Separates <link=\"MUD\">Mud</link> and other sludges into their base elements.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"MUD\">泥</link>と他の沈殿物を基本元素に分離します。\n"
"\n"
"レシピがセットされていないと複製人間は製作作業をしません。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SLUDGEPRESS\">Sludge Press</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SLUDGEPRESS\">泥プレス機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SLUDGEPRESS.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Separates {0} into its base elements."
msgstr "{0}を基本元素に分離します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER.DESC"
msgid "A small standalone power center that can be mounted on the floor or wall."
msgstr "床や壁に取り付けることができる小型のスタンドアロン電源センターです。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER.EFFECT"
msgid "Converts stored energy from <link=\"ELECTROBANK\">Power Banks</link> into power for connected buildings."
msgstr "<link=\"ELECTROBANK\">電力バンク</link>内のエネルギーを接続先の設備の電力へと変換します。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER\">Compact Discharger</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMALLELECTROBANKDISCHARGER\">コンパクト放電器</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.DESC"
msgid "Solid oxidizers allows rocket fuel to be efficiently burned in the vacuum of space."
msgstr "固形酸化剤は真空の宇宙空間で効率よく燃料を燃焼させることができます。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Stores <link=\"FERTILIZER\">Fertilizer</link> and <link=\"OXYROCK\">Oxylite</link> for burning rocket fuels. \n"
"\n"
"Must be built via <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link>."
msgstr ""
"ロケット燃料を燃焼させる酸化剤として、<link=\"FERTILIZER\">肥料</link>と<link=\"OXYROCK\">オキシライト</link>を格納します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">ロケット発射台</link>経由で建築する必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMALLOXIDIZERTANK\">Small Solid Oxidizer Tank</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMALLOXIDIZERTANK\">小型固体酸化剤タンク</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.UI_FILTER_CATEGORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLOXIDIZERTANK.UI_FILTER_CATEGORY"
msgid "Accepted Oxidizers"
msgstr "積載済み酸化剤"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLSCULPTURE.AVERAGEQUALITYNAME
