msgstr "<link=\"SCULPTURE1X2AMAZING5\">尖った不可能性</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.SMALLSCULPTURE.FACADES.SCULPTURE_1x2_AMAZING_6.DESC
