#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]\n"
"[Voice Recognition Unavailable]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...The Hatch has been selected for development due to its naturally wide range of potential food sources.\n"
"\n"
"Energy production is our primary goal, but augmentation to allow for the consumption of non-organic materials is a more attainable first step, and will have additional uses for waste disposal...\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[ログ断片検出]\n"
"[音声認識利用不可]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...ハッチは、始めから食料源として幅広い可能性を秘めていたことから、開発対象に選ばれた。\n"
"\n"
"エネルギー生産が我々の主たる目標だが、非有機素材の消化を実現すれば達成可能な成果の上積みとして最初の一歩となる。さらには、廃棄物の処理にも利用できるだろう...\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...The Morb has been selected for development based on its ability to perform a multitude of the waste breakdown functions typical for a healthy ecosystem.\n"
"\n"
"Design should focus on eliminating the disease risks posed by a fully matured Morb specimen...\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...モーブは、健全な生態系に要する多くの典型的な廃棄物分解機能を備えていることから、開発対象に選ばれた。\n"
"\n"
"完全に成体となったモーブ検体が及ぼす病気リスクを排除することに注力して設計すべきで...\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid ""
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...The Puft may be suited for serving a sustainable decontamination role.\n"
"\n"
"Potential design must focus on the efficiency of these processes...\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...パフは、持続的な汚染除去の役割を果たすのに適しているかもしれない。\n"
"\n"
"潜在能力の設計は、そうした工程の効率化に注力しなければならず...\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER4"
msgid ""
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...Wheezeworts are an ideal selection due to their low nutrient requirements and natural terraforming capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"Design of these creatures should focus on enhancing their natural influence on ambient temperatures...\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...ウィーズウォートは、必要な栄養素が少なく天然のテラフォーミング作用があるため、理想的な選択であると言える。\n"
"\n"
"この生物の設計は、周辺温度への自然的影響を強化することに注力すべきで...\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER5"
msgid ""
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...The preliminary Hatch gene splices were successful.\n"
"\n"
"The prolific mucus excretions that are typical of the species are now producing hydrocarbons at an incredible pace.\n"
"\n"
"The creature has essentially become a free source of burnable oil...\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...予備実験におけるハッチの遺伝子組み換えはうまくいった。\n"
"\n"
"この種の特徴である多量の粘液状排泄物は、現在驚異的な速さで炭化水素を生成している。\n"
"\n"
"この生物は、実質的に無尽蔵の燃料供給源となり...\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER6"
msgid ""
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...Bioluminescence is always a novelty, but little time should be spent on perfecting these insects from here on out.\n"
"\n"
"The project has more pressing concerns than light sources, particularly now that the low light vegetation issue has been solved...\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...生物発光は常に目新しいテーマだが、これらの昆虫を完成させるのに費やす時間はほとんどないだろう。\n"
"\n"
"このプロジェクトは光源よりも差し迫った問題を孕んでいる。特に、低光量環境下での植生問題が解決された今は...\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER7
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_HUSBANDRYNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER7"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Voice Recognition Initialized]\n"
"[Subject Identified: B363]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"Geneticist: The primary concern raised by this project is the variability of environments that colonies may be forced to deal with. The creatures we send with the settlement party will not have the time to evolve and adapt to a new environment, yet each creature has been chosen to play a vital role in colony sustainability and is thus too precious to risk loss.\n"
"\n"
"Geneticist: It follows that each organism we design must be equipped with the tools to survive in as many volatile environments as we are capable of planning for. We should not rely on the Pod alone to replenish creature populations.\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr ""
"[音声認識初期化]\n"
"[対象認識: B363]\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"遺伝学者: このプロジェクトが孕む最大の懸念は、コロニーが対処を迫られるであろう環境の多様性です。我々が開拓団とともに送り出す生物には、新たな環境に適応して進化する時間などありません。しかし、それぞれの生物はコロニーの持続性に重要な役割を果たすべく選抜されたものであり、失うリスクを冒すにはあまりにも貴重すぎます。\n"
"\n"
"遺伝学者: つまり、我々が設計する各種生物は、計画しうる限りの厳しい環境下でも生存できるような手段を有していなければならないのです。個体数の維持を製造ポッドだけに頼るべきではありません。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]"

