#. STRINGS.CODEX.A4_CASUALFRIDAY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A4_CASUALFRIDAY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps><b>Casual Friday!</b>\n"
"From: <b>Admin</b> <alpha=#AA><admin@gravitas.nova></color>\n"
"To: <b>All</b></smallcaps>\n"
"------------------\n"
"\n"
"<indent=5%>To all employees;\n"
"\n"
"The facility is pleased to announced that starting this week, all Fridays will now be Casual Fridays!\n"
"\n"
"Please enjoy the clinically proven de-stressing benefits of casual attire by wearing your favorite shirt to the lab.\n"
"\n"
"<b>NOTE: Any personnel found on facility premises without regulation full body protection will be put on immediate notice.</b>\n"
"\n"
"Thank-you and have fun!\n"
"\n"
"-Admin\n"
"The Gravitas Facility</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps><b>カジュアルフライデー！</b>\n"
"From: <b>管理室</b> <alpha=#AA><admin@gravitas.nova></color>\n"
"To: <b>All</b></smallcaps>\n"
"------------------\n"
"\n"
"<indent=5%>全従業員の皆さんへ\n"
"\n"
"当研究所は今週より全ての金曜日をカジュアルフライデーとします。このことを皆さん告知できて嬉しく思います！\n"
"\n"
"カジュアルな服装によるストレス軽減効果は臨床的にも証明されています。ラボへ着ていくお気に入りのシャツを満喫しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"<b>注意: 施設内で規定の全身防護服を着用していない人員が発見された場合、直ちに通報されます。</b>\n"
"\n"
"ありがとう、楽しい金曜日を！\n"
"\n"
"-管理室\n"
"グラビタス研究所</indent>"

