#. STRINGS.CODEX.A5_THEJANITOR.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A5_THEJANITOR.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid "<indent=5%>Aw, he's really nice if you get to know him though. Really dependable too. One time I busted a wheel off my office chair and he got me a new one in like, two minutes. I think he's just sweaty because he works so hard.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>いやぁ、知り合いになれば良いやつさ。頼りになるしね。僕がオフィスの椅子の車輪をうっかり壊してしまった時なんか、2分くらいで新しいのを持ってきてくれたよ。汗っかきなのは一生懸命働いているからだと思うよ。</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A5_THEJANITOR.BODY.CONTAINER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A5_THEJANITOR.BODY.CONTAINER4"
msgid "<indent=5%>OMIGOSH have you seen our building's janitor? He totally smells and he has sweat stains under his armpits like EVERY time I see him. SO embarrassing.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>ねぇちょっと、ここの用務員にあったことある？完全に臭うし、会うたび<i>いつも</i>脇の下に汗染みができてるのよ。恥ずかしいったらないわ。</indent>"

