msgstr "適用可能性"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"The Director has suggested implanting artificial memories during print, but despite the great strides made in our research under her direction, such a thing can barely be considered more than a pipe dream.\n"
"\n"
"For the moment we remain focused on eliminating the remaining glitches in the system, as well as developing effective education and training routines for printed subjects.\n"
"\n"
"Suggest: Omega-3 supplements and mentally stimulating enclosure apparatuses to accompany tutelage.\n"
"\n"
"Dr. Broussard signing off.\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr ""
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"所長は複製の際に人工的な記憶を埋め込むよう提案しているが、彼女の指揮のもと研究が大きく進展しているにもかかわらず、そのようなことは夢物語に過ぎない。\n"
"\n"
"引き続き、当面はシステムの不具合を解消することに集中する。併せて、複製された被験者に対する効果的な教育および日常の訓練方法の確立も。\n"
"\n"
"指導の際にオメガ3系の栄養補助剤と、精神を賦活させる設備の利用を提案する。\n"
"\n"
"ブルサード博士、通信終わり。\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]"

