#. STRINGS.CODEX.B5_ANTS.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.B5_ANTS.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Voice Recognition Initialized]\n"
"[Subjects Identified: A001, B556]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"Technician: <i>Atta cephalotes</i>. What sort of experiment are you doing with these?\n"
"\n"
"Director: No experiment. I just find them interesting. Don't you?\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Not really?\n"
"\n"
"Director: You ought to. Very efficient. They perfected farming millions of years before humans.\n"
"\n"
"(sound of tapping on glass)\n"
"\n"
"Director: An entire colony led by and in service to its queen. Each organism knows its role.\n"
"\n"
"Tech: I have the results from the power tests, director.\n"
"\n"
"Director: And?\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Negative, ma'am.\n"
"\n"
"Director: I see. You know, another admirable quality of ants occurs to me. They can pull twenty times their own weight.\n"
"\n"
"Tech: I'm not sure I follow, ma'am.\n"
"\n"
"Director: Are you pulling your weight, Doctor?\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr ""
"[音声認識初期化]\n"
"[対象認識: A001, B556]\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"技術者: <i>Atta cephalotes</i>(ハキリアリ)。これを使ってどんな実験をしているんです？\n"
"\n"
"所長: 実験じゃないわ。とってもかわいいでしょう。そう思わない？\n"
"\n"
"技術者: いえ、まったく。\n"
"\n"
"所長: そう思うべきよ。とても効率的。彼らは人類より何百万年も前に農業を完成させていたのよ。\n"
"\n"
"(ガラスを叩く音)\n"
"\n"
"所長: コロニー全体は女王アリのためにある。それぞれの部門は自身の役目を知っている。彼らから学ぶことが1つか2つ、あるんじゃないかしら。\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 電力テストの結果をお持ちしました。所長。\n"
"\n"
"所長: それで？\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 失敗です。\n"
"\n"
"所長: 分かったわ。そうそう、アリのもう一つの素晴らしいところを思い出した。彼らは自身の体重の20倍もの重量を引っ張ることができるの、知ってた？\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 仰ることが良く分かりませんが...\n"
"\n"
"所長: 博士。あなた、自分の体重を持ち上げられる？\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]"

