#. STRINGS.CODEX.B7_FRIENDLYEMAIL.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.B7_FRIENDLYEMAIL.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>Omg, <i>hi</i> Nikola!\n"
"\n"
"Have you heard about the super weird thing that's been happening in the kitchen lately? Joshua's lunch has disappeared from the fridge like, every day for the past week!\n"
"\n"
"There's a <i>ton</i> of cameras in that room too but all anyone can see is like this spiky blond hair behind the fridge door.\n"
"\n"
"So <i>weird</i> right? ;)\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, totally unrelated, but our computer system's been having this <i>glitch</i> where datasets going back for like half a year get <i>totally</i> wiped for all employees with the initials \"N.T.\"\n"
"\n"
"Isn't it weird how specific that is? Don't worry though! I'm sure I'll have it fixed before it affects any of <i>your</i> work.\n"
"\n"
"Byeee!</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>オーマイガー、<i>こんにちは</i>ニコラ！\n"
"\n"
"最近台所で超絶ヘンなことがあったの知ってる？先週あたりから、冷蔵庫にあったジョシュアの昼飯が毎日無くなってるんだって！\n"
"\n"
"部屋にはカメラが<i>山ほど</i>仕掛けてあるけれど、誰の目にも冷蔵庫の扉の奥にトゲトゲした金髪みたいなのが見えるのよ。\n"
"\n"
"ヘンだと思わない？;)\n"
"\n"
"ともかく、これは全く無関係だと思うんだけど、グラビタスのコンピューターシステムに不具合があって、半年前のデータセットまで巻き戻ってしまって、イニシャルが N.T. の従業員データが全員分<i>ごっそり</i>消えちゃったのよ。\n"
"\n"
"狙いすましたみたいで、なんだか変じゃない？でも心配しないで！<i>あなたの</i>仕事に影響が出る前に、きっと直しておくから。\n"
"\n"
"じゃーねー！</indent>"

