#. STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Dasha Saltvine is a unique plant that needs large amounts of salt to balance the levels of water in its body.\n"
"\n"
"In order to keep a supply of salt on hand, the end of the vine is coated in microscopic formations which bind with sodium atoms, forming large crystals over time."
msgstr ""
"ダーシャ シオカズラは体内の水分レベルを調整するために大量の塩を必要とする、ユニークな植物です。\n"
"\n"
"塩の供給を維持するために、蔓の先端はナトリウム原子と結合する微細な構造で覆われており、時間の経過とともに大きな結晶を生じます。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Edible Spice Plant"
msgstr "食用香辛料"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DASHASALTVINE.TITLE"
msgid "Dasha Saltvine"
msgstr "ダーシャ シオカズラ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DATABANK.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DATABANK.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Data Banks are a form of portable storage media. They are prized for their non-volatility, robustness, and practical research applications.\n"
"\n"
"They are not foldable."
msgstr ""
"データバンクは持ち運びできる記憶媒体の一種です。不揮発性で堅牢性に優れ、研究の現場で重宝されています。\n"
"\n"
"折り畳み式ではありません。"

