#. STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>Pictured: \"Dense\" Puft variant</smallcaps>"
msgstr "<smallcaps>図: \"こってり\" パフ 変種</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"The Puft is an easy creature to raise for first time handlers given its wholly amiable disposition and suggestible nature.\n"
"\n"
"It is unusually tolerant of human handling and will allow itself to be patted or scratched nearly anywhere on its fuzzy body, including, unnervingly, directly on any of its three eyeballs."
msgstr ""
"パフはその人懐っこい性格と影響の受けやすさから、初めて触る人でも簡単に扱うことができます。\n"
"\n"
"人間からの扱われ方にとても耐性があり、綿毛状の体のどこでも(三つ目を直接触れても)叩く、ひっかくことを許容します。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Critter Morph"
msgstr "動物(変種)"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DENSE.TITLE"
msgid "Dense Puft"
msgstr "こってり パフ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIP.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIP.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"A crystallized blob of <link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link> from the <link=\"DEWDRIPPERPLANT\">Dew Dripper</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It must be processed at the <link=\"MILKPRESS\">Plant Pulverizer</link> to release its contents."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"DEWDRIPPERPLANT\">ツユシボリ</link>から抽出された、<link=\"MILK\">モー乳</link>の結晶です。\n"
"\n"
"中身を取り出すには、<link=\"MILKPRESS\">植物搾汁機</link>で処理する必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIP.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIP.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Plant Byproduct"
msgstr "植物の副産物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIP.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIP.TITLE"
msgid "Dewdrip"
msgstr "ツユシボリのツユ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIPPERPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIPPERPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Dew Dripper is sometimes referred to as the \"purple starling\" of the plant world for the magnificent feather-like leaves that encircle its base.\n"
"\n"
"This sculptural plant slow-drips excess sap that coagulates upon contact with air. The resulting globule is so dense that its weight would snap the Dew Dripper's hollow stem if planted in the ground.\n"
"\n"
"No one has ever been seriously injured by a falling Dewdrip, but it's best not to linger beneath them."
msgstr ""
"ツユシボリは、その根元を囲む羽根のような壮麗な葉から、植物界の「紫色のムクドリ」と呼ばれることもあります。\n"
"\n"
"この彫刻のような植物は、余分な樹液をゆっくりと滴らせ、空気に触れると凝固します。こうしてできた球状の液体は非常に密度が高く、地面に植えると中空の茎が折れてしまうほどです。\n"
"\n"
"ツユシボリのツユが落ちてきて重傷を負った人はいませんが、その下に長く留まらない方が賢明です。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIPPERPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIPPERPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Cultivable Plant"
msgstr "耕作植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIPPERPLANT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWDRIPPERPLANT.TITLE"
msgid "Dew Dripper"
msgstr "ツユシボリ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DEWPALM.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DEWPALM.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Gum Palms have developed an eye-catching defense mechanism similar to that of poisonous amphibians.\n"
"\n"
"Bright reddish coloring displayed in their leaves and sharp ornamental bark scales deter most predators, who recognize the warning signs of toxicity. <link=\"PACU\">Pacus</link>, however, consider the tree's highly toxic seed a spicy treat."
msgstr ""
"ゴムヤシは毒を持つ両生類に似た、人目を引く防御機構を発達させてきました。\n"
"\n"
"葉に見られる鮮やかな赤色と鋭く装飾的な樹皮の鱗片は毒性の警告サインとして認識され、ほとんどの捕食者を寄せ付けません。しかしパクー(Pacus)はこの木の非常に毒性の強い種子を刺激的なごちそうとして好むようです。"

