#. STRINGS.CODEX.DUSKCAP.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.DUSKCAP.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Like many species of mushroom, Dusk Caps thrive in dark areas otherwise ill-suited to the cultivation of plants.\n"
"\n"
"In place of typical chlorophyll, the underside of a Dusk Cap is fitted with thousands of specialized gills, which it uses to draw in carbon dioxide and aid in its growth."
msgstr ""
"他の多くのキノコと同様に、植物の栽培に適していない暗闇の中でダスク キャップは繁茂します。\n"
"\n"
"典型的な葉緑素の代わりに傘の下には何千もの特化したひだがあり、二酸化炭素を吸収し成長を促します。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.DUSKCAP.SUBTITLE
