msgstr "動物(変種)"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid ""
"Plants exposed to radiation sometimes drop mutated seeds when they are harvested. Each type of mutation has its own efficiencies and trade-offs.\n"
"\n"
"Mutated seeds can be planted once they have been analyzed in the <link=\"GENETICANALYSISSTATION\">Botanical Analyzer</link>, but the resulting plants will produce no seeds of their own unless they are uprooted.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"放射線を照射された植物は、収穫時に突然変異した種子を落とすことがあります。突然変異にはそれぞれ効率やトレードオフがあります。\n"
"\n"
"突然変異した種子は<link=\"GENETICANALYSISSTATION\">植物分析機</link>で分析することで植えることができますが、掘り起こさない限り新たに種子を生成することはありません。\n"
"\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid ""
"Once mutated seeds have been analyzed in the <link=\"GENETICANALYSISSTATION\">Botanical Analyzer</link>, they are ready to be planted. Continued exposure to naturally occurring radiation or a <link=\"RADIATIONLIGHT\">Radiation Lamp</link> is necessary to prevent wilting.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<link=\"GENETICANALYSISSTATION\">植物分析機</link>で分析された突然変異種子は植えることができます。萎れないようにするためには自然界に存在する放射線や<link=\"RADIATIONLIGHT\">放射線ランプ</link>が必要です。\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid ""
"Variations within a <link=\"CREATURES\">critter</link> species is common, and while they may share some similarities, different members of a species produce different resources and have their own distinct preferences regarding habitats, environmental <link=\"HEAT\">Temperature</link>, and diet.\n"
"\n"
"See the <link=\"CREATURES::GUIDE\">Field Guide</link> to learn more about caring for critters."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>の種には様々な変種が存在するのが一般的です。類似点もある一方で、同じ種でも個体によって生産する資源が異なり、生息地、環境の<link=\"HEAT\">温度</link>、そして食性に関してそれぞれ独自の好みを持っています。\n"
"\n"
"生き物の飼育について詳しくは、<link=\"CREATURES::GUIDE\">フィールドガイド</link>をご覧ください。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GENETICS.TITLE"
msgid "<link=\"GENETICS\">Genetics</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GENETICS\">遺伝学</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GINGER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GINGER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Tonic Root is a close relative of the zingiberaceae family commonly known as ginger. Its heavily burled shoots are typically light brown in colour, and enveloped in a thin layer of protective, edible bark."
msgstr "強壮ウコンは生姜として一般に知られているショウガ科の近縁種です。薄茶色の新芽は、食べられる薄皮で覆われています。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GINGER.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GINGER.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "In addition to its use as an aromatic culinary ingredient, it has traditionally been employed as a tonic for a variety of minor digestive ailments."
msgstr "香りのよい料理素材として使われる他、伝統的に軽微な消化器疾患の強壮剤として使われてきました。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GINGER.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GINGER.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid "Its stringy fibers can become irretrievably embedded between one's teeth during mastication."
msgstr "繊維が歯の間に挟まると、とんでもないことになります。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GINGER.SUBTITLE
