msgid "Grubfruit Plant"
msgstr "グラブフルーツ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.GUMWOOD.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.GUMWOOD.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Gum Wood is a flexible type of <link=\"WOODLOG\">Wood</link> with the unique sap that can be used in the production of <link=\"RUBBER\">Rubber</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Note that it is not <i>made</i> of rubber, and thus will not bounce when thrown."
msgstr ""
"ゴムウッドは独特の樹液を持つ柔軟な木材の一種で、ゴムの製造に利用できます。\n"
"\n"
"ただし、ゴムでできているわけではないので、投げても跳ね返りません。"

