#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Bammoth is one of the oldest species on record, with ancient skeletal remains dating back approximately 10,000 years.\n"
"\n"
"This placid herbivore is known for its unique body language: an angry young Bammoth expresses displeasure by flopping down dramatically in front of its opponent, while older creatures with limited mobility will sit facing away from the source of their annoyance.\n"
"\n"
"Licking the ground in front of a caregiver can be a sign of either deep affection or mineral deficiency."
msgstr ""
"バンモスは記録に残る最古の種の一つで、古代の骨格は約一万年前に遡ります。\n"
"\n"
"この穏やかな草食動物は独特のボディ ランゲージで知られています。怒った若いバンモスは相手の目の前で大げさに倒れ込むことで不快感を表現しますが、運動能力が制限されている年長の動物は不快感の原因から背を向けて座ります。\n"
"\n"
"世話をする人の前で地面を舐めるのは深い愛情またはミネラル欠乏の兆候である可能性があります。"

