msgstr "バンモス"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Idylla Flowers are a rare species of everblooms that thrive with very little care, making them a perennial favorite among newbie gardeners.\n"
"\n"
"Their springy blossoms can be 'bopped' gently for sensory entertainment, but hands should be washed immediately as the petal residue can permanently stain most textiles."
msgstr ""
"ボッカはほとんど手入れをしなくてもよく育つ珍しい常緑樹で、初心者の園芸愛好家の間では長年愛されています。\n"
"\n"
"弾力のある花は感覚的に楽しむために優しく「叩く」ことができますが、花びらが衣類に付くと洗濯しても落ちないシミになるので、すぐに手を洗うようにしてください。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "観葉植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.TITLE"
msgid "Idylla Flower"
msgstr "ボッカ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"A supplement that significantly reduces the chance of contracting a <style=\"KKeyword\">Germ</style>-based <link=\"DISEASE\">Disease</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be taken daily."
msgstr ""
"<style=\"KKeyword\">病原菌</style>由来の<link=\"DISEASE\">病気</link>にかかる可能性を著しく減少させるサプリメントです。\n"
"\n"
"毎日飲む必要があります。"

