#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>Fascinating. I had not expected him to score quite so highly, but he <i>is</i> uncommonly charismatic.\n"
"\n"
"If I can secure a replacement, perhaps he can be of service to Dr. Techna.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, proceed as planned...with appropriate caution.</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>実に興味深い。彼がこれほど高いスコアを叩き出すとは予期していませんでした。彼には並々ならぬカリスマがあるようですね。\n"
"\n"
"代わりの人材を確保できれば、テクナ博士の役に立つかもしれない。\n"
"\n"
"それまでの間、計画通りに進めてください。適切な注意を払って...</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>Director,\n"
"\n"
"Understood. No further assessments will be conducted.\n"
"\n"
"One of the residents has already met with Dr. Olowe. I have attached his results below. They're incompatible with our goals, and honestly kind of frightening.\n"
"\n"
"Should I exclude him from the training?</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>所長、\n"
"\n"
"了解しました。これ以上の評価は行いません。\n"
"\n"
"研修医の1人がすでにオロウ博士と面談しています。彼の結果を以下に添付しました。我々の目標とは相容れないもので、正直言ってちょっと恐ろしいです。\n"
"\n"
"彼を研修から除外すべきでしょうか？</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>These individuals were recruited by me personally, for reasons far above your pay grade. As such, consider them pre-vetted.\n"
"\n"
"Failure to meet this project's timelines could mean failure in every timeline. Am I making myself clear?</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>彼らはあなたの給与水準をはるかに超える理由で、私自らが直々に採用した人材です。したがって、彼らには事前に審査済みであると伝えなさい。\n"
"\n"
"このプロジェクトの期限が守れないということは、全てにおいて期限が守れないということです。私の言うことが分かりましたか？</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_ECOTOURISM.BODY.CONTAINER4"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>Director,\n"
"\n"
"I've processed the first round of prospective sojourners.\n"
"\n"
"Given that the applicants have no formal training in space travel, I've asked Dr. Olowe to conduct a thorough assessment of their psychological and emotional fitness.\n"
"\n"
"Once his tests are complete, the prospective residents will be sent down to the biodome to begin their training.</indent></color>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>所長、\n"
"\n"
"最初の滞在候補者の選考を終えたところです。\n"
"\n"
"応募者は宇宙旅行の正式な訓練を受けていないため、オロウ博士に心理的および感情的な適性について徹底的な評価を行うよう依頼しました。\n"
"\n"
"彼のテストが完了すれば、滞在候補者はバイオドームに送られ訓練が開始されます。</indent></color>"

