#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_RADIOCLIP1.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_RADIOCLIP1.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps><b>[FILE FRAGMENTATION DETECTED]</b></smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"[Radio static.]\n"
"\n"
"...a tragic accident...flagship solar cell project...\n"
"\n"
"     ...training exercise...     ...two highly decorated pilots...countless ground crew...\n"
"\n"
"...Vertex Institute director expresses sorrow...  ...vows to carry on...not be in vain...\n"
"\n"
"       ...the research community is in mourning...\n"
"\n"
"...long-time competitor Gravitas Facility releases [unintelligible] statement...\n"
"...deploring unsafe work conditions...    ...invites applications...all disciplines...\n"
"\n"
"             ...stay tuned for..."
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps><b>[ファイルの断片化を検出]</b></smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"...\n"
"\n"
"[ラジオノイズ]\n"
"\n"
"...悲劇的な事故が...主力太陽電池プロジェクトに...\n"
"\n"
"...訓練演習中の... ...二人の優秀なパイロット...無数の地上要員...\n"
"\n"
"...Vertex Institute のディレクターが悲しみを表明... ...無駄にせず継続することを誓う...\n"
"\n"
"...研究コミュニティは悲嘆に暮れています...\n"
"\n"
"...長年の競合相手であるグラビタス研究所が[不明瞭]声明を発表...\n"
"...危険な作業環境を嘆く... ...応募を募集...あらゆる分野...\n"
"\n"
"...お楽しみに..."

