#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC3_POTATOBATTERY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC3_POTATOBATTERY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Voice Recognition Initialized]\n"
"[Subject Identified: B577]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"A recent conversation with our colleagues over in the electrical engineering department has highlighted exciting potential applications for our crops.\n"
"\n"
"They're seeking alternative inputs for the new universal power bank prototypes...\n"
"\n"
"...a passing remark about the potato batteries of our youth led to talk of biobatteries and bacterial nanowires.\n"
"\n"
"...tuberous plants are promising candidates for electrochemical batteries. Our lab-grown specimens are distinct from the humble solanum tuberosum in appearance and texture, but some may still function as acidic electrolytes.\n"
"\n"
"There are so many avenues to investigate, and so little time...\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[音声認識初期化]\n"
"[対象認識: B577]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"最近、電気工学部の同僚と会話をしたところ、我々の作物の魅力的な潜在的用途が明らかになった。\n"
"\n"
"彼らは新しいユニバーサル電力バンクのプロトタイプに使える代替入力を求めているようだ...\n"
"\n"
"...若い頃のジャガイモ電池についてのちょっとした発言が、バイオ電池とバクテリアナノワイヤーの話に繋がった。\n"
"\n"
"...塊茎植物は電気化学電池の有望な候補だ。我々の研究室で育てた標本は、見た目も質感も普通の塊茎植物とは異なるが、一部は酸性電解質として機能する可能性がある。\n"
"\n"
"調査すべき手段はたくさんあるにも関わらず、時間が殆ど無い...\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC3_POTATOBATTERY.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC3_POTATOBATTERY.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Log fragmentation detected]\n"
"[Voice Recognition unavailable]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...is it unethical to ask a hungry colony to choose between using edible crops for sustenance or for power production? Of course not.\n"
"\n"
"Our task is to provide as many options for survival as possible, not to dictate which options are morally superior.\n"
"\n"
"The real question is whether or not the AI guide will be sufficiently advanced to notify them that the choices exist...\n"
"\n"
"...and whether single-use bio power banks that vaporize due to extreme thermal runaway will truly be the difference between a successful colony and an...<i>unsuccessful</i>...one.\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[ログ断片検出]\n"
"[音声認識利用不可]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...食欲旺盛なコロニーに食用植物を食料として消費するか電力生産として消費するか求めることは非倫理的だろうか？無論、そうではない。\n"
"\n"
"我々の仕事は生き残るための選択肢を出来るだけ多く提供することであり、どれが道徳的に優れているかを決めることではない。\n"
"\n"
"真の問題はAIガイドが選択肢の存在を通知できるほど進歩しているかどうかだ...\n"
"\n"
"...そして極端な熱暴走により蒸発する使い捨ての有機電力バンクがコロニーの成功と... <i>失敗</i>を左右するかどうかだ。\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC3_POTATOBATTERY.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC3_POTATOBATTERY.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Log fragmentation detected]\n"
"[Voice Recognition unavailable]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...word of our efforts has spread!\n"
"\n"
"The bioengineers report that some of their creatures' eggs contain phosphorescent albumen that requires only basic processing in order to trigger chemical reactions that produce storable energy. It displays unprecedented biocompatibility with the prosthetics Dr. Gossmann has been developing.\n"
"\n"
"The Director assigned us a half-dozen new graduates last week. They work the night shift—this generation never sleeps!\n"
"\n"
"No one has met them yet, but their data is always neatly compiled for us to find in the morning.\n"
"\n"
"They seem determined to prioritize the use of metallic and radioactive components rather than plant or animal-based ones.\n"
"\n"
"Youthful idealism, perhaps?\n"
"\n"
"Nevertheless, their findings <i>are</i> quite compelling.\n"
"\n"
"I admire their mettle.\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[ログ断片検出]\n"
"[音声認識利用不可]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...我々の努力が噂となっているようだ！\n"
"\n"
"バイオエンジニアの報告によると、彼らが扱う生物の卵の中には、基本的な処理を施すことで蓄積可能なエネルギーを産出する化学反応を引き起こす、燐光を発する卵白が含まれているそうだ。これは、ゴスマン博士が開発している義肢と前例のない生体適合性を示している。\n"
"\n"
"先週、所長は我々に6人の新卒者を割り当てた。彼らは夜勤で働いている。若者は眠らないのだ！\n"
"\n"
"まだ彼らに会った人はいないが、彼らのデータは朝私たちが見つけられるように常にきちんとまとめられている。\n"
"\n"
"彼らは植物や動物由来の成分よりも、金属や放射性成分の使用を優先する決意をしているようだ。\n"
"\n"
"若さゆえの理想主義なのだろうか？\n"
"\n"
"とはいえ、彼らの発見は<i>非常に</i>説得力がある。\n"
"\n"
"私は彼らの気概に感心してしまう。\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

