#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_ALLCOMINGBACK.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_ALLCOMINGBACK.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]\n"
"[Voice Recognition Unavailable]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a throat being cleared)\n"
"\n"
"There were times when our tests got so close\n"
"That my samples waved a claw\n"
"And maybe didn't live long but that was a win, though\n"
"\n"
"There was data that gave us strong clues\n"
"Then over years we lost trust\n"
"And knew our hopes of cloning had dried up forever...forever...\n"
"\n"
"(sound of earth rumbling)\n"
"\n"
"...We had exhausted every fellowship and fund\n"
"And we couldn't recreate Cretaceous creatures\n"
"And we'd got our hands on every single fossil that we could...\n"
"\n"
"But when I crash-landed here\n"
"And saw ...them... grazing so near\n"
"It's amazing to see that it's all growing back so green\n"
"\n"
"When they peer through ferns here\n"
"Underneath skies so clear\n"
"It's so hard to believe, but it's all grown back so green\n"
"It's all growing back, it's all growing back so green now\n"
"\n"
"There are moments of awe\n"
"And there are clashes and fights\n"
"There are plants I've never seen before\n"
"And they don't seem to need light\n"
"Theropods and tillyardembia\n"
"It is more than any lab could hope\n"
"\n"
"Maybe\n"
"\n"
"Maybe\n"
"\n"
"If I had a lab here\n"
"A mass spectrometer there\n"
"I could show them back home\n"
"that it's all growing back so green...\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a twig snapping)\n"
"\n"
"...hello?\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"\n"
"------------------\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[ログ断片検出]\n"
"[音声認識利用不可]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"(咳払いの音)\n"
"\n"
"テストがあまりにも近づきすぎて\n"
"サンプルが爪を立てた時もあった。\n"
"もしかしたら長くは生きられなかったかもしれないが、\n"
"それでも勝利だった。\n"
"\n"
"強力な手がかりとなるデータもあった。\n"
"しかし、何年も経つうちに私たちは信頼を失い、\n"
"クローン技術への希望は永遠に…永遠に…枯渇したことを悟った。\n"
"\n"
"(地響きの音)\n"
"\n"
"…あらゆるフェローシップと資金を使い果たし、\n"
"白亜紀の生物を再現することはできなかった。\n"
"そして、手に入る限りの化石はすべて手に入れた…\n"
"\n"
"しかし、私がここに不時着し、…彼らが…こんなに近くで草を食んでいるのを見た時…すべてがこんなに緑に再生しているのを見るのは驚きだ。\n"
"\n"
"彼らがシダの隙間から覗く姿を見る時…こんなにも…空は晴れ\n"
"信じられないけど、全部こんなに緑が戻ってきたんだ。全部がまた緑に生えてきた。全部がまた緑に生えてきた。\n"
"\n"
"畏敬の念を抱く瞬間もある。衝突や争いもある。見たこともない植物もある。光を必要としないらしい。獣脚類やティヤルデンビア。どんな研究室でも期待できないほどだ。\n"
"\n"
"もしかしたら\n"
"\n"
"もしかしたら\n"
"\n"
"もしここに研究室があれば\n"
"あそこに質量分析計があれば\n"
"故郷の人たちに\n"
"全部こんなに緑が戻ってきたって見せられるのに…\n"
"\n"
"（小枝が折れる音）\n"
"\n"
"…なんだ？\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"\n"
"------------------\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_ALLCOMINGBACK.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_ALLCOMINGBACK.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"Amazing...\n"
"\n"
"...it's almost as if they have some distant memory of having been sung to.\n"
"\n"
"Perhaps they have more in common with our own creatures than I thought.\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"\n"
"------------------\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"すごい…\n"
"\n"
"…まるで歌に歌われた遠い記憶があるかのようだ。\n"
"\n"
"もしかしたら、彼らは私が思っていた以上に、私たちの生き物と共通点があるのか​​もしれない。\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"\n"
"------------------\n"

