#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC5_RESEARCHPORTAL.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC5_RESEARCHPORTAL.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Got a quick draft done - let me know what you think. Feels like we're getting way ahead of ourselves.\n"
"\n"
"- E\n"
"\n"
"----------------------\n"
"\n"
"<b>WIP DRAFT:</b>\n"
"\n"
"In the extremely unlikely event that this emergency is a direct result of Gravitas equipment malfunction, please contact your resettlement agent.\n"
"\n"
"They will review the situation and recommend a course of action custom-designed to suit your unique needs. This process may take up to four business days.\n"
"\n"
"Our office is open 24/7, 364 days a year. We are closed from 00:01 to 23:59 CEST on November 7 every year.\n"
"\n"
"Best wishes!\n"
"\n"
"<indent=5%><smallcaps>- Catalina Rosado\n"
"  Gravitas Resettlement Manager</smallcaps></indent>\n"
"\n"
"----------------------\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"簡単な草稿を作成しました。ご意見をお聞かせください。少し先走りすぎているような気がします。\n"
"\n"
"- E\n"
"\n"
"----------------------\n"
"\n"
"<b>作業中草稿：</b>\n"
"\n"
"万が一、この緊急事態がグラヴィタス研究所の機器故障に起因する場合は、担当の再定住エージェントにご連絡ください。\n"
"\n"
"エージェントが状況を確認し、お客様固有のニーズに合わせた対応策をご提案いたします。このプロセスには最大4営業日かかる場合があります。\n"
"\n"
"弊社は年中無休、24時間364日営業しております。ただし、毎年11月7日(中央ヨーロッパ夏時間)は00:01から23:59まで休業となります。\n"
"\n"
"よろしくお願いいたします。\n"
"\n"
"<indent=5%><smallcaps>- カタリナ・ロサド\n"
"\n"
"グラヴィタス研究所 再定住マネージャー</smallcaps></indent>\n"
"\n"
"----------------------\n"

