#. STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Jumping Joya is a decorative plant that brings a feeling of calmness and wellbeing to individuals in its vicinity.\n"
"\n"
"Their rounded appendages and eccentrically shaped polyps are a favorite of interior designers looking to offset the rigid straight walls of an institutional setting.\n"
"\n"
"The Jumping Joya's capacity to thrive in many environments and the ease in which they propagate make them the go-to house plant for the lazy gardener."
msgstr ""
"ジャンピングジョヤは静寂の中に居る個人に落ち着きと幸福感をもたらす植物です。\n"
"\n"
"丸みを帯びた附属枝と風変わりな形状のポリプは、施設の真っすぐな壁と相殺させようとするインテリアデザイナーのお気に入りです。\n"
"\n"
"ジャンピングジョヤは様々な環境で繁茂する能力および手入れのし易さにより、怠け者の庭師の最適な観葉植物になります。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "観葉植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.TITLE"
msgid "Jumping Joya"
msgstr "ジャンピング ジョヤ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"In the aftermath of a successful mission--be it the completion of a story trait or the survival of some epic event--my Duplicants sometimes form sentimental attachments to an item associated with that chapter of their lives.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "ミッションが成功した後(物語特性の完了や壮大なイベント後の生存など)、私の複製人間達は、人生の一ページに関連するアイテムに対して感傷的な愛着を抱くことがある。\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.TITLE"
msgid "Keepsakes"
msgstr "記念品"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The leaf of a <link=\"KELPPLANT\">Seakomb</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be processed into <link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</link> or used as an ingredient in <link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE \">Allergy Medication</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"KELPPLANT\">シーコンブ</link>の葉です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"PHYTOOIL\">植物油</link>に加工したり、<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE \">アレルギー薬</link>の素材として使えます。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Plant Byproduct"
msgstr "植物の副産物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.TITLE"
msgid "Seakomb Leaf"
msgstr "シーコンブの葉"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Seakombs are hyperefficient photosynthesizers. While most plants grow towards the light, this aquatic fern's needs are so low that it can prioritize other survival needs.\n"
"\n"
"It sprouts on the ceiling of liquid-filled caves, its tendrils reaching down to brush passing critters. This contact encourages critters to consume the plant and excrete the fertilizer that supports its continued growth."
msgstr ""
"シーコンプは超効率的な光合成植物です。ほとんどの植物は光に向かって成長しますが、この水生シダは光合成の必要性が非常に低いため、他の生存ニーズを優先することができます。\n"
"\n"
"液体で満たされた洞窟の天井から芽を出し、その巻きひげは通りすがりの動物まで伸びます。この接触により、動物はシーコンブを食べて、成長を支える肥料を排出します。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Plant"
msgstr "水生植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELPPLANT.TITLE"
msgid "Seakomb"
msgstr "シーコンブ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_1"
msgid "Light"
msgstr "光"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_2"
msgid "Light Sources"
msgstr "光源"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_3"
msgid "Measuring Light"
msgstr "光源範囲"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.HEADER_4"
msgid "Video: Power Circuits"
msgstr "ビデオ: 電気回路"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid ""
"Most of the asteroid is dark. Light sources such as the <link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">Ceiling Light</link> or <link=\"LIGHTBUG\">Shine Bug</link> improves Decor and gives Duplicants a boost to their productivity. Many plants are also sensitive to the amount of light they receive.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"小惑星内部はほとんど暗闇です。<link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">天井灯</link>や<link=\"LIGHTBUG\">シャインバグ</link>といった光源は複製人間の士気や生産性の向上に寄与します。ほとんどの植物が照らされる光の量に対し敏感です。\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid ""
"The <link=\"FLOORLAMP\">Lamp</link> and <link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">Ceiling Light</link> produce a decent amount of light when powered. The <link=\"LIGHTBUG\">Shine Bug</link> naturally emits a halo of light. Strong solar light is available on the surface during daytime.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "<link=\"FLOORLAMP\">ランプ</link>と<link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">天井灯</link>は電力が供給されると広範囲の光源になります。<link=\"LIGHTBUG\">シャインバグ</link>はわっか状に自然発光します。表面に照らされる強力な太陽光は日中のみ利用できます。\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid ""
"The amount of light on a cell is measured in Lux. Lux has a dramatic range - A simple <link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">Ceiling Light</link> produces 1800 Lux, while the sun can produce values as high as 80000 Lux. The <link=\"SOLARPANEL\">Solar Panel</link> generates power proportional to how many Lux it is exposed to.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"1マス内の光量はルクスで計測されます。ルクスは長大な範囲を持っており、<link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">天井灯</link>1台で1800ルクス、太陽光は80000ルクスになります。<link=\"SOLARPANEL\">ソーラーパネル</link>は受けるルクスの量に応じて発電します。\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.PARAGRAPH_4"
msgid ""
"To learn more about how to keep a colony well-lit, watch the <link=\"VIDEOS16\">Power Circuits</link> video tutorial.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "コロニーを明るく保つ方法については、<link=\"VIDEOS16\">電源回路</link>のビデオチュートリアルをご覧ください。\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LIGHT.TITLE"
msgid "<link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LIGHT\">光</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LILYPAD.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LILYPAD.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Cura Lotuses are adaptable aquatic plants that have inspired artists since their blossoms were first spotted bobbing on the surface of a quiet pond.\n"
"\n"
"These ethereal beauties are a panacea for both the mind and the body - their delicate spores are highly sought-after for their natural antihistamine properties."
msgstr ""
"キュラロータスは、静かな池の水面に浮かぶ花が初めて発見されて以来、多くの芸術家たちにインスピレーションを与えてきた観賞用水生植物です。\n"
"\n"
"この幽玄な美しさは、心と体の両方に効く万能薬です。繊細な胞子には、天然の抗ヒスタミン作用があることから、非常に人気があります。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LILYPAD.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LILYPAD.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "観葉植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LILYPAD.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LILYPAD.TITLE"
msgid "Cura Lotus"
msgstr "キュラロータス"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LOCKS.NEURALVACILLATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LOCKS.NEURALVACILLATOR"
msgid "Neural Vacillator"
msgstr "神経シャッフルマシン"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LUMBER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LUMBER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Thick logs of <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link> harvested from trees, <link=\"CRABWOOD\">Oakshells</link>, and other natural sources.\n"
"\n"
"Wood is also used in the production of <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link> and <link=\"POWER\">Power</link>. They are also a useful building material."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"CRABWOOD\">オークシェル</link>、その他の天然資源から収穫された <link=\"WOOD\">木材</link> の太い丸太です。\n"
"\n"
"木材の丸太は<link=\"HEAT\">熱</link>と<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>の生産に使用されます。また、便利な建築材料でもあります。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.LUMBER.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LUMBER.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Renewable Resource"
msgstr "再生可能資源"

# Don't Starve のキャラ
#. STRINGS.CODEX.LUMBER.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.LUMBER.TITLE"
msgid "Wood"
msgstr "木材"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MEALWOOD.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MEALWOOD.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Mealwood is an bramble-like plant that has a parasitic symbiotic relationship with the nutrient-rich Meal Lice that inhabit it.\n"
"\n"
"Mealwood experience a rapid growth rate in its first stages, but once the Meal Lice become active they consume all the new fruiting spurs on the plant before they can fully mature.\n"
"\n"
"Theoretically the flowers of this plant are a beautiful color of fuchsia, however no Mealwood has ever reached the point of flowering without being overrun by the parasitic Meal Lice."
msgstr ""
"ミールウッドはイバラのような植物で、そこに生息する栄養価の高いミールライスと共生関係にあります。\n"
"\n"
"ミールウッドは最初のステージに置いて急速に成長しますが、ミールライスが活動的になると完全に成熟する前に果実枝の全てを消費します。\n"
"\n"
"理論的には、この植物の花は美しいフクシアと同じ色ですが、寄生するミールライスに襲われず開花できたミールライスはありません。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MEALWOOD.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MEALWOOD.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Edible Plant"
msgstr "食用植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MEALWOOD.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MEALWOOD.TITLE"
msgid "Mealwood"
msgstr "ミールウッド"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MELLOWMALLOW.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MELLOWMALLOW.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Mellow Mallow is a type of fungus that is known for its ease of propagation when cut.\n"
"\n"
"It is deadly when consumed, however creatures that mistakenly eat it are said to experience a state of extreme calm before death."
msgstr ""
"メロマロは切断後の繁殖のし易さで知られる菌類です。\n"
"\n"
"食べると死にますが、誤ってこの植物を食べてしまった動物は死ぬ前に極度に落ち着いた状態になると言われています。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MELLOWMALLOW.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MELLOWMALLOW.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "観葉植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MELLOWMALLOW.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MELLOWMALLOW.TITLE"
msgid "Mellow Mallow"
msgstr "メロマロ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Mirth Leaf is a broad-leafed house plant used for decorating living spaces.\n"
"\n"
"The joyous bobbing of the wide green leaves provides hours of amusement for those desperate for entertainment.\n"
"\n"
"Although the Mirth Leaf can inspire laughter and joy, it is not cut out for a career in stand-up comedy."
msgstr ""
"マースリーフは生活空間を装飾するために使われる、広葉の鉢植え植物です。\n"
"\n"
"緑の大きな葉が楽しそうに上下運動する様は、エンターテインメントに飢えた人ならば何時間でも見ていられるでしょう。\n"
"\n"
"マースリーフは笑いと喜びを呼び起こすことができますが、スタンドアップコメディを職業とするには向いていません。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "観葉植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MIRTHLEAF.TITLE"
msgid "Mirth Leaf"
msgstr "マース リーフ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MISC.TIP_ICON.FARMING3_SKILL.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MISC.TIP_ICON.FARMING3_SKILL.TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"Skill Required\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants must possess the <link=\"FARMING3\">Improved Farming II</link> skill to salvage <link=\"PLANTFIBER\">Plant Husk</link> during harvest"
msgstr ""
"スキルが必要です\n"
"\n"
"収穫中に<link=\"PLANTFIBER\">植物の殻</link>を回収するには<link=\"FARMING3\">農耕改善 II</link>スキルを持った複製人間が必要です"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>Hello Dr. Jones,\n"
"\n"
"Hope you are well. Sorry to bother you- I believe that someone may have inappropriately accessed my computer.\n"
"\n"
"When I was logging in this morning, the \"last log-in\" pop-up indicated that my computer had been accessed at 2 a.m. My last actual log-in was 6 p.m. And some of my files have gone missing.\n"
"\n"
"The privacy of my work is paramount. Would it be possible to have someone take a look, please?</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>こんにちは、ジョーンズ博士\n"
"\n"
"お元気ですか？お忙しいところ申し訳ありませんが、誰かが私のコンピュータに不適切なアクセスをしたようです。\n"
"\n"
"今朝方ログインしたところ、コンピュータの最終ログイン日付が午前2時となっていました。普段私は午後6時にはログアウトしていますし、ファイルがいくつか失われていました。\n"
"\n"
"私の仕事においてプライバシーは最優先事項です。誰かに見てもらうことは可能でしょうか？</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>OMG Amari, you're so dramatic!! It's probably just a glitch from the system network upgrade. Nobody can even get into your office without going through the new hand scanners.\n"
"\n"
"PS: Everybody's work is super private, not just yours ;)</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>ワーオ！アマリさん、大袈裟すぎです！システムネットワークの更新による不具合じゃないですかね。新型ハンドスキャナーを通さなければ誰もあなたのオフィスに入ることなんてできませんよ。\n"
"\n"
"追伸: 仕事が超プライベートなのは皆さん同じですよ～ ;)</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>Dear Dr. Jones,\n"
"I'm so sorry to bother you again...it's just that I'm absolutely certain that someone has been interfering with my files.\n"
"\n"
"I've noticed several discrepancies since last week's \"glitch.\" For example, responses to my recent employee survey on workplace satisfaction and safety were decrypted, and significant portions of my data and research notes have been erased. I'm even missing a few e-mails.\n"
"\n"
"It's all quite alarming. Could you or Dr. Summers please investigate this when you have a moment?\n"
"\n"
"Thank you so much,\n"
"\n"
"</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>ジョーンズ博士\n"
"度々すいません...。誰かが私のファイルを参照していることは間違いないのです。\n"
"\n"
"先週の「不具合」以降、不一致が散見されます。例えば、職場の満足度と安全性に関する従業員アンケートの回答が解読され、私のデータや研究ノートの大部分が削除されています。Eメールも何通か行方不明です。\n"
"\n"
"とても由々しき事態です。あなたかサマーズ博士に調査して欲しいのですが可能でしょうか？\n"
"\n"
"お話を聞いていただきありがとうございました。\n"
"\n"
"</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.MISSINGNOTES.BODY.CONTAINER4"
msgid ""
"<indent=5%>The files in question were a security risk, and were disposed of accordingly.\n"
"\n"
"As for your emails: the NDA you signed was very clear about how to handle requests from members of the media.\n"
"\n"
"See me in my office.</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<indent=5%>問題のファイルはセキュリティ上のリスクがあったため、それに応じて削除されました。\n"
"\n"
"Eメールについても、あなたが署名したNDAにメディアからの要求をどう取り扱うかについて明記してあります。\n"
"\n"
"私のオフィスでお会いしましょう。</indent>"

