#. STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Beakons are highly sought-after by ichthyophiles due to their radiant bioluminescence and unusual habit of surfacing for <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link>.\n"
"\n"
"These brilliant critters enjoy the tickle of air in their gills, and are happiest cohabiting with bubbly <link=\"OXYCORAL\">Flue Coral</link> that provide abundant air pockets for their entertainment.\n"
"\n"
"Some <link=\"PARROTFISHSPECIES\">Beakons</link> have even been known to nap atop their preferred coral formation. Such sightings are extremely rare."
msgstr ""
"ビーコンはその鮮やかな生物発光と酸素を求めて水面に浮上するという珍しい習性から、魚類愛好家の間で非常に人気があります。\n"
"\n"
"これらの美しい生き物はエラに空気が入るのを好み、豊富な空気溜まりを提供してくれる泡立つフルーサンゴと共生することを最も喜びます。\n"
"\n"
"中には好みのサンゴの上で昼寝をするビーコンもいますが、そのような光景は極めて稀です。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.SPECIES_SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.SPECIES_SUBTITLE"
msgid "Critter Species"
msgstr "動物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.SPECIES_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.SPECIES_TITLE"
msgid "Beakon"
msgstr "ビーコン"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Critter"
msgstr "水棲動物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.TITLE"
msgid "Beakon"
msgstr "ビーコン"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PINCHAPEPPERPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PINCHAPEPPERPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Pincha Pepperplant is a tropical vine with a reduced lignin structural system that renders it incapable of growing upward from the ground.\n"
"\n"
"The plant therefore prefers to embed its roots into tall trees and rocky outcrops, the result of which is an inverse of the plant's natural gravitropism, causing its stem to prefer growing downwards while the roots tend to grow up."
msgstr ""
"ピンチャペッパーは還元リグニン構造系のため地面から伸びることができない、熱帯性つる植物です。\n"
"\n"
"この植物はその性質のため自身の根を高木や露出した岩礁などにねじ込み、結果として重力屈性は反転し幹は下方に、根は上方に伸びていきます。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PINCHAPEPPERPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PINCHAPEPPERPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Edible Spice Plant"
msgstr "食用香辛料"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PINCHAPEPPERPLANT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PINCHAPEPPERPLANT.TITLE"
msgid "Pincha Pepperplant"
msgstr "ピンチャペッパー"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Pips are a member of the Rodentia order with a strong caching instinct that causes them to find and bury small objects, most often seeds."
msgstr "ピップはげっ歯類の一員です。隠されたものを探し出す本能があり、小さなもの(主に種子)を見つけ出します。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "It is unknown whether their caching behavior is a compulsion or a form of entertainment, as the Pip relies primarily on bark and wood for its survival."
msgstr "ピップは生存を木とその樹皮に依存しているため、彼らの探索能力は強制的なものなのか単なる娯楽なのかは不明です。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid "Although the Pip lacks truly opposable thumbs, it nonetheless has highly dexterous paws that allow it to rummage through most tight to reach spaces in search of seeds and other treasures."
msgstr "ピップには向き合った親指が無いにもかかわらず、種子やその他の宝物を探し出すために極めて狭い場所でさえかき回すことができる非常に器用な脚を持っています。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.SPECIES_SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.SPECIES_SUBTITLE"
msgid "Critter Species"
msgstr "動物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.SPECIES_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.SPECIES_TITLE"
msgid "Pips"
msgstr "ピップ属"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Domesticable Critter"
msgstr "飼い慣らせる動物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PIP.TITLE"
