#. STRINGS.CODEX.ROYAL.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ROYAL.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "The Shine Bug can be pet anywhere else along its body, although it is advised that care still be taken due to the generally delicate nature of its exoskeleton."
msgstr "シャインバグの体のどこでも撫でてやることができますが、外骨格はとてもデリケートであるため扱いに注意が必要です。"

