msgstr "動物(変種)"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SAGE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SAGE.TITLE"
msgid "Sage Hatch"
msgstr "セイジ ハッチ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SALTYSTICKSPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SALTYSTICKSPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Sodicane plant is a hardy member of the Poaceae family of grasses, well-suited to amateur farmers in warm climates.\n"
"\n"
"While the crystallized mineral deposits on its stalks are quite palatable, they can only be eaten by gnawing on the unfortunately fibrous stalk."
msgstr ""
"ソディケーンはイネ科の丈夫な植物で、温暖な気候の家庭菜園に適しています。\n"
"\n"
"茎に付着した結晶状のミネラルは食用になりますが、残念ながら繊維質の茎をかじって食べる必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SALTYSTICKSPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SALTYSTICKSPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Edible Plant"
msgstr "食用植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SALTYSTICKSPLANT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SALTYSTICKSPLANT.TITLE"
msgid "Sodicane"
msgstr "ソディケーン"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SATURNCRITTERTRAP.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SATURNCRITTERTRAP.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The Saturn Critter Trap plant is a carnivorous plant that lays in wait for unsuspecting critters to happen by, then traps them in its mouth for consumption.\n"
"\n"
"The Saturn Trap Plant's predatory mechanism is reflective of the harsh radioactive habitat it resides in.\n"
"\n"
"Once trapped in the deadly maw of the plant, creatures are gently asphyxiated then digested through powerful acidic enzymes which coat the inner sides of the Saturn Trap Plant's leaves."
msgstr ""
"ケモノジゴクは不注意な動物が現れるのを待ち構えながら横たわり、口の中に閉じ込めて消化する食肉植物です。\n"
"\n"
"ケモノジゴクの捕食メカニズムは、それが生息する過酷な放射能を反映しています。\n"
"\n"
"この植物の致命的な口に捕らわれると、生物は穏やかに窒息し、葉の内側を覆う強力な酸化酵素によって消化されます。"

