#. STRINGS.CODEX.SEAHORSE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SEAHORSE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Adult Seaquines flood their brood pouches with <link=\"FISHMILK\">Ovolene</link> to nourish their eggs and support osmoregulation.\n"
"\n"
"As this is an energy-intensive process, it is abandoned in later life stages so that geriatric Seaquine can focus their efforts on laying one final egg before they perish."
msgstr ""
"成体のシークインは、卵を養い浸透圧調節を維持するために、育児嚢に<link=\"FISHMILK\">オボレン</link>を大量に分泌します。\n"
"\n"
"しかし、これはエネルギーを大量に消費するプロセスであるため、老齢期になると放棄され、シークインは死ぬ前に最後の卵を産むことに専念します。"

