#. STRINGS.CODEX.SEAURCHIN.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SEAURCHIN.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Pinpoki are prized by marine cuisine gourmands for their delicate buttery flesh, with an aftertaste that some describe as \"transcendant.\"\n"
"\n"
"The flavor is so legendary that even just gazing upon a displayed Pinpoki is enough to inspire a high level of emotional satisfaction."
msgstr ""
"ピンポキはその繊細でバターのような食感と後味の素晴らしさから、海の幸を愛する美食家たちから「至高」と評価されています。\n"
"\n"
"その味わいはまさに伝説的で、店頭に並ぶピンポキを眺めるだけでも深い満足感に満たされるほどです。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SEAURCHIN.SUBTITLE
