msgid "Aquatic Organism"
msgstr "水棲生物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SEAURCHIN.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SEAURCHIN.TITLE"
msgid "Pinpoki"
msgstr "ピンポキ"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SHERBERRY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SHERBERRY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"The semi-parasitic Sherberry plant leeches moisture and trace minerals from the primordial ice formations in which it grows.\n"
"\n"
"The fruit of this varietal contains low levels of stomach-upsetting phoratoxins which, while not fatal, do serve as strong motivation for foragers to seek out additional sources of nutrition."
msgstr ""
"半寄生性のシャーベリーは、生育する原始的な氷層から水分と微量ミネラルを吸い上げます。\n"
"\n"
"この品種の果実には、お腹が痛くなるフォラトキシンが少量含まれています。致命的ではありませんが、採取者が追加の栄養源を探す強い動機となります。"

