msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "First Encounter"
msgstr "未知との遭遇"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"My Duplicants have uncovered a fascinating machine. Its construction suggests that it was designed as an energy field disruptor, and retrofitted with printing capabilities.\n"
"\n"
"It is locked behind a 13-digit passcode. One failed attempt could permanently disable the entire building.\n"
"\n"
"I can only hope that the code is also buried somewhere on this world."
msgstr ""
"複製人間達が興味深い機械を発見した。構造から判断すると、エネルギーフィールドを撹乱する装置として設計され、印刷機能は後付けされたようだ。\n"
"\n"
"13桁のパスコードでロックされており、一度でもロック解除に失敗すると、設備が完全に使用不可となるおそれがある。\n"
"\n"
"パスコードもこの世界のどこかに埋もれていることを願うばかりだ。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait: Printerceptor"
msgstr "物語特性: 製造ポッドジャック"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Reboot an unsanctioned biogenetic facility.\n"
"\n"
"Once activated, Duplicants can use it to siphon energy from the Printing Pod to power on-demand printing of...something.\n"
"\n"
"It smells a bit like an old ranch."
msgstr ""
"非公式生合成施設を再起動します。\n"
"\n"
"起動すると、複製人間は製造ポッドからエネルギーを吸い上げオンデマンドで「何か」を印刷できるようになるでしょう。\n"
"\n"
"​​少し古い牧場のような匂いがします。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgid "Reboot an unsanctioned biogenetic facility that siphons energy from the Printing Pod."
msgstr "製造ポッドからエネルギーを吸い上げる非公式生合成施設を再起動します。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.BUTTON"
msgid "Power On"
msgstr "電源オン"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Challenge Completed"
msgstr "チャレンジ完了"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Success! This building has printed its first viable organism. It contains zero detectable genetic defects.\n"
"\n"
"We can now confidently reroute the Printing Pod's power to print the critters and seeds best suited for my colony's purposes. No species need ever be extinct again.\n"
"\n"
"A small personal item shook loose from the frame during use. Perhaps it belonged to the previous operator."
msgstr ""
"成功した！この設備は最初の生存可能な生物を印刷しました。検出可能な遺伝子欠陥は一切ない。\n"
"\n"
"これで製造ポッドの電力をコロニーの目的に最適な生物と種子に確実に再配分できる。種の絶滅はもう存在しない。\n"
"\n"
"使用中に小さな私物がフレームから落ちた。おそらく前のオペレーターのものだったのだろう。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait Complete: Printerceptor"
msgstr "物語特性完了: 製造ポッドジャック"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]\n"
"[Voice Recognition Unavailable]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"(sound of running water)\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Dr. Reed?\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a door opening)\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: You came! I thought something happened.\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Sorry I'm late. Real snafu in the cafeteria this morning. The new hazmat labels peel right off if they come into contact with mayonnaise.\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: Why are there hazmat labels in the caf-\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Did you bring the access codes for Techna's siphon?\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: They're on this drive.\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: Look, I need to know exactly who you're working with before I hand this over.\n"
"\n"
"Tech: We're the good guys, Dr. Reed.\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: That's who I thought we were. Try again.\n"
"\n"
"Tech: I work with the people who made your Director who she is. In a way, we're sort of...family.\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: The Director has no family.\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Maybe not in this lifetime. The drive, please.\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: What about Nikola? Do your people know where he is?\n"
"\n"
"Tech: We're on it. You'll be the first to know.\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a firm knock on the door)\n"
"\n"
"Voice: Hello? Who's in there?\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: (whispering) Those security guys must have followed you!\n"
"\n"
"(sound of banging on the door)\n"
"\n"
"Voice: Open up!\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: If they get a hold of the data on that server...\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Wait, what are you-\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a toilet flushing)\n"
"\n"
"Tech: What have you done!?\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: I'm sorry. It's gone. If they got their hands on it...I would never forgive myself.\n"
"\n"
"(sound of the door creaking open)\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: Catalina! I thought you were-\n"
"\n"
"Catalina: Finally! What are you... you know what, I don't even care. Whatever you two are doing, can you do it in the hallway? I gotta go <i>bad.</i>\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: Of course. Sorry.\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Actually, we-\n"
"\n"
"Catalina: Dude. Don't make it weird. Get outta the way.\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a door slamming)\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: What are you doing?\n"
"\n"
"Tech: Pulling up the blueprints of the facility's plumbing system. You didn't think you could just flush unpatented trillion-dollar technology down the toilet, did you?\n"
"\n"
"Ruby: Wait, you can't mean...you don't mean to <i>SELL</i> this technology! You don't understand the consequ-\n"
"\n"
"Tech: We understand perfectly. You've been a great help, Dr. Reed. I trust you know better than to mention this to anyone.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[ログ断片検出]\n"
"[音声認識利用不可]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"(水が流れる音)\n"
"\n"
"技術者: リード博士居ますか？\n"
"\n"
"(ドアの開く音)\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: 来たわね！何かあったのかと思ってたところなの。\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 遅れて申し訳ありません。今朝方カフェテリアで大変なことが起こりまして。新しい危険物ラベルはマヨネーズで簡単に剥がれてしまうんですよ。\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: なんでカフェに危険物ラベルが―\n"
"\n"
"技術者: テクナサイフォンのアクセスコードはお持ちですね？\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: このドライブの中よ。\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: ねえ、これを渡す前にあなたが誰と仕事をしているのか正確に知っておく必要があるんだけど。\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 誓って悪事はしていませんよ、リード博士。\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: そうだと良いわね。で、誰なの。\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 私は所長を所長たらしめる人物と仕事をしているんです。言ってみれば…、我々は家族のようなものです。\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: 所長に家族は居ません。\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 今生きている間は無理かもしれませんねえ。ドライブを渡してください。お願いします。\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: ニコラはどうしたの？彼の居場所を知ってる人はあなたたちの中に居る？\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 現在調査中です。あなたに最初にお伝えしますよ。\n"
"\n"
"(ドアをコンコン叩く音)\n"
"\n"
"声: もしもし？どなたか居ますか？\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: (囁き声) 警備員に付けられてたのね！\n"
"\n"
"(ドアを乱暴に叩く音)\n"
"\n"
"声: 開けなさい！\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: もしあのサーバーのデータを奴等が手に入れるようなことになれば...\n"
"\n"
"技術者: ちょっと、何をするんです！？\n"
"\n"
"(トイレを流す音)\n"
"\n"
"技術者: なんてことを！\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: ごめんなさいね。流しちゃった。奴等の手にあれが渡るようなら、私は決して自分自身を許せないから。\n"
"\n"
"(ドアが軋む音)\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: カタリナ！まさか―\n"
"\n"
"カタリナ: やっと開いた！...何を、いや、もうどうでもいいわ。お二人さん、続きは廊下でやってくれる？もうかなり<i>ヤバい</i>の。\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: そうするわ。ごめんなさい。\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 実は―\n"
"\n"
"カタリナ: はいはい、分かったから、どいたどいた。\n"
"\n"
"(ドアがバタンと閉まる音)\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: 何をしているの？\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 研究所の配管システムの設計図を引っ張り出しているところですよ。特許も申請していない1兆ドル規模の技術をトイレに流せるはずがないでしょう？\n"
"\n"
"ルビー: 待って、それってつまりこの技術を<i>売る</i>つもりなの？どうなるか分かって―\n"
"\n"
"技術者: 百も承知ですよ。リード博士、大変助かりました。このことは他言しないほうが賢明だと思いますね。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: NONE"
msgstr "暗号化レベル: なし"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.TITLE"
msgid "The Stall"
msgstr "特等席"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.NAME"
msgid "Printerceptor"
msgstr "製造ポッドジャック"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.BUTTON"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "閉じる"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Flushed Evidence"
msgstr "流された証拠"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"My Duplicants have recovered the access code to unlock the Printerceptor!\n"
"\n"
"The data storage medium was damaged during retrieval, but it has already served its purpose: the Printerceptor's targeted printing technology is now at my colony's fingertips."
msgstr ""
"複製人間達が製造ポッドジャックのロックを解除するためのアクセスコードを入手した！\n"
"\n"
"データ保存媒体は回収中に破損したが、既にその役割を終えている。製造ポッドジャックの印刷技術は、今や私のコロニーの手の届くところにある。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.UNLOCK_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait: Printerceptor"
msgstr "物語特性: 製造ポッドジャック"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.WHENIMGONE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.WHENIMGONE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"<i>...whoever you are...(static)...if you're watching this... You need to get out of the facility NOW. Don't talk to anyone. We thought we were the first...\n"
"Timing is everything. </i>Time<i> is everything.\n"
"\n"
"Go to the Giga Co-Op downtown and tell them you're picking up an order for D.H. They'll give you a machine ... boot it up, stay offline.\n"
"\n"
"...instructions on the drive. Once you've verified the code, it'll tell you how to find the ...(static)...interceptor...data still stored on the server.\n"
"\n"
"...been rerouting power from the pods to the Bow... easing the demand...buying time to finish the Temporal Containment Field. But you can't buy time. You can only borrow it... the magnitude of our accumulated debt...\n"
"\n"
"We're not the first to ... what happens when it all comes crashing ... all over again, and again, and again, and... I've long suspected the existence of other Bows......each time one of them exceeds capacity...\n"
"...lines get splintered...grafted onto another...\n"
"\n"
"How many other Earths...\n"
"\n"
"What else has the Director sacrificed?\n"
"...(static)...</i>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[ログ断片検出]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"<i>...あなたが誰であろうとも...(ザザッ)...もしこれを見ているならば... 直ちに研究所から立ち去ってください。他言無用です。私達が最初の... だと思っていました。\n"
"タイミングが全てです。<i>時間</i>が全てです。\n"
"\n"
"ダウンタウンの Giga Co-Op に行ってD.Hの注文を受け取ると伝えてください。機械が渡されますが、起動したらオフラインのままにしておいてください。\n"
"\n"
"...ドライブに説明書があります。コード認証が終わったら、(ザッ)ポッドジャックの場所が分かります。データはまだサーバー上にあります。\n"
"\n"
"...製造ポッドからの電力を経路変更し、時間の弓に繋ぎました。時間封じ込めフィールドを完成させるための時間を稼いでいますが、「稼ぐ」ことは無理で実際には「借りて」いるだけです。我々の累積した負債規模は...\n"
"\n"
"我々が初めてではありません ...  全てが崩壊するとどうなるのか ...  何度も何度も... 私は長いこと時間の弓が他にも存在することを疑っていた ... もしそれらのうちの一つでも許容範囲を超えてしまったら ...\n"
"...世界線は分裂し、別の世界線に繋がれる...\n"
"\n"
"他に幾つの地球が...\n"
"\n"
"所長は他に何を犠牲にしたというのだ？\n"
"...(ザザッ)...</i>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.WHENIMGONE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.WHENIMGONE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: NONE"
msgstr "暗号化レベル: なし"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.WHENIMGONE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.WHENIMGONE.TITLE"
msgid "When I'm Gone"
msgstr "私が去った時"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.ANCIENTPODENTRY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.ANCIENTPODENTRY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<indent=%5>Notable improvement to nutrient retention: subjects who participated in the most recent meal intake displayed minimal symptoms of gastrointestinal distress.\n"
"\n"
"Mineshaft excavation at Urvara crater resumed following resolution of tunnel wall fracture. Projected time to brine reservoir penetration at current rate: 41 days, local time. Moisture seepage along eastern wall of shaft is being monitored.\n"
"\n"
"Note: Preliminary subsurface temperature data is significantly lower than programmed estimates.</indent>\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<indent=%5>栄養保持の顕著な改善：直近の食事摂取に参加した被験者には、胃腸障害の症状がほとんど見られない。\n"
"\n"
"ウルバラ火口での坑道掘削は、坑道壁の破壊が収まったため、再開済み。濃塩水貯水池貫通までの予想時間。41日（現地時間）。立坑の東側壁面に沿って水分が滲み出ていることを監視中。\n"
"\n"
"注：地下温度の速報値は、計画値よりかなり低い値となっている。</indent>\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.ANCIENTPODENTRY.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.ANCIENTPODENTRY.SUBTITLE"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>Day: 11/80</smallcaps>\n"
"<smallcaps>Local Time: Hour 7/9</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>経過日数: 11/80</smallcaps>\n"
"<smallcaps>現地時間: 7/9 時</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.ANCIENTPODENTRY.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.ANCIENTPODENTRY.TITLE"
msgid "Recovered Pod Entry #022"
msgstr "復元されたポッドデータ #022"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.BEGIN_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.BEGIN_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "First Encounter"
msgstr "未知との遭遇"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"An unfamiliar building has been discovered in my colony. There's movement inside but whoever the inhabitant is, they seem wary of us.\n"
"\n"
"If we can convince them that we mean no harm, we could very well end up with a fresh recruit <i>and</i> a useful new building."
msgstr ""
"コロニー内に見慣れぬ設備を発見した。中で動きがあったが、住人は我々を警戒しているようだ。\n"
"\n"
"我々が無害であることを納得させることができれば、新人<i>と</i>便利な設備両方を手に入れることができるかもしれない。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait: Mysterious Hermit"
msgstr "物語特性: 謎の仙人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.CREEPYBASEMENTLAB.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.CREEPYBASEMENTLAB.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Voice Recognition Initialized]\n"
"[Subjects Identified: B577, B997, B083, A216]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"A216: The Director said there were supposed to be three of you on this task force. Where's the geneticist?\n"
"\n"
"B083: In the bathroom-\n"
"\n"
"B997: He went home.\n"
"\n"
"[long pause]\n"
"\n"
"B997: It's the holidays. He has a family.\n"
"\n"
"A216: We all do. That's exactly why this project is so urgent.\n"
"\n"
"B997: It's not our fault this stuff sat in a subterranean ocean for a year, and took another year to get back to Earth! The microbe samples didn't fare well on the journey, and most of the mechanical components are completely corroded. There's not much to-\n"
"\n"
"B083: -we're analyzing it all and salvaging what we can, Jea- ...Dr. Saruhashi.\n"
"\n"
"A216: Good. And take down those ridiculous lights. This is a lab, not a retro \"shopping mall.\"\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"B577: Thanks for getting all the debris packed up for disposal.\n"
"\n"
"B997: I thought you did that.\n"
"\n"
"B577: No, I-\n"
"\n"
"B083: Who took my sandwich?\n"
"\n"
"B997: Not this again.\n"
"\n"
"B577: Ren, did you load the shipping container?\n"
"\n"
"B083: Seriously, I haven't eaten in thirteen hours. This isn't funny.\n"
"\n"
"B997: It's a little funny.\n"
"\n"
"B577: Can we focus, please?\n"
"\n"
"B997: Nobody took your sandwich, Rock Doc.\n"
"\n"
"B083: Then why does my food keep going missing?\n"
"\n"
"B997: Maybe the lab ghost took it. Or maybe you just shouldn't leave it out overnight. Gunderson probably thought it was garbage.\n"
"\n"
"B083: He doesn't even clean down here!\n"
"\n"
"B997: Right. Because if he did, I wouldn't have to keep sweeping up the magnesium sulfate deposits that <i>someone</i> keeps tracking all over the floor between shifts.\n"
"\n"
"B083: It's not me!\n"
"\n"
"B577: Listen, I know we're all tired and things have been a little strange. But the sooner we get this sent up to the launchpad, the sooner it starts its trip to the sun and we can all get out of this creepy sub-sub-basement.\n"
"\n"
"B083: Fine.\n"
"\n"
"B997: Fine.\n"
"\n"
"B083: Fine!\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[音声認識初期化]\n"
"[対象認識: B577, B997, B083, A216]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"A216: 所長によればこのタスクフォースには3人居るはずなんですが、遺伝子学者はどちらに？\n"
"\n"
"B083: シャワーを浴びて―\n"
"\n"
"B997: 帰ったよ。\n"
"\n"
"[長い沈黙]\n"
"\n"
"B997: 休暇期間なんだ。家族持ちなんだよ。\n"
"\n"
"A216: 皆そうです。だからこそこのプロジェクトは急務なんですよ。\n"
"\n"
"B997: こいつが一年も地底海に沈んでいて、地球に戻ってくるまでさらに一年要したのは私たちのせいじゃない。微生物のサンプルも上手くいかなかったし、機械部品のほとんどは腐食している。もうあまり―\n"
"\n"
"B083: 回収できたものをもう一度解析し直してみるよ。ジー、いやサルハシ博士。\n"
"\n"
"A216: よろしい。このバカげた照明も取り払いましょう。ここは研究室です。古風な「ショッピングモール」ではありません。\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"B577: 廃棄用にがらくたを包んでくれてありがとう。\n"
"\n"
"B997: あれ、やってくれたんじゃなかったの？\n"
"\n"
"B577: いいや？\n"
"\n"
"B083: 俺のサンドイッチ食べたの誰だ？\n"
"\n"
"B997: それも違うけど？\n"
"\n"
"B577: レンさんよ、輸送コンテナ動かしたか？\n"
"\n"
"B083: 頼むよ、こちとら30時間も食べてないんだ。ちっとも面白くないぞ。\n"
"\n"
"B997: こっちは面白いけどね。\n"
"\n"
"B577: お願いだから集中してくれ。\n"
"\n"
"B997: 誰もあなたのサンドイッチを食べたりしてませんよ。ロック博士。\n"
"\n"
"B083: じゃあ何で食べ物が勝手に消えたりするんだよ？\n"
"\n"
"B997: 研究室の幽霊かもしれないし、一昼夜放置してたからかもしれない。ガンダーソンがゴミだと思って捨てちゃったかも。\n"
"\n"
"B083: 奴はここに掃除しに来ないだろ！\n"
"\n"
"B997: そう。もし彼が来てくれたなら、シフトの合間に <i>誰か</i> が床に落とした硫酸マグネシウムを掃き集める必要がなくなるからね。\n"
"\n"
"B083: 俺じゃないぞ！\n"
"\n"
"B577: まあまあ、聞きなよ。皆疲れてるのは知ってるし、何かヘンな感じなのも分かる。でも、これをできるだけ早く発射台に送れさえすれば、すぐに太陽への旅に出かけられるし、この不気味な地下室からも脱出できるんだよ。\n"
"\n"
"B083: 分かったよ。\n"
"\n"
"B997: よろしい。\n"
"\n"
"B083: いいよもう！\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]\n"
"------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.CREEPYBASEMENTLAB.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.CREEPYBASEMENTLAB.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: THREE"
msgstr "暗号化レベル: 3"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.CREEPYBASEMENTLAB.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.CREEPYBASEMENTLAB.TITLE"
msgid "Debris Analysis"
msgstr "瓦礫の分析"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Discover a reclusive character living in a Gravitas relic, and persuade them to join this colony.\n"
"\n"
"Revelations from their past could have far-reaching implications for Duplicants everywhere.\n"
"\n"
"Even their makeshift shelter might be of some use..."
msgstr ""
"グラビタス遺構に住んでいる仙人を発見し、コロニーに参画するよう説得しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"彼の過去が明らかになれば全複製人間に多大な影響を与えるかもしれません。\n"
"\n"
"その場しのぎの住処でさえ何かの役に立つでしょう..."

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_BUILDINGMENU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_BUILDINGMENU"
msgid "The process of recruiting this building's lone occupant involves the completion of key tasks."
msgstr "この設備の住人を迎え入れる過程には、重要なタスクの完了が含まれています。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgid "Discover a reclusive character living in a Gravitas relic, and persuade them to join this colony."
msgstr "グラビタス遺構に住んでいる仙人を発見し、コロニーに参画するよう説得しましょう。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.BUTTON"
msgid "Welcome New Duplicant!"
msgstr "新人さんいらっしゃい！"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Challenge Completed"
msgstr "チャレンジ完了"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"My sweet Duplicants' efforts paid off! Our reclusive neighbor has agreed to join the colony.\n"
"\n"
"The only keepsake he insists on bringing with him is a toolbox which, while rusty, seems to hold great sentimental value.\n"
"\n"
"Now that he'll be living among us, his former home can be deconstructed or repurposed as storage."
msgstr ""
"複製人間達の努力が実った！引きこもっていた仙人はコロニーに参画することに同意してくれた。\n"
"\n"
"彼の唯一の持ち物は工具箱で、錆び付いてはいるが情緒に大きく訴えかける風情があるようだ。\n"
"\n"
"彼は我々と暮らすことになったので、古い住処は解体したり倉庫として再利用することにしよう。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait Complete: Mysterious Hermit"
msgstr "物語特性完了: 謎の仙人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.NAME"
msgid "The hermit hated this food"
msgstr "仙人はこの食糧が嫌い"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"The hermit would rather be launched straight into the sun than eat this slop.\n"
"\n"
"The mailbox is ready for another delivery"
msgstr ""
"仙人はこんなゲテモノを食べるくらいなら太陽に向かって発射してもらうほうがマシだと思っています。\n"
"\n"
"郵便受けは次の配達の準備が整っています"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.NAME"
msgid "The hermit is unimpressed"
msgstr "仙人は無感情"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"This meal has been offered before.\n"
"\n"
"The mailbox is ready for another delivery"
msgstr ""
"この食べ物は以前も食べたことがあるようです。\n"
"\n"
"郵便受けは次の配達の準備が整っています"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.NAME"
msgid "The hermit loved this food"
msgstr "仙人はこの食糧が好き"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"Tastier than the still-warm pretzel that once fell off an unsupervised desk.\n"
"\n"
"The mailbox is ready for another delivery"
msgstr ""
"監視されていないデスクから落ちた、まだ温かいプレッツェルよりも美味しいです。\n"
"\n"
"郵便受けは次の配達の準備が整っています"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.HOLIDAYCARD.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.HOLIDAYCARD.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Hey kiddo,\n"
"\n"
"We missed you at your cousin's wedding last weekend. The gift was nice, but the dance floor felt empty without you.\n"
"\n"
"Dariush sends his love. He's really turned a corner since he started eating those gooey pudding things you sent over. Any chance you have a version that doesn't smell like feet?\n"
"\n"
"Come home sometime when you're not so busy.\n"
"\n"
"- Baba\n"
"------------------\n"
msgstr ""
"やあ。\n"
"\n"
"先週末のいとこの結婚式ではついぞ会えなかったね。贈り物は素晴らしかったけど、君が居ないと空っぽのダンスフロアに居る気分だったよ。\n"
"\n"
"ダリウスから愛をこめて。君が贈った甘くてベタベタなプディングを食べた彼はようやく快方に向かっているよ。足の臭いがしないやつは無かったのかい？\n"
"\n"
"時間がある時は家に帰ってきてね。\n"
"\n"
"- ババ\n"
"------------------\n"

