#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]\n"
"[Voice Recognition Unavailable]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[LOG BEGINS]\n"
"\n"
"...and then the Printing Pod says \"Knock knock, goo's there!\"\n"
"\n"
"Ugh. They'll never laugh at <i>that</i> stinker.\n"
"\n"
"What if-\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a ding)\n"
"\n"
"Hey hey, squishy little buddy! Look who's all grown up. You ready for a big robot ride? Dr. Seyed Ali should be back from his meeting any minute. He'll be so happy to see you.\n"
"\n"
"(sound of a wet slap on glass)\n"
"\n"
"Aww yeah, I'd be impatient too.\n"
"\n"
"You know what, why don't I go ahead and get you into your new home? I've helped him do this more than a dozen times.\n"
"\n"
"\"See one, do one, teach one,\" right?\n"
"\n"
"[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps>[ログ断片検知]\n"
"[音声認識利用不可]</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
"[ログ開始]\n"
"\n"
"...そして製造ポッドが言いました。「ほら、グーですよ！」\n"
"\n"
"うっ、彼らは<i>あの</i>臭い奴を笑ったりしないな。\n"
"\n"
"もし、―\n"
"\n"
"(カタカタという音)\n"
"\n"
"やあやあ小さな相棒、大きくなったな！巨大ロボットに乗る準備はできたか？シード アリ博士も打ち合わせから戻ってくるはずだ。お前を見たらきっと喜ぶぞ。\n"
"\n"
"(ガラスをべたべたと叩く音)\n"
"\n"
"ああ、そうだな。待ちきれないよ。\n"
"\n"
"そうだ、私がお前を新しい家に移し替えてあげようか？彼の手伝いでこの作業を何度もやったしね。\n"
"\n"
"「見せる、やらせる、教える」だろう？\n"
"\n"
"[ログ終了]"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.TITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: THREE"
msgstr "暗号化レベル: 3"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"I am\n"
"   a subatomic particle\n"
"smaller than a speck of dust\n"
"  flushed from your gaze\n"
"\n"
"     at the eyewash station  \n"
"\n"
"   My love is like plutonium\n"
" gray and dull and\n"
"unbearably heavy\n"
"  until    I am near you\n"
"\n"
" with every breath \n"
"      I burn, with\n"
"    yearning\n"
"              unseen\n"
"\n"
"PS: I made Steve let me in so I could leave you this, hope that's okay."
msgstr ""
"私は\n"
"    亜原子粒子\n"
"塵より小さい\n"
"   あなたの視線から零れ落ちた\n"
"\n"
"      洗眼所で\n"
"\n"
"    私の愛はプルトニウムのようなもの\n"
"  灰色で鈍くて、\n"
"耐えられないほど重い\n"
"   私があなたのそばにいるまでは\n"
"\n"
"  息をするたびに\n"
"       私は燃えます\n"
"     見えない\n"
"               憧れと共に\n"
"\n"
"PS: これを残しておくためにスティーブに中に入れてもらいました、大丈夫だといいのですが。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.TITLE"
msgid "Anonymous Admirer"
msgstr "匿名の崇拝者"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_1"
msgid "Stress"
msgstr "ストレス"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_2"
msgid "Stress Responses"
msgstr "ストレス反応"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_3"
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "チュートリアル"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid ""
"A Duplicant's experiences in the colony affect their stress level. Stress increases when they have negative experiences or unmet expectations. Stress decreases with time if <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> is satisfied. Duplicant behavior starts to change for the worse when stress levels get too high.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"複製人間がコロニー内でする体験は、彼らのストレスレベルに影響を及ぼします。負の経験や期待に合わない経験はストレスを上昇させます。ストレスは<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>が十分ある場合は減少します。ストレスレベルが高すぎる複製人間はその振る舞いが悪いものへと変貌します。\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid ""
"If a Duplicant has very high stress values they will experience a Stress Response episode. Each Duplicant has a different Stress Behavior - but all stress responses are bad. After the stress behavior episode is done, the Duplicants stress will reset to a lower value. Though, if the factors causing the Duplicant's high stress are not corrected they are bound to have another stress response episode.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"複製人間が高レベルのストレス値に達すると、ストレス反応が見られるようになります。複製人間ごとに異なるストレス反応を持ちますが、いずれも良くないものです。ストレス反応がひとしきり終わると、複製人間のストレスは低い値にリセットされます。しかし、高レベルのストレスとなった原因が解消されない限り、また別のストレス反応を引き起こすことになります。\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid ""
"To learn more about managing Duplicants' moods, watch <link=\"VIDEOS13\">Video: Duplicant Morale</link> and see <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS2\">Tutorial: Stress Management</link>.\n"
"\n"
msgstr "複製人間の士気管理について詳しくは、<link=\"VIDEOS13\">ビデオ: 複製人間の士気</link> と <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS2\">チュートリアル: ストレス管理</link> をご覧ください。\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.TITLE"
