#. STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Tranquil Toes are a decorative succulent that flourish in a radioactive environment.\n"
"\n"
"Though most of the flora and fauna that thrive a harsh radioactive biome tends to be aggressive, Tranquil Toes provide a rare exception to this rule.\n"
"\n"
"It is a generally believed that the morale boosting abilities of this plant come from its resemblence to a funny hat one might wear at a party."
msgstr ""
"アシモミは放射性環境下で繁茂する装飾用の多肉植物です。\n"
"\n"
"過酷な放射性バイオームで繁栄する動植物のほとんどは攻撃的ですが、アシモミはこのルールには珍しい例外です。\n"
"\n"
"この植物が士気を高める効果について、パーティーで被る面白帽子に似ているところから来ていると一般には信じられています。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "観葉植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.TITLE"
msgid "Tranquil Toes"
msgstr "アシモミ"

