msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.MESSAGE_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.MESSAGE_BODY"
msgid ""
"Huzzah! We have shown the survivor that ours is a colony worth joining.\n"
"\n"
"She says her name is Minnow. Her serene temperament and ability to survive long stretches without oxygen will serve us well as we face the infinite challenges of marine colony-building."
msgstr ""
"やった！生き残ったミノーに、私たちのコロニーが仲間入りする価値のある場所だと示すことができた！\n"
"\n"
"彼女は自身をミノーと名乗っている。穏やかな性格と、酸素のない状態でも長時間生き延びられる能力は、海洋コロニー建設という果てしない挑戦に立ち向かう私たちにとって、きっと大きな力となるだろう。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.MESSAGE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.MESSAGE_TITLE"
msgid "IN GOOD COMPANY"
msgstr "素晴らしい仲間がいるよ"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.NAME"
msgid "Better Together"
msgstr "一緒が良いね"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_A_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_A_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Success! My Duplicants harvested {AMOUNT1} pearls to offer to our potential future crewmate.\n"
"\n"
"We now have {AMOUNT2} new gasket and 2 Flue Coral seeds to use as needed."
msgstr ""
"うまくいった！私の複製人間たちが{AMOUNT1}個の真珠を収穫し、将来のクルーメイト候補に贈呈した。\n"
"\n"
"これで{AMOUNT2}個の新しいガスケットと、必要に応じて使えるフルーサンゴの種子が2個手に入った。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_A_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_A_TITLE"
msgid "RECRUIT SURVIVOR: Pearls Delivered"
msgstr "生存者を招致せよ: 真珠の配達"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_B_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_B_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Success! We have produced {AMOUNT1} sushi to share with the survivor Duplicant as a gesture of goodwill.\n"
"\n"
"We now have {AMOUNT2} new gasket and 2 Gum Palm seeds to use as needed."
msgstr ""
"またしても成功！生存者である複製人間に善意の証として、{AMOUNT1}個の寿司を分け与えることができた。\n"
"\n"
"これで、{AMOUNT2}個の新しいガスケットと、必要に応じて使用できるゴムヤシの種子が2個手に入った。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_B_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_B_TITLE"
msgid "RECRUIT SURVIVOR: Sushi Delivered"
msgstr "生存者を招致せよ: 寿司の配達"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_C_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_C_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Success! We have procured {AMOUNT1} caviar to offer to our splashy neighbour.\n"
"\n"
"We now have {AMOUNT2} new gasket to use as needed."
msgstr ""
"今回も成功！派手好きな隣​​人に贈るキャビアを{AMOUNT1}個確保した。\n"
"\n"
"これで、必要に応じて使える新しいガスケットが{AMOUNT2}個手に入った。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_C_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_COMPLETE_POI_C_TITLE"
msgid "RECRUIT SURVIVOR: Caviar Delivered"
msgstr "生存者を招致せよ: キャビアの配達"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_A_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_A_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"My Duplicants found the survivor exploring the Reef biome. She seems fascinated by the Clampum.\n"
"\n"
"She offered to trade us {AMOUNT1} Gasket and 2 Flue Coral seeds for {AMOUNT2} of its pearls.\n"
"\n"
"I must enable delivery to ensure we keep our end of this bargain."
msgstr ""
"複製人間たちがサンゴバイオームを探索していた生存者を発見した。彼女はクランパンに魅了されているようだ。\n"
"\n"
"彼女は{AMOUNT1}個のガスケットとフルーサンゴの種子2個を{AMOUNT2}個の真珠と交換することを提案してきた。\n"
"\n"
"この取引を確実に履行するためには、配達を有効にする必要があるだろう。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_A_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_A_TITLE"
msgid "Recruit Survivor: {0}/{1}"
msgstr "生存者を招致せよ: {0}/{1}"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_B_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_B_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"My Duplicants found the survivor exploring the Kelp Forest biome. She appears to be hungry.\n"
"\n"
"My Duplicants offered to exchange {AMOUNT1} of sushi for {AMOUNT2} Gasket and 2 Gum Palm seeds, and she agreed.\n"
"\n"
"I must enable delivery to ensure she receives our package."
msgstr ""
"複製人間たちがケルプの森バイオームを探索していた生存者を発見した。彼女は空腹のようだ。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間たちは{AMOUNT1}個の寿司に対し{AMOUNT2}のガスケット、そしてゴムヤシの種2個を交換することを提案し、彼女は同意した。\n"
"\n"
"彼女に荷物が届くように、配達を有効にする必要があるだろう。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_B_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_B_TITLE"
msgid "Recruit Survivor: {0}/{1}"
msgstr "生存者を招致せよ: {0}/{1}"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_C_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_C_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"My Duplicants found the survivor exploring the Abyss biome. She has been observing our machinery and seems particularly intrigued by caviar.\n"
"\n"
"We have agreed to exchange {AMOUNT1} of caviar for {AMOUNT2} Gasket.\n"
"\n"
"I must enable delivery to guarantee its fulfilment."
msgstr ""
"複製人間たちが、アビスバイオームを探索していた生存者を発見した。彼女は私たちの機械を観察しており、特にキャビアに興味を示しているようだ。\n"
"\n"
"私たちは{AMOUNT1}個のキャビアと{AMOUNT2}のガスケットを交換することで合意した。\n"
"\n"
"確実に取引を完了させるには、配達を有効にする必要があるだろう。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_C_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.FINDING_MINNOW.POPUPS.POPUP_START_POI_C_TITLE"
msgid "Recruit Survivor: {0}/{1}"
msgstr "生存者を招致せよ: {0}/{1}"

