msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.THRIVING.MESSAGE_BODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.THRIVING.MESSAGE_BODY"
msgid ""
"Few civilizations throughout time have had the privilege of understanding their origins. The one thing that matters is that we are here now, and we make the best of the world we've been given. I am proud to say...\n"
"\n"
"This asteroid is our home."
msgstr ""
"長い歴史の中で、自分たちの起源を知るという機会に恵まれる文明など、ほとんど存在しない。ただ重要なのは、我々が今ここにいて、与えられた世界を最大限に活用しているということだ。私は誇りを持って言おう...\n"
"\n"
"この小惑星が私たちの故郷であると。"

#. STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.THRIVING.MESSAGE_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.COLONY_ACHIEVEMENTS.THRIVING.MESSAGE_TITLE"
msgid "THIS IS OUR HOME"
msgstr "これが我が家だ"

