#. STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.HEAVYFRUIT.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.PLANT_MUTATIONS.HEAVYFRUIT.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Extra water in these plump mutant veggies causes them to fall right off the plant! There's no extra nutritional value, though..."
msgstr "水分をたっぷり含んだこの変異種は、今にも枝から落ちてしまいそうです！栄養分もたっぷり...とはいかないようです。"

