#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.STEAM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.STEAM.DESC"
msgid "A highly pressurized vent that periodically erupts with <link=\"STEAM\">Steam</link>."
msgstr "定期的に<link=\"STEAM\">蒸気</link>を噴き上げる、高圧の噴出孔です。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.STEAM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.STEAM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GEYSERGENERICSTEAM\">Cool Steam Vent</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GEYSERGENERICSTEAM\">蒸気噴出孔</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.UNDERWATERVENT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.UNDERWATERVENT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A subaquatic fissure that allows high-pressure <link=\"METHANE\">Natural Gas</link> to escape from the planet's crust.\n"
"\n"
"Blockages caused by built-up <link=\"SULFUR\">Sulfur</link> can be removed using a <link=\"UNDERWATERVENTDRILL\">Marine Drill</link>."
msgstr ""
"高圧の<link=\"METHANE\">天然ガス</link>が地殻から噴出する、海底の亀裂です。\n"
"\n"
"蓄積した<link=\"SULFUR\">硫黄</link>によって生じた閉塞は、<link=\"UNDERWATERVENTDRILL\">海中ドリル</link>を使用して除去できます。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.UNDERWATERVENT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.UNDERWATERVENT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"UNDERWATERVENT\">Thermal Gas Fissure</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"UNDERWATERVENT\">熱ガス噴出孔</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A little yipping Shatter Flox Fawn.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"GLASSDEER\">Shatter Flox</link>."
msgstr ""
"ちいさな、のどを鳴らして甘えているワレモノフロックス幼体です。\n"
"\n"
"時間経過とともに成長し、<link=\"GLASSDEER\">ワレモノフロックス</link>になります。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GLASSDEER\">Shatter Flox Fawn</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GLASSDEER\">ワレモノフロックス幼体</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Shatter Floxes are nonhostile critters that can subsist on <link=\"PRICKLEFLOWER\">Bristle Blossom</link> and <link=\"HARDSKINBERRYPLANT\">Pikeapple Bush</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Their shearable <link=\"GLASS\">Glass</link> antlers grow only when they are fed <link=\"KATAIRITE\">Abyssalite</link>."
msgstr ""
"ワレモノフロックスは生えているまたは落ちている<link=\"PRICKLEFLOWER\">ブリッスルブロッサム</link>や<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">パイクップル</link>を食べる非敵対的な生き物です。\n"
"\n"
"ワレモノフロックスの角は<link=\"KATAIRITE\">アビサライト</link>を食べると硬くなり、切り取れる<link=\"GLASS\">ガラス</link>になります。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GLASSDEER\">Shatter Flox Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GLASSDEER\">ワレモノフロックスの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLASSDEER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GLASSDEER\">Shatter Flox</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GLASSDEER\">ワレモノフロックス</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLOM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLOM.DESC"
msgid "Morbs are attracted to unhygienic conditions and frequently excrete bursts of <link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">Polluted Oxygen</link>."
msgstr "モーブは死体の腐敗した組織に引き寄せられ、<link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">汚染酸素</link>を頻繁に排出します。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLOM.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLOM.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MORB\">Morb Pod</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MORB\">モーブポッド</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLOM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GLOM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GLOM\">Morb</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GLOM\">モーブ</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GREEDYGREEN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GREEDYGREEN.DESC"
msgid "A rapidly growing, subterranean <link=\"PLANTS\">Plant</link>."
msgstr "急速に成長する、地下<link=\"PLANTS\">植物</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GREEDYGREEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GREEDYGREEN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GREEDYGREEN\">Avari Vine</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GREEDYGREEN\">アヴァリの蔦</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HARDSKINBERRYPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HARDSKINBERRYPLANT.DESC"
msgid "Pikeapple bushes produce <link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">Pikeapple</link>, a useful yet almost unbearably fragrant <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr "パイクップルの低木は、有用とはいえ強烈な匂いを放つ<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>である<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">パイクップル</link>を生産します。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HARDSKINBERRYPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HARDSKINBERRYPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">Pikeapple</link>."
msgstr "この植物には食用の<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">パイクップル</link>を生産します。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HARDSKINBERRYPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HARDSKINBERRYPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HARDSKINBERRYPLANT\">Pikeapple Bush</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HARDSKINBERRYPLANT\">パイクップルの低木</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"An innocent little Hatchling.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will mature into an adult <link=\"HATCH\">Hatch</link>."
msgstr ""
"無邪気で小さなハッチ幼体です。\n"
"\n"
"時間経過とともに成長し、<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチ</link>になります。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCH\">Hatchling</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチ幼体</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.DESC"
msgid "Hatches excrete solid <link=\"CARBON\">Coal</link> as waste and may be uncovered by digging up Buried Objects."
msgstr "ハッチは固形の<link=\"CARBON\">石炭</link>を排泄します。埋もれた物体を掘り起こすことで現れることがあります。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCH\">Hatch Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCH\">Hatch</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチ</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A doofy little Stone Hatchling.\n"
"\n"
"It matures into an adult Hatch morph, the <link=\"HATCHHARD\">Stone Hatch</link>, which loves nibbling on various rocks and metals."
msgstr ""
"ちょっとおつむの足りない小さなごつごつハッチ幼体です。\n"
"\n"
"時間経過とともに成長し、種々の岩や金属をかじるのが大好きな<link=\"HATCHHARD\">ごつごつ ハッチ</link>になります。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHHARD\">Stone Hatchling</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHHARD\">ごつごつ ハッチ幼体</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.DESC"
msgid "Stone Hatches excrete solid <link=\"CARBON\">Coal</link> as waste and enjoy burrowing into the ground."
msgstr "ごつごつ ハッチは固形の<link=\"CARBON\">石炭</link>を排泄します。地面を掘り進むことを好みます。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHHARD\">Stone Hatch Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHHARD\">ごつごつ ハッチの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_HARD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHHARD\">Stone Hatch</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHHARD\">ごつごつ ハッチ</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A doofy little Smooth Hatchling.\n"
"\n"
"It matures into an adult Hatch morph, the <link=\"HATCHMETAL\">Smooth Hatch</link>, which loves nibbling on different types of metals."
msgstr ""
"ちょっとおつむの足りない小さなつるつるハッチ幼体です。\n"
"\n"
"時間経過とともに成長し、種々の金属をかじるのが大好きな<link=\"HATCHMETAL\">つるつる ハッチ</link>になります。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHMETAL\">Smooth Hatchling</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHMETAL\">つるつる ハッチ幼体</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.DESC"
msgid "Smooth Hatches enjoy burrowing into the ground and excrete <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Refined Metal</link> when fed <link=\"METAL\">Metal Ore</link>."
msgstr "つるつるハッチは地面を掘り進むことを好み、<link=\"RAWMETAL\">金属鉱石</link>を食べ<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">精錬金属</link>を排出します。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHMETAL\">Smooth Hatch Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHMETAL\">つるつる ハッチの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_METAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHMETAL\">Smooth Hatch</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHMETAL\">つるつる ハッチ</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A doofy little Sage Hatchling.\n"
"\n"
"It matures into an adult Hatch morph, the <link=\"HATCHVEGGIE\">Sage Hatch</link>, which loves nibbling on organic materials."
msgstr ""
"ちょっとおつむの足りない小さなセイジハッチ幼体です。\n"
"\n"
"時間経過とともに成長し、有機素材をかじるのが大好きな<link=\"HATCHVEGGIE\">セイジ ハッチ</link>になります。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHVEGGIE\">Sage Hatchling</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCHVEGGIE\">セイジ ハッチ幼体</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.DESC"
msgid "Sage Hatches excrete solid <link=\"CARBON\">Coal</link> as waste and enjoy burrowing into the ground."
msgstr "セイジ ハッチは固形の<link=\"CARBON\">石炭</link>を排泄します。地面を掘り進むことを好みます。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.HATCH.VARIANT_VEGGIE.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCHVEGGIE\">Sage Hatch Egg</link>"
