#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SNAIL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SNAIL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Slogos are nonhostile critters that consume <link=\"SALT\">Salt</link> and excrete <link=\"DIRT\">Dirt</link>.\n"
"\n"
"The shells they leave behind after molting can be crushed into <link=\"LIME\">Lime</link>.\n"
"\n"
"They also leave large amounts of <link=\"MUCUS\">Mucin</link> in their wake."
msgstr ""
"スロッゴは<link=\"SALT\">塩</link>を食べ、<link=\"DIRT\">土</link>を排泄する非敵対的な動物です。\n"
"\n"
"彼らが脱皮の後に残す殻は、粉砕して<link=\"LIME\">石灰</link>にできます。\n"
"\n"
"また、彼らは大量の<link=\"MUCUS\">ムチン</link>を残していきます。"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SNAIL.EGG_NAME
