#. STRINGS.CREATURES.STATS.HAPPINESS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.STATS.HAPPINESS.NAME"
msgid "Happiness"
msgstr "幸福度"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.STATS.HAPPINESS.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.STATS.HAPPINESS.TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"High <style=\"KKeyword\">Happiness</style> increases a critter's productivity and indirectly improves their <style=\"KKeyword\">Egg</style> laying rates\n"
"\n"
"It also provides the satisfaction in knowing they're living a good little critter life"
msgstr ""
"高い<style=\"KKeyword\">幸福度</style>は動物の繁殖力を増加させ、産卵までの時間を短縮します\n"
"\n"
"彼らの幸せな生活を観察することは満足感にもつながります"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.STATS.HAPPINESS.TOOLTIP_LUX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.STATS.HAPPINESS.TOOLTIP_LUX"
msgid ""
"High <style=\"KKeyword\">Happiness</style> increases a critter's productivity and enables them to produce <style=\"KKeyword\">Light</style>\n"
"\n"
"It also indirectly improves their <style=\"KKeyword\">Egg</style> laying rates"
msgstr ""
"高い<style=\"KKeyword\">幸福度</style>は動物の生産性を向上させ、<style=\"KKeyword\">光</style>を放つようになります\n"
"\n"
"また産<style=\"KKeyword\">卵</style>率も向上します"

