#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.DESC"
msgid ""
"Bionic Duplicants run on <link=\"ELECTROBANK\">Power Banks</link>, <link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">Gear Oil</link> and unbridled enthusiasm.\n"
"\n"
"They should not be permitted to use standard <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS\">Toilets</link>."
msgstr ""
"バイオニック複製人間は<link=\"ELECTROBANK\">電力バンク</link>、<link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">ギアオイル</link>、そして抑えきれない情熱で駆動します。\n"
"\n"
"彼らには標準的な<link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS\">トイレ</link>の使用を許可すべきではありません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DUPLICANTS\">Bionic Duplicant</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DUPLICANTS\">バイオニック複製人間</link>"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME_ADJECTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME_ADJECTIVE"
msgid "<link=\"DUPLICANTS\">Bionic</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DUPLICANTS\">バイオニック</link>"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME_TOOLTIP"
msgid "This Duplicant is a curious combination of organic and inorganic parts"
msgstr "この複製人間は有機物と非有機物の奇妙な組み合わせです"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.REMOTEWORKER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.REMOTEWORKER.DESC"
msgid ""
"A remotely operated work robot.\n"
"\n"
"It performs chores as instructed by a <link=\"REMOTEWORKTERMINAL\">Remote Controller</link> on the same planetoid."
msgstr ""
"遠隔操作の労働ロボットです。\n"
"\n"
"同じ小惑星内の<link=\"REMOTEWORKTERMINAL\">リモートコントローラー</link>で作業を指示できます。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.REMOTEWORKER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.REMOTEWORKER.NAME"
msgid "Remote Worker"
msgstr "リモートワーカー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.STANDARD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.STANDARD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Standard Duplicants are hard workers who enjoy good <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>, fresh <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> and creative colony-building.\n"
"\n"
"They will complete errands in order of <link=\"PRIORITY\">Priority</link>."
msgstr ""
"標準的な複製人間は美味しい<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>、新鮮な<link=\"OXYGEN\">酸素</link>、創造的なコロニー建設を好む働き者です。\n"
"\n"
"彼らは<link=\"PRIORITY\">優先度</link>に従って作業をこなします。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.STANDARD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.STANDARD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DUPLICANTS\">Standard Duplicant</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DUPLICANTS\">標準複製人間</link>"

