msgstr "睡眠不足: 明るすぎ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.BADSLEEP.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.BADSLEEP.TOOLTIP"
msgid "This Duplicant tossed and turned all night because a <style=\"KKeyword\">Light</style> was left on where they were trying to sleep"
msgstr "寝ようとした所の<style=\"KKeyword\">照明</style>がつけっぱなしだったので、複製人間は一晩中寝返りを打っていました"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODIFIERS.BADSLEEPAFRAIDOFDARK.NAME
