msgstr "チップ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.DEVON.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.DEVON.DESC"
msgid "This {0} dreams of owning their own personal computer so they can start a blog full of pictures of toast."
msgstr "{0}には夢があり、それはマイPCを所持しトーストの写真をたくさん載せたブログを始めることです。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.DEVON.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.DEVON.NAME"
msgid "Devon"
msgstr "デボン"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.EDWIREDO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.EDWIREDO.DESC"
msgid "This {0} once rolled his eye so hard that he powered himself off and on again."
msgstr "この{0}は目玉をぐるりと大回転させることで自分の電源をON/OFFしたことがあります。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.EDWIREDO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.EDWIREDO.NAME"
msgid "Edwiredo"
msgstr "エドワイアード"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ELLIE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ELLIE.DESC"
msgid "Nothing makes an {0} happier than a big tin of glitter and a pack of unicorn stickers."
msgstr "ぴかぴか光る缶詰とユニコーンステッカーの詰め合わせ以上に{0}をハッピーにするものはありません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ELLIE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ELLIE.NAME"
msgid "Ellie"
msgstr "エリー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FRANKIE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FRANKIE.DESC"
msgid "There's nothing {0}s are more proud of than their thick, dignified eyebrows."
msgstr "{0}は自分の太く凛々しい眉毛を最も自慢にしています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FRANKIE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FRANKIE.NAME"
msgid "Frankie"
msgstr "フランキー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FREYJA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FREYJA.DESC"
msgid "This {0} has never stopped anyone from eating yellow snow."
msgstr ""
"この{0}は誰かが黄色い雪を食べるのを止めたことはありません。\n"
"(訳注: 黄色い雪はおしっこがかかった雪のこと)"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FREYJA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.FREYJA.NAME"
msgid "Freyja"
msgstr "フレイヤ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GIZMO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GIZMO.DESC"
msgid "{0}s love nothing more than a big juicy info dump."
msgstr "{0}は大量の情報ダンプを何よりも愛します。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GIZMO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GIZMO.NAME"
msgid "Gizmo"
msgstr "ギズモ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GOSSMANN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GOSSMANN.DESC"
msgid "{0}s are major goofballs who can make anyone laugh."
msgstr "{0}は老若男女を笑わせられる、素敵なお間抜けさんです。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GOSSMANN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.GOSSMANN.NAME"
msgid "Gossmann"
msgstr "ゴスマン"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HAROLD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HAROLD.DESC"
msgid "Get a bunch of {0}s together in a room, and you'll have... a bunch of {0}s together in a room."
msgstr "大勢の{0}を1つの部屋に押し込むと...、ほら、大勢の{0}が1つの部屋に居るでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HAROLD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HAROLD.NAME"
msgid "Harold"
msgstr "ハロルド"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HASSAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HASSAN.DESC"
msgid "If someone says something nice to a {0} he'll think about it nonstop for no less than three weeks."
msgstr "誰かが{0}を褒めると、彼は少なくとも三週間はそのことばかり考えています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HASSAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HASSAN.NAME"
msgid "Hassan"
msgstr "ハッサン"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HIGBY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HIGBY.DESC"
msgid "This {0}'s got a song in his heart. Now if only he could remember how it goes."
msgstr "この{0}は心に歌を刻んでいます。歌詞を思い出せたらいいのに。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HIGBY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.HIGBY.NAME"
msgid "Higby"
msgstr "ヒグビー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JEAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JEAN.DESC"
msgid "Just because {0}s are a little slow doesn't mean they can't suffer from soul-crushing existential crises."
msgstr "{0}がトロいからといって、精神的ダメージをもたらす実存的危機にさらされないというわけではありません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JEAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JEAN.NAME"
msgid "Jean"
msgstr "ジーン"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JORGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JORGE.DESC"
msgid "{0} loves his new colony, even if their collective body odor makes his eyes water."
msgstr "{0}は新しいコロニーを気に入っています。たとえ彼らの体臭がきつくて目に沁みるとしても。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JORGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JORGE.NAME"
msgid "Jorge"
msgstr "ジョージ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JOSHUA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JOSHUA.DESC"
msgid "{0}s are precious goobers. Other Duplicants are strangely incapable of cursing in a {0}'s presence."
msgstr "{0}は貴重なお馬鹿さんです。奇妙なことに、他の複製人間は{0}を馬鹿にすることを許しません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JOSHUA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.JOSHUA.NAME"
msgid "Joshua"
msgstr "ジョシュア"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.KAI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.KAI.DESC"
msgid "The secret to a {0}'s perfectly soft hair is marine mineral hair masks."
msgstr "{0}の完璧に柔らかい髪の秘訣は、海洋ミネラルヘアマスクです。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.KAI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.KAI.NAME"
msgid "Kai"
msgstr "カイ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LEIRA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LEIRA.DESC"
msgid "{0}s just want everyone to be happy."
msgstr "{0}は皆を幸せにしたいと思っています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LEIRA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LEIRA.NAME"
msgid "Leira"
msgstr "レイラ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LIAM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LIAM.DESC"
msgid "No matter how much this {0} scrubs, he can never truly feel clean."
msgstr "{0}がいくら手洗いをしても、彼は奇麗になったと感じることができません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LIAM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LIAM.NAME"
msgid "Liam"
msgstr "リアム"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LINDSAY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LINDSAY.DESC"
msgid "A {0} is a charming woman, unless you make the mistake of messing with one of her friends."
msgstr "{0}は魅力的で愉快な女性です。あなたが彼女の友達に粗相をしないうちは。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LINDSAY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.LINDSAY.NAME"
msgid "Lindsay"
msgstr "リンゼイ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAE.DESC"
msgid "There's nothing a {0} can't do if she sets her mind to it."
msgstr "{0}は一度心に決めたことは必ずやり遂げます。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAE.NAME"
msgid "Mae"
msgstr "メイ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MARIE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MARIE.DESC"
msgid "This {0} is positively glowing! What's her secret? Radioactive isotopes, of course."
msgstr "{0}はとても陽気に輝いています！その秘密は？もちろん、放射性同位体です。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MARIE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MARIE.NAME"
msgid "Marie"
msgstr "マリー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAX.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAX.DESC"
msgid "At any given moment a {0} is viscerally reliving ten different humiliating memories."
msgstr "いつどんな時でも、{0}は10個の異なる屈辱的な記憶を腹の底から思い出せます。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAX.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAX.NAME"
msgid "Max"
msgstr "マックス"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAYA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAYA.DESC"
msgid "This {0} got her hand crushed in a pneumatic door once. It was the most alive she's ever felt."
msgstr "この{0}は空気ドアに手を挟まれたことがあります。あれは彼女にとって最も生を感じた瞬間でした。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAYA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MAYA.NAME"
msgid "Maya"
msgstr "マヤ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MEEP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MEEP.DESC"
msgid "{0}s have a face only a two tonne Printing Pod could love."
msgstr "{0}は2tの製造ポッドだけが愛する酷い顔立ちをしています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MEEP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MEEP.NAME"
msgid "Meep"
msgstr "ミープ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MIMA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MIMA.DESC"
msgid "Ol' {0} here can't stand lookin' at people's knees."
msgstr "昔の{0}は他人の膝を見ることに我慢できなかったものです。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MIMA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MIMA.NAME"
msgid "Mi-Ma"
msgstr "ミーマ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MINNOW.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MINNOW.DESC"
msgid "{0} always goes with the flow. Unless the flow is going somewhere boring."
msgstr "{0}は常に流れに身を任せます。ただし、流れが退屈な方向へ向かっている場合は別です。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MINNOW.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.MINNOW.NAME"
msgid "Minnow"
msgstr "ミノー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NAILS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NAILS.DESC"
msgid "People often expect a Duplicant named \"{0}\" to be tough, but they're all pretty huge wimps."
msgstr "人々は \"{0}\" と名付けられた複製人間にタフさを求めます。しかし、彼らは全員びっくりするほど弱虫です。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NAILS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NAILS.NAME"
msgid "Nails"
msgstr "ナイルズ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NIKOLA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NIKOLA.DESC"
msgid "This {0} once claimed he could build a laser so powerful it would rip the colony in half. No one asked him to prove it."
msgstr "コロニーを真っ二つにできるほど強力なレーザーを製作できると{0}は常々主張していますが、だれもそうしてくれとは言いません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NIKOLA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NIKOLA.NAME"
msgid "Nikola"
msgstr "ニコラ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NISBET.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NISBET.DESC"
msgid "This {0} likes to punch people to show her affection. Everyone's too afraid of her to tell her it hurts."
msgstr "{0}は愛情表現として他人を殴打したがります。皆はそれが痛いことを彼女に言うと、とても傷付くのではと危惧しています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NISBET.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.NISBET.NAME"
msgid "Nisbet"
msgstr "ニスベット"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.OTTO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.OTTO.DESC"
msgid "{0}s always insult people by accident and generally exist in a perpetual state of deep regret."
msgstr "{0}は他人にうっかり失礼をしてしまうと、それをずっと後悔しています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.OTTO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.OTTO.NAME"
msgid "Otto"
msgstr "オットー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.PEI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.PEI.DESC"
msgid "Every {0} spends at least half the day pretending that they remember what they came into this room for."
msgstr "{0}は少なくとも半日以上、この部屋に何しに来たかを覚えている振りをして過ごします。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.PEI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.PEI.NAME"
msgid "Pei"
msgstr "ペイ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.QUINN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.QUINN.DESC"
msgid "This {0}'s favorite genre of music is \"festive power ballad\"."
msgstr "{0}が好きな音楽ジャンルは「力強いお祭りバラード」です。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.QUINN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.QUINN.NAME"
msgid "Quinn"
msgstr "クイン"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.REN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.REN.DESC"
msgid "Every {0} has this unshakable feeling that his life's already happened and he's just watching it unfold from a memory."
msgstr "{0}は自身の人生がすでに終わっていて、今は走馬灯のように振り返っているんだという揺るぎない感情を持っています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.REN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.REN.NAME"
msgid "Ren"
msgstr "レン"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ROWAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ROWAN.DESC"
msgid "{0}s have exceptionally large hearts and express their emotions most efficiently by yelling."
msgstr "{0}は特別大きな心臓を持ち、叫び声で感情を最大限に表現します。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ROWAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ROWAN.NAME"
msgid "Rowan"
msgstr "ローワン"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.RUBY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.RUBY.DESC"
msgid "This {0} asks the pressing questions, like \"Where can I get a leather jacket in space?\""
msgstr "{0}は「この宇宙のどこで皮ジャケットが手に入るの？」といった緊急動議を起こします。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.RUBY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.RUBY.NAME"
msgid "Ruby"
msgstr "ルビー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SENA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SENA.DESC"
msgid "{0}s only care about three things: gold accents, true crime, and the advancement of nuclear physics."
msgstr "{0}が関心を持っているのは、金色のアクセント、犯罪の真実、そして原子物理学の進歩という3つのことだけです。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SENA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SENA.NAME"
msgid "Sena"
msgstr "セナ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SONYAR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SONYAR.DESC"
msgid "{0}s would sooner burn down the colony than read an instruction manual."
msgstr "{0}は取扱説明書を読むことよりもコロニーを燃やし尽くす方を選ぶでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SONYAR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.SONYAR.NAME"
msgid "Sonyar"
msgstr "ソニア"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEELA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEELA.DESC"
msgid "{0}s aren't programmed to put up with nonsense, but they do enjoy the occasional shenanigan."
msgstr "{0} はナンセンスに耐えるようにプログラムされていませんが、時折の悪ふざけを楽しんでいます。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEELA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEELA.NAME"
msgid "Steela"
msgstr "スティーラ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEVE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEVE.DESC"
msgid "This {0} is convinced that he has psychic powers. And he knows exactly what his friends think about that."
msgstr "{0}は自分が超能力者だと確信しています。そして友人がそれについてどう思うかについても良く知っています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEVE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STEVE.NAME"
msgid "Steve"
msgstr "スティーブ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STINKY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STINKY.DESC"
msgid "This {0} has never been invited to a party, which is a shame. His dance moves are incredible."
msgstr "{0}は残念ながらパーティーに招待されたことがありません。彼のダンスのキレは驚くべきものです。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STINKY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.STINKY.NAME"
msgid "Stinky"
msgstr "スティンキー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TRAVALDO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TRAVALDO.DESC"
msgid "A {0}'s monotonous voice and lack of facial expression makes it impossible for others to tell when he's messing with them."
msgstr "{0}の抑揚のない喋りと表情の欠如のために、彼が困っているかどうかを他人が知る由もありません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TRAVALDO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TRAVALDO.NAME"
msgid "Travaldo"
msgstr "トラヴァルド"

# ターナー（男性）の説明文
#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TURNER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TURNER.DESC"
msgid "This {0} is paralyzed by the knowledge that others have memories and perceptions of them they can't control."
msgstr "{0}は彼が制御できない知覚や他人の思い出によって無力化させられています。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TURNER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.TURNER.NAME"
msgid "Turner"
msgstr "ターナー"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ULTI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ULTI.DESC"
msgid "This {0}'s favorite dance move is The Robot. They don't get why others think that's funny."
msgstr "{0}の得意なダンスムーブはロボットダンスです。彼はなぜ他人がそれを面白いと思うのか分かりません。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ULTI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.PERSONALITIES.ULTI.NAME"
msgid "Ulti"
msgstr "ウルティ"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.RACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.RACE"
msgid "Duplicant"
msgstr "複製人間"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.RACE_PREFIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.RACE_PREFIX"
msgid "Species: {0}"
msgstr "種族: {0}"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ARTIST.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ARTIST.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Allows moderately attractive art to be created"
msgstr "適度に魅力的な芸術作品を作成できます"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ARTIST.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ARTIST.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ARTING2\">Aesthetic Design</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ARTING2\">芸術的表現</link>"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ASTRONAUT.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ASTRONAUT.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Improves the speed that space missions are completed"
msgstr "宇宙ミッションの遂行速度を改善します"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ASTRONAUT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ASTRONAUT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ASTRONAUTING2\">Rocket Navigation</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ASTRONAUTING2\">ロケット ナビゲーション</link>"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ASTRONAUTTRAINEE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.ROLES.ASTRONAUTTRAINEE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Allows a Duplicant to operate a <link=\"COMMANDMODULE\">Command Capsule</link> to pilot a rocket ship"
