msgstr "ギアオイル"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.STATS.BIONICOIL.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.STATS.BIONICOIL.TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"Bionic Duplicants will slow down significantly when <style=\"KKeyword\">Gear Oil</style> levels reach zero\n"
"\n"
"They can oil their joints by visiting a <style=\"KKeyword\">Lubrication Station</style> or using <style=\"KKeyword\">Gear Balm</style> "
msgstr ""
"バイオニック複製人間は<style=\"KKeyword\">ギアオイル</style>が尽きると動作が極めて緩慢になります\n"
"\n"
"<style=\"KKeyword\">注油端末</style>を訪れたり、<style=\"KKeyword\">ギア軟膏</style>を使うことで関節部に油を差すことができます"

