msgstr "居眠り病"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.NARCOLEPSY.SHORT_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.NARCOLEPSY.SHORT_DESC"
