#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.WEAKIMMUNESYSTEM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.WEAKIMMUNESYSTEM.DESC"
msgid "All the vitamin C in space couldn't stop this Duplicant from getting sick"
msgstr "全宇宙のビタミンCを以てしても、この複製人間が罹患するのを止められません"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.WEAKIMMUNESYSTEM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.WEAKIMMUNESYSTEM.NAME"
msgid "Biohazardous"
msgstr "バイオハザード"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AEROGEL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AEROGEL.DESC"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AEROGEL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AEROGEL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"AEROGEL\">Aerogel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"AEROGEL\">エアロゲル</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALGAE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALGAE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Algae is a cluster of non-motile, single-celled lifeforms.\n"
"\n"
"It can be used to produce <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> when used in an <link=\"MINERALDEOXIDIZER\">Oxygen Diffuser</link>."
msgstr ""
"緑藻は非運動性単細胞生物の塊です。\n"
"\n"
"緑藻は<link=\"MINERALDEOXIDIZER\">酸素散布装置</link>に使うことで継続的な<link=\"OXYGEN\">酸素</link>供給源として使えます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALGAE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALGAE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALGAE\">Algae</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALGAE\">緑藻</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Al) Aluminum is a low density <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It has high Thermal Conductivity and is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(Al) アルミニウムは低密度の<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">精錬金属</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"熱伝導率が高く、<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALUMINUM\">Aluminum</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALUMINUM\">アルミニウム</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMGAS.DESC"
msgid "(Al) Aluminum Gas is a low density <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Metal</link> heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr "(Al) アルミニウム(気体)は低密度の<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">金属</link>です。高温のため<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態にあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALUMINUMGAS\">Aluminum Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALUMINUMGAS\">アルミニウム(気体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMORE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMORE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Aluminum ore, also known as Bauxite, is a sedimentary rock high in metal content.\n"
"\n"
"It can be refined into <link=\"ALUMINUM\">Aluminum</link>."
msgstr ""
"アルミニウム鉱石、またの名をボーキサイトは、多量に金属を含む沈積岩です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"ALUMINUM\">アルミニウム</link>に精錬できます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMORE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ALUMINUMORE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ALUMINUMORE\">Aluminum Ore</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ALUMINUMORE\">アルミニウム鉱石</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AMBER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AMBER.DESC"
msgid "Amber is a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> organic composite of <link=\"NATURALRESIN\">Resin</link> and <link=\"FOSSIL\">Fossil</link>."
msgstr "琥珀は<link=\"NATURALRESIN\">レジン</link>と<link=\"FOSSIL\">化石</link>の<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固体</link>有機化合物です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AMBER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.AMBER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"AMBER\">Amber</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"AMBER\">琥珀</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BASALT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BASALT.DESC"
msgid "Basalt is a natural volcanic rock that forms when <link=\"MAGMA\">Magma</link> cools rapidly."
msgstr "玄武岩は<link=\"MAGMA\">マグマ</link>が急速に冷却された時に形成される天然の火山岩です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BASALT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BASALT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASALT\">Basalt</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASALT\">玄武岩</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BITUMEN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BITUMEN.DESC"
msgid "Bitumen is a sticky viscous residue left behind from <link=\"PETROLEUM\">Petroleum</link> production."
msgstr "瀝青は<link=\"PETROLEUM\">石油</link>精製の際に排出される粘着性の残渣物です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BITUMEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BITUMEN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BITUMEN\">Bitumen</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BITUMEN\">瀝青</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BLEACHSTONE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BLEACHSTONE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Bleach stone is an unstable compound that emits unbreathable <link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">Chlorine Gas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is often used in <link=\"HANDSANITIZER\">Hygienic</link> processes."
msgstr ""
"漂白石は呼吸不可能な<link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">塩素(気体)</link>を産出する不安定化合物です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"HANDSANITIZER\">衛生</link>過程において役立ちます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BLEACHSTONE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BLEACHSTONE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BLEACHSTONE\">Bleach Stone</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BLEACHSTONE\">漂白石</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BOTTLEDWATER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BOTTLEDWATER.DESC"
msgid "(H<sub>2</sub>O) Clean <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>, prepped for transport."
msgstr "(H<sub>2</sub>O) 持ち運びできる、きれいな<link=\"WATER\">水</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BOTTLEDWATER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BOTTLEDWATER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOTTLEDWATER\">Water</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOTTLEDWATER\">水</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BREATHABLEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BREATHABLEDESC"
msgid "<color=#{0}>({1})</color>"
msgstr "<color=#{0}>({1})</color>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRICK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRICK.DESC"
msgid ""
"Brick is a hard, brittle material formed from heated <link=\"CLAY\">Clay</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is a reliable <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"煉瓦は<link=\"CLAY\">粘土</link>を焼成したもので、固く砕けやすい素材です。\n"
"\n"
"<b>建築素材</b>として頼りになります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRICK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRICK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BRICK\">Brick</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BRICK\">煉瓦</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Brine is a natural, highly concentrated solution of <link=\"SALT\">Salt</link> dissolved in <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be used in desalination processes, separating out usable salt."
msgstr ""
"濃塩水は、天然の、高濃度に濃縮された<link=\"SALT\">塩</link>の<link=\"WATER\">水</link>溶液です。\n"
"\n"
"脱塩工程に利用可能で、利用可能な塩を分離できます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BRINE\">Brine</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BRINE\">濃塩水</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINEICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINEICE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Brine Ice is a natural, highly concentrated solution of <link=\"SALT\">Salt</link> dissolved in <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> and frozen into a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state.\n"
"\n"
"It can be used in desalination processes, separating out usable salt."
msgstr ""
"濃塩水は、高濃度に濃縮された天然<link=\"SALT\">塩</link>の<link=\"WATER\">水</link>溶液です。\n"
"\n"
"脱塩工程に利用可能で、利用可能な塩を分離できます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINEICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.BRINEICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BRINEICE\">Brine Ice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BRINEICE\">濃塩氷</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBON.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBON.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C) Coal is a combustible fossil fuel composed of carbon.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful in <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> production."
msgstr ""
"(C) 石炭は炭素で構成された、可燃性の化石燃料です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>生成に役立ちます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBON.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBON.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CARBON\">Coal</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CARBON\">石炭</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONDIOXIDE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONDIOXIDE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(CO<sub>2</sub>) Carbon Dioxide is an atomically heavy chemical compound in a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state.\n"
"\n"
"It tends to sink below other gases."
msgstr ""
"(CO<sub>2</sub>) 二酸化炭素は原子的に重い化合物で、<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態にあります。\n"
"\n"
"他の気体と比べ重い傾向があります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONDIOXIDE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONDIOXIDE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">Carbon Dioxide</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">二酸化炭素</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONFIBRE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONFIBRE.DESC"
msgid "Carbon Fiber is a <link=\"REFINEDMINERAL\">Manufactured Material</link> with high tensile strength."
msgstr "炭素繊維は引張強度に優れた、<link=\"REFINEDMINERAL\">製造素材</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONFIBRE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONFIBRE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CARBONFIBRE\">Carbon Fiber</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CARBONFIBRE\">炭素繊維</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONGAS.DESC"
msgid "(C) Carbon is an abundant, versatile element heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr "(C) 炭素は豊富で汎用的な元素です。高温のため<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CARBONGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CARBONGAS\">Carbon Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CARBONGAS\">炭素(気体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENT.DESC"
msgid "Cement is a refined building material used for assembling advanced buildings."
msgstr "セメントは高度な設備を作るために使われる精錬された建築素材です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CEMENT\">Cement</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CEMENT\">セメント</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENTMIX.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENTMIX.DESC"
msgid "Cement Mix can be used to create <link=\"CEMENT\">Cement</link> for advanced building assembly."
msgstr "セメントミックスは高度な設備に必要な<link=\"CEMENT\">セメント</link>を作るために使われます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENTMIX.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CEMENTMIX.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CEMENTMIX\">Cement Mix</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CEMENTMIX\">セメントミックス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CERAMIC.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CERAMIC.DESC"
msgid ""
"Ceramic is a hard, brittle material formed from heated <link=\"CLAY\">Clay</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is a reliable <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"セラミックは<link=\"CLAY\">粘土</link>を焼成したもので、固く砕けやすい素材です。\n"
"\n"
"<b>建築素材</b>として頼りになります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CERAMIC.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CERAMIC.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CERAMIC\">Ceramic</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CERAMIC\">セラミック</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINE.DESC"
msgid "(Cl) Chlorine is a natural <link=\"DISEASE\">Germ</link>-killing element in a <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> state."
msgstr "(Cl) 塩素は<link=\"DISEASE\">病原菌</link>を殺菌できる天然の元素です。<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液体</link>状態にあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CHLORINE\">Liquid Chlorine</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CHLORINE\">塩素(液体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINEGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINEGAS.DESC"
msgid "(Cl) Chlorine is a natural <link=\"DISEASE\">Germ</link>-killing element in a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr "(Cl) 塩素は<link=\"DISEASE\">病原菌</link>を殺菌できる天然の元素です。<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態にあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINEGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CHLORINEGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">Chlorine Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CHLORINEGAS\">塩素(気体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CINNABAR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CINNABAR.DESC"
msgid ""
"(HgS) Cinnabar Ore, also known as mercury sulfide, is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link> that can be refined into <link=\"MERCURY\">Mercury</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"硫化水銀としても知られる (HgS) 辰砂鉱石は導電性のある<link=\"METAL\">金属</link>で、<link=\"MERCURY\">水銀</link>に精製できます。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CINNABAR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CINNABAR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CINNABAR\">Cinnabar Ore</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CINNABAR\">辰砂鉱石</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CLAY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CLAY.DESC"
msgid ""
"Clay is a soft, naturally occurring composite of stone and soil that hardens at high <link=\"HEAT\">Temperatures</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is a reliable <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"粘土は高<link=\"HEAT\">温度</link>下で硬化する、石と土の柔らかい混合物です。\n"
"\n"
"<b>建築素材</b>として頼りになります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CLAY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CLAY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CLAY\">Clay</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CLAY\">粘土</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALT.DESC"
msgid "(Co) Cobalt is a <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Refined Metal</link> made from <link=\"COBALTITE\">Cobalt Ore</link>."
msgstr "(Co) コバルトは、<link=\"COBALTITE\">コバルト鉱石</link>を精製してできる<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">精錬金属</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COBALT\">Cobalt</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COBALT\">コバルト</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTGAS.DESC"
msgid "(Co) Cobalt is a <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Refined Metal</link>, heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gas</link>."
msgstr "(Co) コバルトは、<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">精錬金属</link>です。高温のため<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態にあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COBALTGAS\">Cobalt Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COBALTGAS\">コバルト(気体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTITE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Co) Cobalt Ore is a blue-hued <link=\"BUILDINGMATERIALCLASSES\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(Co) コバルト鉱石は青色の<link=\"BUILDINGMATERIALCLASSES\">金属</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COBALTITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COBALTITE\">Cobalt Ore</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COBALTITE\">コバルト鉱石</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COMPOSITION.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COMPOSITION.DESC"
msgid "A mixture of two or more elements."
msgstr "2つ以上からなる元素の化合物です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COMPOSITION.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COMPOSITION.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COMPOSITION\">Composition</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COMPOSITION\">混合物</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN.DESC"
msgid ""
"(O<sub>2</sub>) Polluted Oxygen is dirty, unfiltered air.\n"
"\n"
"It is breathable."
msgstr ""
"(O<sub>2</sub>) 汚染酸素は汚れた、濾過されていない空気です。\n"
"\n"
"呼吸可能です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">Polluted Oxygen</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CONTAMINATEDOXYGEN\">汚染酸素</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPER.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Cu) Copper is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(Cu) 銅は導電性のある<link=\"METAL\">金属</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COPPER\">Copper</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COPPER\">銅</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPERGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPERGAS.DESC"
msgid "(Cu) Copper Gas is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link> heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gas</link> state."
msgstr "(Cu) 銅(気体)は導電性のある<link=\"METAL\">金属</link>です。高温のため<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態にあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPERGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COPPERGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COPPERGAS\">Copper Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COPPERGAS\">銅(気体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COQUINA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COQUINA.DESC"
msgid ""
"Coquina is a brittle <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> mineral made up of the calcified remains of aquatic invertebrates.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"石灰岩は水棲無脊椎動物の石灰化した遺骸から成る、脆い<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固体</link>鉱物です。\n"
"\n"
"<b>建築資材</b>として有用です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COQUINA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.COQUINA.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COQUINA\">Coquina</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COQUINA\">石灰岩</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORALLIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORALLIUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Corallium is a dense coral primarily composed of (CaCO<sub>3</sub>) <link=\"LIME\">Lime</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"サンゴは主に炭酸カルシウム(CaCO<sub>3</sub>) <link=\"LIME\">石灰</link>から成る、密度の高いサンゴ虫遺骸です。\n"
"\n"
"<b>建築素材</b>に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORALLIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORALLIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORALLIUM\">Corallium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORALLIUM\">サンゴ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORIUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"A radioactive mixture of nuclear waste and melted reactor materials.\n"
"\n"
"Releases <link=\"FALLOUT\">Nuclear Fallout</link> gas."
msgstr ""
"核廃棄物と溶融した原子炉の放射性混合物です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"FALLOUT\">死の灰</link>を降らします。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CORIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORIUM\">Corium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORIUM\">炉心溶融物</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CREATURE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CREATURE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(DuPe) Ooze is a slurry of water, carbon, and dozens and dozens of trace elements.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants are printed from pure Ooze."
msgstr ""
"(DuPe) 生命の素は水と炭素、そして多数の微量元素で成り立つ懸濁物です。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間は純粋な生命の素から製造されます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CREATURE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CREATURE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CREATURE\">Genetic Ooze</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CREATURE\">生命の素</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUDEOIL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUDEOIL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Crude Oil is a raw potential <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> source composed of billions of dead, primordial organisms.\n"
"\n"
"It is also a useful lubricant for certain types of machinery."
msgstr ""
"原油は太古の生物遺骸が変質してできた、<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>源となり得る資源です。\n"
"\n"
"また、特定の種類の機械にとって有用な潤滑剤でもあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUDEOIL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUDEOIL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRUDEOIL\">Crude Oil</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRUDEOIL\">原油</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDICE.DESC"
msgid "(H<sub>2</sub>O) A slush of crushed, semi-solid ice."
msgstr "(H<sub>2</sub>O) 砕けた、半固体の氷です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRUSHEDICE\">Crushed Ice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRUSHEDICE\">砕氷</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDROCK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDROCK.DESC"
msgid "Crushed Rock is <link=\"IGNEOUSROCK\">Igneous Rock</link> crushed into a mechanical mixture."
msgstr "破砕岩は<link=\"IGNEOUSROCK\">火成岩</link>を機械で混ぜ合わせたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDROCK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CRUSHEDROCK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CRUSHEDROCK\">Crushed Rock</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CRUSHEDROCK\">破砕岩</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CUPRITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CUPRITE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Cu<sub>2</sub>O) Copper Ore is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(Cu<sub>2</sub>O) 銅鉱石は導電性のある<link=\"METAL\">金属</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CUPRITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.CUPRITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CUPRITE\">Copper Ore</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CUPRITE\">銅鉱石</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DEPLETEDURANIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DEPLETEDURANIUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"(U) Depleted Uranium is <link=\"URANIUMORE\">Uranium</link> with a low U-235 content.\n"
"\n"
"It is created as a byproduct of <link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">Enriched Uranium</link> and is no longer suitable as fuel."
msgstr ""
"(U) 劣化ウランはウラン235含有量が低い<link=\"URANIUMORE\">ウラン</link>を指します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">濃縮ウラン</link>精製の副産物で、燃料としては不適です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DEPLETEDURANIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DEPLETEDURANIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DEPLETEDURANIUM\">Depleted Uranium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DEPLETEDURANIUM\">劣化ウラン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIAMOND.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIAMOND.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C) Diamond is industrial-grade, high density carbon.\n"
"\n"
"It is very difficult to excavate."
msgstr ""
"(C) ダイヤモンドは産業用の高密度炭素です。\n"
"\n"
"採掘は困難です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIAMOND.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIAMOND.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DIAMOND\">Diamond</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DIAMOND\">ダイヤモンド</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Dirt is a soft, nutrient-rich substance capable of supporting life.\n"
"\n"
"It is necessary in some forms of <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> production."
msgstr ""
"土は柔らかく、生命を支える栄養豊富な物質です。\n"
"\n"
"ある特定の<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>生産に必要です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DIRT\">Dirt</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DIRT\">土</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYICE.DESC"
msgid "Polluted Ice is dirty, unfiltered water frozen into a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr "汚染氷は汚れた、濾過されていない水が<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固体</link>になるまで冷却されたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DIRTYICE\">Polluted Ice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DIRTYICE\">汚染氷</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYWATER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYWATER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Polluted Water is dirty, unfiltered <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is not fit for consumption."
msgstr ""
"汚染水は汚れた、濾過されていない<link=\"WATER\">水</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"飲用には向いていません。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYWATER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.DIRTYWATER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DIRTYWATER\">Polluted Water</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DIRTYWATER\">汚染水</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ELECTRUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ELECTRUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Electrum is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link> alloy composed of gold and silver.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"琥珀金は導電性のある<link=\"METAL\">金属</link>で、金と銀の合金です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ELECTRUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ELECTRUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ELECTRUM\">Electrum</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ELECTRUM\">琥珀金</link>"

