#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ENRICHEDURANIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ENRICHEDURANIUM.DESC"
msgid ""
"(U) Enriched Uranium is a refined substance primarily used to <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> potent research reactors.\n"
"\n"
"It becomes highly <link=\"RADIATION\">Radioactive</link> when consumed."
msgstr ""
"(U) 濃縮ウランは強力な研究用原子炉の<link=\"POWER\">電力源</link>として主に使われる精製物質です。\n"
"\n"
"消費されると非常に高い<link=\"RADIATION\">放射能</link>となります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ENRICHEDURANIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ENRICHEDURANIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">Enriched Uranium</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ENRICHEDURANIUM\">濃縮ウラン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOL.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) Ethanol is an advanced chemical compound in a <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> state.\n"
"\n"
"It can be used as a highly effective fuel source when burned."
msgstr ""
"(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) エタノールは<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液状</link>の高度な化学物質です。\n"
"\n"
"燃焼させると、高効率な燃料として使用できます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ETHANOL\">Ethanol</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ETHANOL\">エタノール</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOLGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOLGAS.DESC"
msgid "(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) Ethanol Gas is an advanced chemical compound heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr "(C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub>O) エタノール(気体)は高度な化学物質です。高温のため<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態にあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOLGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.ETHANOLGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ETHANOLGAS\">Ethanol Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ETHANOLGAS\">エタノール(気体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FABRICATEDWOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FABRICATEDWOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Plywood is a good source of <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link> and <link=\"POWER\">Power</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Its insulation properties make it a useful <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"合板は<link=\"HEAT\">熱</link>と<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>の良い供給源です。\n"
"\n"
"その断熱性能のため<b>建築素材</b>に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FABRICATEDWOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FABRICATEDWOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FABRICATEDWOOD\">Plywood</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FABRICATEDWOOD\">合板</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FALLOUT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FALLOUT.DESC"
msgid "Nuclear Fallout is a highly toxic gas full of <link=\"RADIATION\">Radioactive Contaminants</link>. Condenses into <link=\"NUCLEARWASTE\">Liquid Nuclear Waste</link>."
msgstr "死の灰は<link=\"RADIATION\">放射性汚染物質</link>を多く含んだ極めて毒性の高い気体です。<link=\"NUCLEARWASTE\">核廃液</link>に凝縮します。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FALLOUT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FALLOUT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FALLOUT\">Nuclear Fallout</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FALLOUT\">死の灰</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FERTILIZER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FERTILIZER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Fertilizer is a processed mixture of biological nutrients.\n"
"\n"
"It aids in the growth of certain <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link>."
msgstr ""
"肥料は生物由来の養分混合物です。\n"
"\n"
"ほとんどの<link=\"PLANTS\">植物</link>の成長を促します。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FERTILIZER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FERTILIZER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FERTILIZER\">Fertilizer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FERTILIZER\">肥料</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILK.DESC"
msgid ""
"Ovolene is a protein-rich <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> produced by aquatic critters.\n"
"\n"
"It can be processed into <link=\"CAVIAR\">Caviar</link> and <link=\"MUCUS\">Mucin</link>."
msgstr ""
"オボレンは水棲動物によって生成されるタンパク質豊富な<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液体</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"CAVIAR\">キャビア</link>や<link=\"MUCUS\">ムチン</link>に加工することができます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FISHMILK\">Ovolene</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FISHMILK\">オボレン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILKICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILKICE.DESC"
msgid "Frozen Ovolene is <link=\"FISHMILK\">Ovolene</link> frozen into a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr "凍結オボレンは<link=\"FISHMILK\">オボレン</link>を凍らせて<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固体</link>にしたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILKICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FISHMILKICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FISHMILKICE\">Frozen Ovolene</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FISHMILKICE\">凍結オボレン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOOLSGOLD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOOLSGOLD.DESC"
msgid ""
"(FeS<sub>2</sub>) Pyrite is a conductive <link=\"METAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Also known as \"Fool's Gold\", is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(FeS<sub>2</sub>) 黄鉄鉱は導電性のある<link=\"METAL\">金属</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"愚者の黄金とも呼ばれ、<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOOLSGOLD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOOLSGOLD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FOOLSGOLD\">Pyrite</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FOOLSGOLD\">黄鉄鉱</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOSSIL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOSSIL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Fossil is organic matter, highly compressed and hardened into a mineral state.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"化石は高圧にさらされた有機体が無機物になるまで圧縮されたものです。\n"
"\n"
"<b>建築素材</b>として役に立ちます。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOSSIL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FOSSIL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FOSSIL\">Fossil</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FOSSIL\">化石</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENINK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENINK.DESC"
msgid "Frozen Ink is <link=\"INK\">Squid Ink</link> cooled to a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr "凍結イカスミは<link=\"INK\">イカスミ</link>を凍らせて<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固体</link>にしたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENINK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENINK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FROZENINK\">Frozen Squid Ink</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FROZENINK\">凍結イカスミ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENPHYTOOIL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENPHYTOOIL.DESC"
msgid "Frozen Phyto Oil is thick, slippery <link=\"SLIME\">Slime</link> extract, frozen into a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr "凍結植物油は濃厚で滑らかな<link=\"SLIME\">ヘドロ</link>の抽出物を<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固体</link>状態に冷凍したものです。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENPHYTOOIL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FROZENPHYTOOIL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FROZENPHYTOOIL\">Frozen Phyto Oil</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FROZENPHYTOOIL\">凍結植物油</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FULLERENE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FULLERENE.DESC"
msgid "(C<sub>60</sub>) Fullerene is a form of <link=\"CARBON\">Coal</link> consisting of spherical molecules."
msgstr "(C<sub>60</sub>) フラーレンは分子が球状に繋がった<link=\"CARBON\">炭素</link>の一形態です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FULLERENE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.FULLERENE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FULLERENE\">Fullerene</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FULLERENE\">フラーレン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GALENA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GALENA.DESC"
msgid "(PbS) Galena is a raw <link=\"METAL\">Metal Ore</link> primarily composed of <link=\"LEAD\">Lead</link> with <link=\"SULFUR\">Sulfur</link> impurities."
msgstr "(PbS) 方鉛鉱は主に<link=\"LEAD\">鉛</link>と<link=\"SULFUR\">硫黄</link>の不純物から成る、未加工の<link=\"METAL\">金属鉱石</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GALENA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GALENA.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GALENA\">Galena</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GALENA\">方鉛鉱</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GLASS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GLASS.DESC"
msgid "Glass is a brittle, transparent substance formed from <link=\"SAND\">Sand</link> fired at high temperatures."
msgstr "ガラスは<link=\"SAND\">砂</link>を焼成させてできた脆くて透明な物質です。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GLASS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GLASS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GLASS\">Glass</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GLASS\">ガラス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLD.DESC"
msgid ""
"(Au) Gold is a conductive precious <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Metal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"(Au) 金は導電性のある希少な<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">金属</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOLD\">Gold</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOLD\">金</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDAMALGAM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDAMALGAM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Gold Amalgam is a conductive amalgam of gold and mercury.\n"
"\n"
"It is suitable for building <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> systems."
msgstr ""
"金アマルガムは導電性を持つ金と水銀の合金です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"POWER\">電力</link>設備の材料に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDAMALGAM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDAMALGAM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOLDAMALGAM\">Gold Amalgam</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOLDAMALGAM\">金アマルガム</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDGAS.DESC"
msgid "(Au) Gold Gas is a conductive precious <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Metal</link>, heated into a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state."
msgstr "(Au) 金(気体)は導電性のある<link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">金属</link>です。高温のため<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">気体</link>状態にあります。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GOLDGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOLDGAS\">Gold Gas</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOLDGAS\">金(気体)</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRANITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRANITE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Granite is a dense composite of <link=\"IGNEOUSROCK\">Igneous Rock</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"花崗岩は<link=\"IGNEOUSROCK\">火成岩</link>が凝集したものです。\n"
"\n"
"<b>建築素材</b>に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRANITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRANITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GRANITE\">Granite</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GRANITE\">花崗岩</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRAPHITE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRAPHITE.DESC"
msgid ""
"(C) Graphite is the most stable form of carbon.\n"
"\n"
"It has high thermal conductivity and is useful as a <b>Construction Material</b>."
msgstr ""
"(C) グラファイトは炭素の最も安定した形態です。\n"
"\n"
"高い熱伝導率が要求される<b>建築素材</b>に適しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRAPHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GRAPHITE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GRAPHITE\">Graphite</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GRAPHITE\">グラファイト</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GUNK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GUNK.DESC"
msgid "Solid Gunk is the built-up grime and grit produced by Duplicants' bionic mechanisms, which has been frozen into a <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> state."
msgstr "固体残滓は複製人間のバイオニック機構によって生成された蓄積した汚れや砂粒で、<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固体</link>状態に凍結しています。"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GUNK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.GUNK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GUNK\">Solid Gunk</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GUNK\">固体残滓</link>"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.FIRM
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.FIRM"
msgid "{0} (Firm)"
msgstr "{0} (堅固)"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.FIRM
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.FIRM"
msgid "Firm"
msgstr "堅固"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.IMPENETRABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.IMPENETRABLE"
msgid "Impenetrable"
msgstr "貫通不可"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.NEARLYIMPENETRABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.NEARLYIMPENETRABLE"
msgid "Nearly Impenetrable"
msgstr "ほぼ貫通不可"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.SOFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.SOFT"
msgid "Soft"
msgstr "軟質"

#. STRINGS.ELEMENTS.HARDNESS.HARDNESS_DESCRIPTOR.VERYFIRM
