"Allows Duplicants to breathe while submerged in <style=\"liquid\">Liquid</style>.\n"
"\n"
"Does not work outside of liquid"
msgstr ""
"複製人間に<style=\"liquid\">液体</style>中での呼吸を可能とします。\n"
"\n"
"液体外では機能しません"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.DESC"
msgid "Grippy waterproof boots make chores much more manageable."
msgstr "滑りにくい防水ブーツがあれば作業がずっと楽になります。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT"
msgid "Protects the wearer from <style=\"KKeyword\">Soggy Feet</style> and <style=\"KKeyword\">Slippery</style> floors."
msgstr "着用者を<style=\"KKeyword\">濡れた足</style>効果や<style=\"KKeyword\">濡れた</style>床面から保護します。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT_DLC3
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT_DLC3"
msgid ""
"Protects the wearer from <style=\"KKeyword\">Soggy Feet</style> and <style=\"KKeyword\">Slippery</style> floors.\n"
"\n"
"Enables Bionic Duplicants to cross small puddles without <style=\"KKeyword\">Liquid Exposure</style> damage."
msgstr ""
"着用者を<style=\"KKeyword\">濡れた足</style>効果や<style=\"KKeyword\">濡れた</style>床面から保護します。\n"
"\n"
"バイオニック複製人間が<style=\"KKeyword\">液体への曝露</style>ダメージを受けることなく、小さな水たまりを渡ることを可能にします。"

