#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSALGAE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSALGAE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe}'s recent proximity to an Algae Terrarium has left them feeling refreshed and exuberant and is correlated to an increase in their physical attributes. It is unclear whether these physical improvements came from the excess of oxygen or the invigorating smell of algae.\n"
"\n"
"It's curious that I find myself nostalgic for the smell of algae growing in a lab. But how could this be...?"
msgstr ""
"このところテラリウムのそばで過ごしている{dupe}は、爽快な気分で活力に満ちているようだ。身体能力の向上とも相関がある。このような心身の改善が過剰な酸素によるものなのか、緑藻の爽やかな香りによるものなのかは不明である。\n"
"研究室内で育つ緑藻の香りにどこか懐かしさを感じる自分がいる。一体、何故...？"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSALGAE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSALGAE.NAME"
msgid "Fresh Algae Smell"
msgstr "藻類の爽やかな香り"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSBUILDER.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSBUILDER.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} has been hard at work building many structures crucial to the future of the colony. It seems this activity has improved this Duplicant's budding construction and mechanical skills beyond what my models predicted.\n"
"\n"
"Whether this increase in ability is due to them learning new skills or simply gaining self-confidence I cannot say, but this unexpected development is a welcome surprise development."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}はコロニーの未来に不可欠な設備を建築するために汗だくで働いてきた。この活動は私の予測モデルを超えて複製人間の建築能力および機械技能を向上させたようだ。\n"
"\n"
"この能力向上は彼/彼女が新しい技術を習得したものなのか、単に自信を得たためなのかは分からないが、この予想外の進展は歓迎すべき驚きだ。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSBUILDER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSBUILDER.NAME"
msgid "Accomplished Builder"
msgstr "熟達建築家"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDIGGING1.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDIGGING1.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Some interesting data has revealed that {dupe} has had a marked increase in physical abilities, an increase that cannot entirely be attributed to the usual improvements that occur after regular physical activity.\n"
"\n"
"Based on previous observations this Duplicant's positive associations with digging appear to account for this additional physical boost.\n"
"\n"
"This would mean the personal preferences of my Duplicants are directly correlated to how hard they work. How interesting..."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}の劇的な身体能力増加を示す興味深いデータが明らかになった。この増加は通常の肉体活動によって発生する上昇とは全く無関係である。\n"
"\n"
"これまでの観察によれば、この複製人間と採掘との正の関連が身体能力向上説を後押ししているように見える。\n"
"\n"
"これが意味するところは、複製人間達の嗜好が彼らの労働効率に直接影響しているということだ。実に面白い...。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDIGGING1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDIGGING1.NAME"
msgid "Hot Diggity!"
msgstr "採掘大好き！"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDOOR.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDOOR.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The act of closing a door has apparently lead to a decrease in the <link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link> levels of {dupe}, as well as decreased the exposure of this Duplicant to harmful <link=\"GERMS\">Germs</link>.\n"
"\n"
"While it may be more efficient to group all my Duplicants together in common sleeping quarters, it's important to remember the mental benefits to privacy and space to express their individuality."
msgstr ""
"ドアを閉めるという行為は、{dupe}の<link=\"STRESS\">ストレス</link>レベルだけでなく、<link=\"GERMS\">病原菌</link>への曝露機会をも減少させている。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間達全員を宿舎で寝起きさせた方が効率は良いかもしれないが、プライバシーおよび個人的空間から得られる心的利点も重要だ。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDOOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDOOR.NAME"
msgid "Open and Shut"
msgstr "開けたら閉める"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM1.CHAIN_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM1.CHAIN_TOOLTIP"
msgid "Improving the living conditions of {dupe} will lead to more good dreams."
msgstr "{dupe}の生活水準を改善すると、より良い夢へと導くでしょう。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM1.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM1.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"I've observed many improvements to {dupe}'s demeanor today. Analysis indicates unusually high amounts of dopamine in their system. There's a good chance this is due to an exceptionally good dream and analysis indicates that current sleeping conditions may have contributed to this occurrence.\n"
"\n"
"Further improvements to sleeping conditions may have additional positive effects to the <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> of {dupe} and other Duplicants."
msgstr ""
"本日、{dupe}の態度に多くの改善が見られた。分析結果は彼/彼女の体内にドーパミンが大量に分泌されていることを示している。これは非常に良い夢見によるものである可能性が高く、現在の睡眠条件がこの発生に寄与している可能性が考えられる。\n"
"\n"
"睡眠条件のさらなる改善は{dupe}や他の複製人間の<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>にプラスの効果を与えるだろう。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM1.NAME"
msgid "Good Dream"
msgstr "良い夢"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM2.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM2.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} had another really good dream and the resulting release of dopamine has made this Duplicant energetic and full of possibilities! This is an encouraging byproduct of improving the living conditions of the colony.\n"
"\n"
"Based on these observations, building a better sleeping area for my Duplicants will have a similar effect on their <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}はより良い夢を見たようで、分泌されたドーパミンが複製人間を活動的で可能性に満ちたものにしている！これは、コロニーの生活水準改善によりもたらされる有益な副産物だ。\n"
"\n"
"これらの観察に基づくと、複製人間達により快適な睡眠スペースを建築すれば彼らの<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>にも同様の効果が出るだろう。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM2.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM2.NAME"
msgid "Really Good Dream"
msgstr "吉夢"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM3.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM3.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"I have detected a distinct spring in {dupe}'s step today. There is a good chance that this Duplicant had another great dream last night. Such incidents are further indications that working on the care and comfort of the colony is not a waste of time.\n"
"\n"
"I do wonder though: What do Duplicants dream of?"
msgstr ""
"本日、私は{dupe}がバネのように飛び跳ねているのを見つけた。この複製人間がまたもや素晴らしい夢を見た可能性は十分にある。このような出来事は、コロニーに配慮し快適さに取り組むことが時間の無駄ではないことを示す証左となるだろう。\n"
"\n"
"疑問: 複製人間が見る夢とは？"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM3.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM3.NAME"
msgid "Great Dream"
msgstr "大吉夢"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM4.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM4.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe}'s dream last night must have been simply amazing! Their dopamine levels are at an all time high. Based on these results, it can be safely assumed that improving the living conditions of my Duplicants will reduce <link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link> and have similar positive effects on their well-being.\n"
"\n"
"Observations such as this are an integral and enjoyable part of science. When I see my Duplicants happy, I can't help but share in some of their joy."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}が昨夜見た夢はただひたすらに素晴らしかったに違いない！彼/彼女のドーパミンは一日中高レベルを維持していた。以上の結果から、複製人間の生活水準を向上させることは彼らの<link=\"STRESS\">ストレス</link>を軽減し、彼らの幸福にプラスの効果を与えると言っても過言ではないだろう。\n"
"\n"
"このような経過観察は科学において必要不可欠で楽しみでもある。幸せそうな複製人間達を見ると、彼らと喜びを共有せざるを得ない。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM4.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSDREAM4.NAME"
msgid "Amazing Dream"
msgstr "驚くべき夢"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSGENERATOR.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSGENERATOR.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} ran in a Manual Generator and the physical activity appears to have given this Duplicant increased strength and sense of well-being.\n"
"\n"
"While not the primary reason for building Manual Generators, I am very pleased to see my Duplicants reaping the <link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link> relieving benefits to physical activity."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}は人力発電機で走ったことにより、力強さと幸福感が得られたようだ。\n"
"\n"
"人力発電機を建築する理由はこのためではないが、複製人間が身体活動を通じて<link=\"STRESS\">ストレス</link>解消をしているのを見ると非常に嬉しく思う。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSGENERATOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSGENERATOR.NAME"
msgid "Exercised"
msgstr "エクササイズ"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSHITTHEBOOKS.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSHITTHEBOOKS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe}'s recent Research errand has resulted in a significant increase to this Duplicant's brain activity. The discovery of newly found knowledge has given {dupe} an invigorating jolt of excitement.\n"
"\n"
"I am all too familiar with this feeling."
msgstr ""
"最近の{dupe}が行った研究作業は複製人間の脳活動を著しく上昇させる結果となった。新しい知識を発見することは{dupe}に驚天動地の衝撃をもたらした。\n"
"\n"
"私はこの感覚が非常によく分かる。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSHITTHEBOOKS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSHITTHEBOOKS.NAME"
msgid "Hit the Books"
msgstr "猛勉強"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSLITWORKSPACE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSLITWORKSPACE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe}'s recent time in a well-lit area has greatly improved this Duplicant's ability to work with, and on, machinery.\n"
"\n"
"This supports the prevailing theory that a well-lit workspace has many benefits beyond just improving my Duplicant's ability to see."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}が最近明るい場所で過ごした時間は、この複製人間が機械を操作したり連携したりする能力を劇的に上昇させた。\n"
"\n"
"これは、明るい作業場所が複製人間の視界を良くするということだけでなく、多くの利点があるという理論を支持するものである。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSLITWORKSPACE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSLITWORKSPACE.NAME"
msgid "Lit-erally Great"
msgstr "ご覧の通り"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSOXYGEN.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSOXYGEN.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} is experiencing a sudden unexpected improvement to their physical prowess which appears to be a result of exposure to elevated levels of oxygen from passing by an Oxygen Diffuser.\n"
"\n"
"Observations such as this are important in documenting just how beneficial having access to oxygen is to my colony."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}は酸素散布装置から高いレベルの酸素を吸入したことにより、突発的な身体能力上昇を経験した。\n"
"\n"
"今回の観察結果は、酸素にアクセスできることがコロニーにとってどれだけ有益かということを文書化する上で重要だ。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSOXYGEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSOXYGEN.NAME"
msgid "Fresh Air"
msgstr "新鮮な空気"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSRESEARCH.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSRESEARCH.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Analysis indicates that the appearance of a <style=\"KKeyword\">Research Station</style> has inspired {dupe} and heightened their brain activity on a cellular level.\n"
"\n"
"Brain stimulation is important if my Duplicants are going to adapt and innovate in their increasingly harsh environment."
msgstr ""
"分析によると、<style=\"KKeyword\">研究端末</style>の外観は{dupe}に閃きを与え、細胞レベルで脳活動を高めた。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間がますます過酷となる環境へ適応、順応しようとするならば、脳への刺激は重要だ。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSRESEARCH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSRESEARCH.NAME"
msgid "Inspired Learner"
msgstr "探究心"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSSTORAGE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSSTORAGE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"Data indicates that {dupe}'s activity in storing something in a Storage Bin has led to an increase in this Duplicant's physical strength as well as an overall improvement to their general demeanor.\n"
"\n"
"There have been many studies connecting organization with an increase in well-being. It is possible this explains {dupe}'s <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> improvements."
msgstr ""
"データは格納庫に何かを補完する{dupe}の活動がこの複製人間の身体能力の増加と態度の改善に繋がったことを示している。\n"
"\n"
"体組織と幸福感の向上を関連付ける研究はたくさんあり、これが{dupe}の<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>上昇を説明している可能性がある。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSSTORAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSSTORAGE.NAME"
msgid "Something in Store"
msgstr "整頓"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTALKER.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTALKER.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe}'s recent conversation with another Duplicant shows a correlation to improved serotonin and <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> levels in this Duplicant. It is very possible that small talk with a co-worker, however short and seemingly insignificant, will make my Duplicant's feel connected to the colony as a whole.\n"
"\n"
"As the colony gets bigger and more sophisticated, I must ensure that the opportunity for such connections continue, for the good of my Duplicants' mental well being."
msgstr ""
"最近の{dupe}と他の複製人間との会話は、この複製人間のセロトニンと<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>レベルの改善との相関関係を示している。同僚との世間話は、それが短くて取るに足らないように見えても、複製人間がコロニーの一員であると感じさせる可能性が高い。\n"
"\n"
"コロニーが大きくなり洗練されるにつれ、複製人間の心的幸福感のためにそのような繋がりの機会が継続することを保証しなければならないだろう。"

# "Small Talk"で「世間話」
#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTALKER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTALKER.NAME"
msgid "Big Small Talker"
msgstr "井戸端会議"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET1.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET1.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} recently visited an Outhouse and appears to have appreciated the small comforts based on the marked increase to their <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>.\n"
"\n"
"High <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> has been linked to a better work ethic and greater enthusiasm for complex jobs, which are essential in building a successful new colony."
msgstr ""
"近ごろ野営トイレを訪れた{dupe}は、<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>が大いに高揚していることから、ささやかな心地よさに満足しているように見える。\n"
"\n"
"高い<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>は新しいコロニーを成功へと導くために必要で、より良い労働倫理と複雑な仕事への大きな熱意に関連している。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET1.NAME"
msgid "Small Comforts"
msgstr "やや心地よい"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET2.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET2.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} used a Lavatory and analysis shows a decided improvement to this Duplicant's <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>.\n"
"\n"
"As my colony grows and expands, it's important not to ignore the benefits of giving my Duplicants a pleasant place to relieve themselves."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}は水洗トイレを使い、分析によればこの複製人間の<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>に対する決定的改善を示した。\n"
"\n"
"コロニーが成長し拡大するにつれ、複製人間達の用を足す場所を作ることの利点を無視しないことが肝要だ。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET2.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET2.NAME"
msgid "Greater Comforts"
msgstr "とても心地よい"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET3.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET3.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} visited a Latrine and experienced luxury unlike they anything this Duplicant had previously experienced as analysis has revealed yet another boost to their <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It is unclear whether this development is a result of increased hygiene or whether there is something else inherently about working plumbing which would improve <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> in this way. Further analysis is needed."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}は公衆トイレを訪れ、これまで経験したことのないような贅沢を味わった。分析により、この複製人間の<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>は更に向上したことが明らかになった。\n"
"\n"
"この進歩が衛生面における改善の結果であるのか、それとも配管工事に関してこのように<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>を高める本質的な何かがあるのかは不明だが、さらなる分析が必要だ。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET3.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET3.NAME"
msgid "Small Luxury"
msgstr "小さな贅沢"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET4.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET4.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"{dupe} visited a Washroom and the experience has left this Duplicant with significantly improved <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>. Analysis indicates this improvement should continue for many cycles.\n"
"\n"
"The relationship of my Duplicants and their surroundings is an interesting aspect of colony life. I should continue to watch future developments in this department closely."
msgstr ""
"{dupe}が洗面所を訪れ、この複製人間の<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>が大幅に改善された。分析によると、この効果は複数サイクルに渡って継続するだろう。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間と彼らの周囲の関係はコロニー生活の興味深い一面だ。今後もこの分野の発展を注視していきたい。"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET4.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS.BONUSTOILET4.NAME"
msgid "Greater Luxury"
msgstr "豪華"

#. STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS_EVENT_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.GAMEPLAY_EVENTS.BONUS_EVENT_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "{effects} for {duration}"
msgstr "{duration}の{effects}"

