msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant the expertise required to explore the skies in person."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間に空を直接探索するために必要な専門知識を付与します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_PILOT1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_PILOT1.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERPILOT1\">Piloting Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERPILOT1\">操縦ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_PILOTVANILLA1.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_PILOTVANILLA1.DESC"
msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant the expertise required to command a rocket."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間にロケット操縦に必要な専門知識を付与します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_PILOTVANILLA1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_PILOTVANILLA1.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERPILOTVANILLA1\">Rocketry Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERPILOTVANILLA1\">ロケット工学ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RANCH1.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RANCH1.DESC"
msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant the skills required to care for <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> in every way."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間に、あらゆる方法で<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>の世話をする技術を付与します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RANCH1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RANCH1.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERRANCH1\">Ranching Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERRANCH1\">牧畜ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH1.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH1.DESC"
msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant the expertise required to study <link=\"GEYSERS\">geysers</link> and other advanced topics."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間に、<link=\"GEYSERS\">間欠泉</link> やその他の高度なトピックを研究するために必要な専門知識を付与します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH1.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERRESEARCH1\">Researching Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERRESEARCH1\">研究ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH2.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH2.DESC"
msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant a keen grasp of science and usage of space-research buildings."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間に科学と宇宙研究施設の使用に関する鋭い理解力を与えます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH2.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH2.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERRESEARCH2\">Astronomy Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERRESEARCH2\">天文学ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH3.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH3.DESC"
msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant a deeply pragmatic approach to scientific research."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間に科学研究に対する非常に実用的なアプローチを付与します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH3.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_RESEARCH3.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERRESEARCH3\">Applied Sciences Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERRESEARCH3\">材料工学ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_SUITS1.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_SUITS1.DESC"
msgid "Enables a Bionic Duplicant to maximize durability of equipped <link=\"EQUIPMENT\">Exosuits</link> and maintain their runspeed."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間が装備した<link=\"EQUIPMENT\">EXOスーツ</link>の耐久性を最大限に高め、走行速度を維持できるようにします。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_SUITS1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_SUITS1.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERSUITS1\">Suit Training Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERSUITS1\">スーツ トレーニング ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_TIDY1.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_TIDY1.DESC"
msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant the full range of tidying skills, including blasting unwanted meteors out of the sky."
msgstr "バイオニック複製人間に、不要な隕石を空から吹き飛ばす等あらゆる整理整頓スキルを付与します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_TIDY1.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.BOOSTER_TIDY1.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BOOSTERTIDY1\">Tidying Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BOOSTERTIDY1\">清掃ブースター</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.FABRICATION_SOURCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.BIONIC_BOOSTERS.FABRICATION_SOURCE"
msgid "This booster can be manufactured at the {0}."
msgstr "このブースターは{0}で製作できます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.CARGO_CAPSULE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.CARGO_CAPSULE.DESC"
msgid ""
"A delivery system for recently printed resources.\n"
"\n"
"It will dematerialize shortly."
msgstr ""
"最近製造された資源の運搬システムです。\n"
"\n"
"すぐに非物質化します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.CARGO_CAPSULE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.CARGO_CAPSULE.NAME"
msgid "Care Package"
msgstr "補給品"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DEBRISPAYLOAD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DEBRISPAYLOAD.DESC"
msgid "Whatever is left over from a Rocket Self-Destruct can be recovered once it has crash-landed."
msgstr "ロケットの自爆時に残ったものは墜落後に回収することができます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DEBRISPAYLOAD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DEBRISPAYLOAD.NAME"
msgid "Rocket Debris"
msgstr "ロケットの残骸"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.CONSUMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.CONSUMED"
msgid "Ate Rehydrated Food"
msgstr "水で戻した食糧を食べた"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.CONTENTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.CONTENTS"
msgid "Dried {0}"
msgstr "乾燥{0}"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.DESC"
msgid ""
"A package of non-perishable dehydrated food.\n"
"\n"
"It requires no refrigeration, but must be rehydrated before consumption."
msgstr ""
"腐りにくい乾燥食糧のパックです。\n"
"\n"
"冷凍を必要としませんが、摂取する前に水で戻さなければなりません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DEHYDRATEDFOODPACKAGE.NAME"
msgid "Dry Ration"
msgstr "乾燥レーション"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DREAMJOURNAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DREAMJOURNAL.DESC"
msgid ""
"A hand-scrawled account of <link=\"SLEEPCLINICPAJAMAS\">Pajama</link>-induced dreams.\n"
"\n"
"Can be analyzed using a <link=\"MEGABRAINTANK\">Somnium Synthesizer</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"SLEEPCLINICPAJAMAS\">パジャマ</link>に誘発されて見た夢を手で走り書きされた記述です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MEGABRAINTANK\">夢想合成機</link>を使用すると解析することができます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.DREAMJOURNAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.DREAMJOURNAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STORYTRAITMEGABRAINTANK\">Dream Journal</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STORYTRAITMEGABRAINTANK\">夢日記</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.AQUATICFORAGEPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.AQUATICFORAGEPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A seedless plant with a gummy texture.\n"
"\n"
"It cannot be replanted.\n"
"\n"
"Digging up Buried Objects may uncover a <link=\"AQUATICFORAGEPLANT\">Mussel Tongue</link>."
msgstr ""
"粘り気のある、種なしの植物です。\n"
"\n"
"植えなおすことはできません。\n"
"\n"
"埋もれた物体を掘り起こすと<link=\"AQUATICFORAGEPLANT\">ムールの舌</link>を発見することがあります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.AQUATICFORAGEPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.AQUATICFORAGEPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"AQUATICFORAGEPLANT\">Mussel Tongue</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"AQUATICFORAGEPLANT\">ムールの舌</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICFORAGEPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICFORAGEPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A seedless fruit with an upsettingly bland aftertaste.\n"
"\n"
"It cannot be replanted.\n"
"\n"
"Digging up Buried Objects may uncover a <link=\"BASICFORAGEPLANT\">Muckroot</link>."
msgstr ""
"がっかりするほど味気ない、種なしの果実です。\n"
"\n"
"植えなおすことはできません。\n"
"\n"
"埋もれた物体を掘り起こすと<link=\"BASICFORAGEPLANT\">ムックルート</link>を発見することがあります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICFORAGEPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICFORAGEPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICFORAGEPLANT\">Muckroot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICFORAGEPLANT\">ムックルート</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTBAR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTBAR.DESC"
msgid "<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Meal Lice</link> compacted into a dense, immobile loaf."
msgstr "<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">ミールライス</link>を押し固め、一塊にします。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTBAR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTBAR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">Liceloaf</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">ライスローフ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTBAR.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTBAR.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Meal Lice</link> compacted into a dense, immobile loaf."
msgstr "<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">ミールライス</link>を押し固め、一塊にします。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTFOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTFOOD.DESC"
msgid "A flavorless grain that almost never wiggles on its own."
msgstr "蠢かなくなった、味気ない穀粒です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BASICPLANTFOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Meal Lice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">ミールライス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEAN.DESC"
msgid ""
"The crisp bean of a <link=\"BEANPLANT\">Nosh Sprout</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Each bite tastes refreshingly natural and wholesome."
msgstr ""
"風味豊かな<link=\"BEANPLANT\">ノッシュの木</link>の豆です。\n"
"\n"
"噛むほどに自然で健康的な風味が広がります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEAN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEAN\">Nosh Bean</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEAN\">ノッシュ豆</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEANPLANTSEED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEANPLANTSEED.DESC"
msgid "An inedible bean that can be processed into delicious foods."
msgstr "おいしい食事に加工可能な食べられない豆です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEANPLANTSEED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BEANPLANTSEED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Bean</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ノッシュ豆</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"BERRYPIE\">Mixed Berry Pie</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"BERRYPIE\">ミックスベリーパイ</link>の乾燥レーションです。<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>として扱うには水で戻す必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"乾燥レーションは賞味期限がありません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BERRYPIE\">Dried Berry Pie</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BERRYPIE\">乾燥ベリーパイ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.DESC"
msgid ""
"A pie made primarily of <link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">Grubfruit</link> and <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Gristle Berries</link>.\n"
"\n"
"The mixture of berries creates a fragrant, colorful filling that packs a sweet punch."
msgstr ""
"主に<link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">グラブフルーツ</link>と<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">グリルベリー</link>を使って作られたパイです。\n"
"\n"
"混ざりあったベリーが、ガツンと来る甘さを包み込む色鮮やかで芳醇な香りのフィリングを生み出しています。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BERRYPIE\">Mixed Berry Pie</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BERRYPIE\">ミックスベリーパイ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BERRYPIE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A pie made primarily of <link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">Grubfruit</link> and <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Gristle Berries</link>."
msgstr "主に<link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">グラブフルーツ</link>と<link=\"GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT\">グリルベリー</link>を使って作られたパイです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"BURGER\">Frost Burger</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"BURGER\">ひんやりバーガー</link>の乾燥レーションです。<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>として扱うには水で戻す必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"乾燥レーションは賞味期限がありません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BURGER\">Dried Frost Burger</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BURGER\">乾燥ひんやりバーガー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.DESC"
msgid ""
"<link=\"MEAT\">Meat</link> and <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link> on a chilled <link=\"COLDWHEATBREAD\">Frost Bun</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It's the only burger best served cold."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"MEAT\">肉</link>と<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>を冷たい<link=\"COLDWHEATBREAD\">ひんやりパン</link>に挟んだものです。\n"
"\n"
"冷やして食べるのが一番おいしい唯一のハンバーガーです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BURGER\">Frost Burger</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BURGER\">ひんやりバーガー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BURGER.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"MEAT\">Meat</link> and <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link> on a chilled <link=\"COLDWHEATBREAD\">Frost Bun</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"MEAT\">肉</link>と<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>を冷たい<link=\"COLDWHEATBREAD\">ひんやりパン</link>に挟んだものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYFOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYFOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"A lightly toasted <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It makes the tummy feel a bit fluttery."
msgstr ""
"軽くトーストした<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">ミミレット</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"お腹が少し満たされます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYFOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BUTTERFLYFOOD\">Toasted Mimillet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BUTTERFLYFOOD\">ミミレットトースト</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYFOOD.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYFOOD.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A lightly toasted <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link>."
msgstr "軽くトーストした<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">ミミレット</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED.DESC"
msgid ""
"An inedible seed from a <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANT\">Mimika Bud</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be sown to cultivate more plants, or processed into <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Digging up Buried Objects may uncover a Mimillet Seed."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANT\">ミミカのつぼみ</link>から採れる、そのままでは食べられない種子です。\n"
"\n"
"播種して植物を育てたり、加工して<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>にしたりできます。\n"
"\n"
"埋もれた物を掘り起こすと、ミミレットの種子が見つかることがあります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">ミミレット</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "An inedible <link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">Mimillet</link> seed."
msgstr "そのままでは食べられない<link=\"BUTTERFLYPLANTSEED\">ミミレット</link>の種子です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CARROT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CARROT.DESC"
msgid "An edible tuber with an earthy, elegant flavor."
msgstr "大地の恵みが感じられる上品な食用の根菜です。"

# 収穫前のハネナンキン(Plume Squash Plant)と区別するため「の実」を付け足す
#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CARROT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CARROT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CARROT\">Plume Squash</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CARROT\">ハネナンキンの実</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CAVIAR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CAVIAR.DESC"
msgid ""
"Shelf-stable eggs from an aquatic critter.\n"
"\n"
"It can be added to <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> at a <link=\"DININGTABLE\">Mess Table</link> to boost <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will automatically use Caviar while sitting at a <link=\"DININGTABLE\">Mess Table</link> during mealtime."
msgstr ""
"水棲動物由来の常温保存可能な卵です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"DININGTABLE\">食卓</link>で<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>に振りかけると<link=\"MORALE\">士気</link>を高めることができます。\n"
"\n"
"複製人間は食事時間中に<link=\"DININGTABLE\">食卓</link>に座ると自動的にキャビアを使用します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CAVIAR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CAVIAR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CAVIAR\">Caviar</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CAVIAR\">キャビア</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATBREAD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATBREAD.DESC"
msgid ""
"A simple bun baked from <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Each bite leaves a mild cooling sensation in one's mouth, even when the bun itself is warm."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">雪ん小麦の種籾</link>で作った純朴なパンです。\n"
"\n"
"温かい状態であっても、一口食べるごとに冷涼感が口中を満たします。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATBREAD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATBREAD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COLDWHEATBREAD\">Frost Bun</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COLDWHEATBREAD\">ひんやりパン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATBREAD.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATBREAD.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A simple bun baked from <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">雪ん小麦の種籾</link>で作った純朴なパンです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATSEED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATSEED.DESC"
msgid "An edible grain that leaves a cool taste on the tongue."
msgstr "冷たい風味を持つ食用の種籾です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATSEED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COLDWHEATSEED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">雪ん小麦の種籾</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COMPOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COMPOST"
msgid "Compost"
msgstr "堆肥化"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDEGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDEGG.DESC"
msgid ""
"Fluffed and folded Egg innards.\n"
"\n"
"It turns out you do, in fact, have to break a few eggs to make it."
msgstr ""
"卵の中身をふんわりと焼き上げ、折り畳みました。\n"
"\n"
"実は、卵を割らないと作れないという事実が判明しました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDEGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDEGG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COOKEDEGG\">Omelette</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COOKEDEGG\">オムレツ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDEGG.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDEGG.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Fluffed and folded egg innards."
msgstr "卵の中身をふんわりと焼き上げ、折り畳みました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDFISH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDFISH.DESC"
msgid ""
"A cooked piece of freshly caught aquatic critter.\n"
"\n"
"Unsurprisingly, it tastes a bit fishy."
msgstr ""
"捕れたての水棲生物を調理したものです。\n"
"\n"
"当然のことではありますが、少々生臭いです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDFISH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDFISH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COOKEDFISH\">Cooked Seafood</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COOKEDFISH\">シーフード料理</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDFISH.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDFISH.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A cooked piece of freshly caught aquatic critter."
msgstr "捕れたての水棲生物を調理したものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.DESC"
msgid ""
"The cooked meat of a defeated critter.\n"
"\n"
"It has a delightful smoky aftertaste."
msgstr ""
"倒した動物の肉を調理したものです。\n"
"\n"
"後味がとてもスモーキーです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COOKEDMEAT\">Barbeque</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COOKEDMEAT\">バーベキュー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDMEAT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "The cooked meat of a defeated critter."
msgstr "倒した動物の肉を調理したものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDPIKEAPPLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDPIKEAPPLE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Grilling a <link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">Pikeapple</link> softens its spikes, making it slighly less awkward to eat.\n"
"\n"
"It does not diminish the smell."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">パイクップル</link>を焼くことで棘が柔らかくなり、食べやすくなります。\n"
"\n"
"匂いは消えません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDPIKEAPPLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDPIKEAPPLE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COOKEDPIKEAPPLE\">Pikeapple Skewer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COOKEDPIKEAPPLE\">パイクップルの串焼き</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDPIKEAPPLE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.COOKEDPIKEAPPLE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A grilled dish made with a fruiting <link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">Pikeapple</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">パイクップル</link>の実を焼いたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"CURRY\">Curried Beans</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"CURRY\">豆のカレー煮込み</link>の乾燥レーションです。<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>として扱うには水で戻す必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"乾燥レーションは賞味期限がありません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CURRY\">Dried Curried Beans</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CURRY\">乾燥 豆のカレー煮込み</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.DESC"
msgid ""
"Chewy <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link> simmered with chunks of <link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">Tonic Root</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It's so spicy!"
msgstr ""
"噛みごたえのある<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ノッシュ豆</link>を厚切りの<link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">強壮ウコン</link>で味付けして煮込みました。\n"
"\n"
"かなりスパイシーな仕上がりです！"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CURRY\">Curried Beans</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CURRY\">豆のカレー煮込み</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.CURRY.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Chewy <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link> simmered with chunks of <link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">Tonic Root</link>."
msgstr "噛みごたえのある<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ノッシュ豆</link>を厚切りの<link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">強壮ウコン</link>と一緒に煮込みました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDFISH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDFISH.DESC"
msgid "Deep-fried fish cradled in a crunchy fin."
msgstr "カリカリのヒレに包まれた魚のフライです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDFISH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDFISH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDFISH\">Fish Taco</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDFISH\">フィッシュタコス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDFISH.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDFISH.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"FISHMEAT\">Fish Fillet</link> lightly battered and deep-fried in <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"FISHMEAT\">魚の切り身</link>に軽く衣をつけて<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>で揚げたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDMEAT.DESC"
msgid "A juicy slab of meat with a crunchy deep-fried upper layer."
msgstr "肉汁たっぷりな肉塊で、上層部はカリカリに揚がっています。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDMEAT\">Deep Fried Steak</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDMEAT\">揚げステーキ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDMEAT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDMEAT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A juicy slab of <link=\"MEAT\">Raw Meat</link> deep-fried in <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"MEAT\">生肉</link>の塊を<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>で揚げたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDNOSH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDNOSH.DESC"
msgid "A snackable handful of crunchy beans."
msgstr "軽食に向く豆の揚げ物です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDNOSH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDNOSH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDNOSH\">Nosh Noms</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDNOSH\">ノッシュ豆のカリカリ揚げ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDNOSH.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDNOSH.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A crunchy stack of <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link> deep-fried in <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ノッシュ豆</link>を<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>で揚げたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH.DESC"
msgid "A crispy deep-fried critter claw."
msgstr "カリカリに揚げた動物の爪です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH\">Shellfish Tempura</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH\">剥き身の天ぷら</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DEEPFRIEDSHELLFISH.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A tender chunk of battered <link=\"SHELLFISHMEAT\">Raw Shellfish</link> deep-fried in <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"SHELLFISHMEAT\">生の剥き身</link>に軽く衣をつけて<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>で揚げたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DINOSAURMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DINOSAURMEAT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Uncooked meat from a very dead critter.\n"
"\n"
"It's inedible until cooked in the <link=\"SMOKER\">Smoker</link>."
msgstr ""
"死んだ動物の生肉です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"SMOKER\">燻製器</link>で調理するまでは食べられません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DINOSAURMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DINOSAURMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DINOSAURMEAT\">Tough Meat</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DINOSAURMEAT\">硬い肉</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DRECKOEGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DRECKOEGG.DESC"
msgid ""
"An egg laid by a <link=\"DRECKO\">Drecko</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If incubated, it will hatch into a new <link=\"DRECKO\">Drecklet</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"DRECKO\">ドレッコ</link>の卵です。\n"
"\n"
"孵化すると、新しい<link=\"DRECKO\">ドレッコ幼体</link>が誕生します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DRECKOEGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DRECKOEGG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"DRECKO\">Drecko Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"DRECKO\">ドレッコの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DRECKOEGG.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.DRECKOEGG.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "An egg laid by a <link=\"DRECKO\">Drecko</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"DRECKO\">ドレッコ</link>の卵です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.EDAMAME.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.EDAMAME.DESC"
msgid ""
"Raw <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link> sprinkled with <link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">Sodicane</link> shavings.\n"
"\n"
"Simple and satisfying."
msgstr ""
"生の<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ノッシュ豆</link>に削った<link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">ソディケーン</link>をまぶしたものです。\n"
"\n"
"シンプルですが満足感があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.EDAMAME.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.EDAMAME.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"EDAMAME\">Edamame</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EDAMAME\">枝豆</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.EDAMAME.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.EDAMAME.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Raw <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link> with <link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">Sodicane</link>."
msgstr "生の<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ノッシュ豆</link>に<link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">ソディケーン</link>を合わせました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FERNFOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FERNFOOD.DESC"
msgid "An ancient grain that can be processed into <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr "太古の顆粒は加工して<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>にできます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FERNFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FERNFOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FERNFOOD\">Megafrond Grain</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FERNFOOD\">巨大シダの顆粒</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FIELDRATION.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FIELDRATION.DESC"
msgid "A nourishing nutrient paste, sandwiched between thin wafer layers."
msgstr "薄いウェハースに挟まれた栄養ペーストです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FIELDRATION.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FIELDRATION.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FIELDRATION\">Nutrient Bar</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FIELDRATION\">栄養バー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHFOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHFOOD.DESC"
msgid "A gourmet loaf of ground seeds and <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>, formulated to delight <link=\"PACUSPECIES\">Pacus</link>."
msgstr "挽いた種子と<link=\"WATER\">水</link>で作られたグルメなパンです。<link=\"PACUSPECIES\">パクー</link>を喜ばせるために作られました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHFOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PACUTREAT\">Pacu Treat</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PACUTREAT\">パクーのおやつ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHFOOD.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHFOOD.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A gourmet loaf of ground seeds, specially formulated for <link=\"PACUSPECIES\">Pacus</link>."
msgstr "挽いた種子で作られたグルメなパンで、<link=\"PACUSPECIES\">パクー</link>用に作られています。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHMEAT.DESC"
msgid "An uncooked fillet from a very dead aquatic critter. Yum!"
msgstr "死んだばかりの水棲動物から獲れた、未調理の新鮮な切り身です。おいしそう！"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FISHMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FISHMEAT\">Fish Fillet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FISHMEAT\">魚の切り身</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FOODSPLAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FOODSPLAT.DESC"
msgid "Food smeared on the wall from a recent Food Fight"
msgstr "最近食べ物をぶつけ合った時にできた壁のシミ"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FOODSPLAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FOODSPLAT.NAME"
msgid "Food Splatter"
msgstr "食べ物の残骸"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FORESTFORAGEPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FORESTFORAGEPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A seedless fruit with an unusual rubbery texture.\n"
"\n"
"It cannot be replanted.\n"
"\n"
"Hexalent fruit is much more calorie dense than Muckroot fruit."
msgstr ""
"種なしの果物で、ゴムのような独特の食感をしています。\n"
"\n"
"植えなおすことはできません。\n"
"\n"
"ヘキサレントの果実は、ムックルートよりも多くのカロリーが凝縮されています。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FORESTFORAGEPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FORESTFORAGEPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FORESTFORAGEPLANT\">Hexalent Fruit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FORESTFORAGEPLANT\">ヘキサレントの果実</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHBAR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHBAR.DESC"
msgid ""
"Pan-fried, solidified mudslop.\n"
"\n"
"The inside is almost completely uncooked, despite the crunch on the outside."
msgstr ""
"フライパンで焼き固めたどろどろの塊です。\n"
"\n"
"外はサクサクしていますが、中はほぼ生の状態です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHBAR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHBAR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FRIEDMUSHBAR\">Mush Fry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FRIEDMUSHBAR\">マッシュフライ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHBAR.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHBAR.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Pan-fried, solidified mudslop."
msgstr "フライパンで焼き固めたどろどろの塊です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHROOM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHROOM.DESC"
msgid ""
"A pan-fried dish made with a fruiting <link=\"MUSHROOM\">Dusk Cap</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It has a thick, savory flavor with subtle earthy undertones."
msgstr ""
"新鮮な<link=\"MUSHROOM\">ダスク キャップ</link>をフライパンで焼いたものです。\n"
"\n"
"大地のように重厚な良い味がします。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHROOM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHROOM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FRIEDMUSHROOM\">Fried Mushroom</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FRIEDMUSHROOM\">焼きキノコ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHROOM.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIEDMUSHROOM.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A pan-fried dish made with a fruiting <link=\"MUSHROOM\">Dusk Cap</link>."
msgstr "新鮮な<link=\"MUSHROOM\">ダスク キャップ</link>をフライパンで焼いたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIESCARROT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIESCARROT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Irresistibly crunchy.\n"
"\n"
"Best eaten hot."
msgstr ""
"たまらなくカリカリサクサクです。\n"
"\n"
"熱いうちに食べるのがベストです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIESCARROT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIESCARROT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FRIESCARROT\">Squash Fries</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FRIESCARROT\">ナンキンフライ</link>"

# 収穫前のハネナンキン(Plume Squash Plant)と区別するため「の実」を付け足す
#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIESCARROT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRIESCARROT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Crunchy sticks of <link=\"CARROT\">Plume Squash</link> deep-fried in <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"CARROT\">ハネナンキンの実</link>を<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>で揚げたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRUITCAKE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRUITCAKE.DESC"
msgid ""
"A mashed up <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link> sludge with an exceptionally long shelf life.\n"
"\n"
"Its aggressive, overbearing sweetness can leave the tongue feeling temporarily numb."
msgstr ""
"泥状の塊となった<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">ブリッスル ベリー</link>を混ぜて固めたもので、かなりの長期間にわたって保存できます。\n"
"\n"
"その攻撃的で高圧的な甘さは舌を一時的に無感覚にしてしまいます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRUITCAKE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRUITCAKE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FRUITCAKE\">Berry Sludge</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FRUITCAKE\">どろどろベリー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRUITCAKE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.FRUITCAKE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A mashed up <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link> sludge with an exceptionally long shelf life."
msgstr "泥状の塊となった<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">ブリッスル ベリー</link>を混ぜて固めたもので、かなりの長期間にわたって保存できます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GAMMAMUSH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GAMMAMUSH.DESC"
msgid "A disturbingly delicious mixture of irradiated dirt and water."
msgstr "放射線照射された土と水でできた、心をかき乱すほど美味しい混合物です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GAMMAMUSH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GAMMAMUSH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GAMMAMUSH\">Gamma Mush</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GAMMAMUSH\">ガンママッシュ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GAMMAMUSH.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GAMMAMUSH.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"FRIEDMUSHBAR\">Mush Fry</link> reheated in a <link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">Gamma Ray Oven</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">ガンマ線オーブン</link>で再加熱された<link=\"FRIEDMUSHBAR\">マッシュフライ</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFOODPLANTFOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFOODPLANTFOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"The sugary vegetable produced by <link=\"GARDENFOODPLANT\">Sweatcorn Stalks</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It tastes a lot better deep-fried."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"GARDENFOODPLANT\">スウェットコーンの茎</link>から採れる、糖分の多い野菜です。\n"
"\n"
"揚げるとさらに美味しくなります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFOODPLANTFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFOODPLANTFOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GARDENFOODPLANTFOOD\">Sweatcorn</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GARDENFOODPLANTFOOD\">スウェットコーン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFORAGEPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFORAGEPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A seedless fruit that loses its flavor long before it is fully chewed.\n"
"\n"
"It cannot be replanted.\n"
"\n"
"Digging up Buried Objects may uncover a <link=\"GARDENFORAGEPLANT\">Snac Fruit</link>."
msgstr ""
"がっかりするほど味気ない、種なしの果実です。\n"
"\n"
"植えなおすことはできません。\n"
"\n"
"埋もれた物体を掘り起こすと<link=\"GARDENFORAGEPLANT\">スナックの実</link>を発見することがあります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFORAGEPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GARDENFORAGEPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GARDENFORAGEPLANT\">Snac Fruit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GARDENFORAGEPLANT\">スナックの実</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT.DESC"
msgid ""
"The grilled bud of a <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Heat unlocked an exquisite taste in the fruit, though the burnt spines leave something to be desired."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">ブリッスル ベリー</link>の蕾を直火で焼いたものです。\n"
"\n"
"熱を加えたことでベリーの絶妙な味わいが引き出されていますが、焦げて残った棘が玉に瑕です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT\">Gristle Berry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT\">グリルベリー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.GRILLEDPRICKLEFRUIT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "The grilled bud of a <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">ブリッスル ベリー</link>の蕾を直火で焼いたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HARDSKINBERRY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HARDSKINBERRY.DESC"
msgid "An edible fruit encased in a thorny husk."
msgstr "棘のある殻に覆われた食用の果実です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HARDSKINBERRY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HARDSKINBERRY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">Pikeapple</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">パイクップル</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HATCHEGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HATCHEGG.DESC"
msgid ""
"An egg laid by a <link=\"HATCH\">Hatch</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If incubated, it will hatch into a <link=\"HATCH\">Hatchling</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチ</link>の卵です。\n"
"\n"
"孵化すると、<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチ幼体</link>が誕生します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HATCHEGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HATCHEGG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"HATCH\">Hatch Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HATCHEGG.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.HATCHEGG.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "An egg laid by a <link=\"HATCH\">Hatch</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"HATCH\">ハッチ</link>の卵です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ICECAVESFORAGEPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ICECAVESFORAGEPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A cold seedless fruit that triggers mild brain freeze.\n"
"\n"
"It cannot be replanted."
msgstr ""
"食べると頭がキーンとなる、種なし植物です。\n"
"\n"
"植えなおすことはできません。"

# 収穫前のシャーベリー(Sherberry Plant)と区別するため「の果実」を付け足す
#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ICECAVESFORAGEPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ICECAVESFORAGEPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ICECAVESFORAGEPLANT\">Sherberry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ICECAVESFORAGEPLANT\">シャーベリーの果実</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LETTUCE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LETTUCE.DESC"
msgid "Crunchy, slightly salty leaves from a <link=\"SEALETTUCE\">Waterweed</link> plant."
msgstr "<link=\"SEALETTUCE\">水草</link>からとれる、歯ごたえが良くてちょっとしょっぱい葉っぱです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LETTUCE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LETTUCE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LETTUCE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LETTUCE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Edible roughage from a <link=\"SEALETTUCE\">Waterweed</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"SEALETTUCE\">水草</link>からとれる、食べられる繊維質です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LIGHTBUGEGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LIGHTBUGEGG.DESC"
msgid ""
"An egg laid by a <link=\"LIGHTBUG\">Shine Bug</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If incubated, it will hatch into a <link=\"LIGHTBUG\">Shine Nymph</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"LIGHTBUG\">シャインバグ</link>の卵です。\n"
"\n"
"孵化すると、<link=\"LIGHTBUG\">シャインバグの幼生</link>が誕生します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LIGHTBUGEGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LIGHTBUGEGG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LIGHTBUG\">Shine Bug Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LIGHTBUG\">シャインバグ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LIGHTBUGEGG.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.LIGHTBUGEGG.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "An egg laid by a <link=\"LIGHTBUG\">Shine Bug</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"LIGHTBUG\">シャインバグ</link>の卵です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MAKI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MAKI.DESC"
msgid ""
"Raw <link=\"FISHMEAT\">Fish Fillet</link> paired with <link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">Liceloaf</link> and wrapped in <link=\"NORI\">Nori</link>.\n"
"\n"
"The salty, crispy wrap balances perfectly with the juicy proteins inside."
msgstr ""
"生の<link=\"FISHMEAT\">魚の切り身</link>を<link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">ライスローフ</link>と組み合わせ、<link=\"NORI\">海苔</link>で包みました。\n"
"\n"
"塩味の効いたパリッとした海苔が、中のジューシーな魚介類と絶妙なバランスを生み出します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MAKI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MAKI.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MAKI\">Sushi Roll</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MAKI\">巻き寿司</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MAKI.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MAKI.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Raw <link=\"FISHMEAT\">Fish Fillet</link> paired with <link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">Liceloaf</link> and <link=\"NORI\">Nori</link>."
msgstr "生の<link=\"FISHMEAT\">魚の切り身</link>と<link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">ライスローフ</link>を<link=\"NORI\">海苔</link>で一緒に巻きました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MEAT.DESC"
msgid "Uncooked meat from a very dead critter. Yum!"
msgstr "死んだばかりの動物から獲れた、未調理の新鮮な肉です。美味い！"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MEAT\">Meat</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MEAT\">肉</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MICROWAVEDLETTUCE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MICROWAVEDLETTUCE.DESC"
msgid "<link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link> scrumptiously wilted in the <link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">Gamma Ray Oven</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">ガンマ線オーブン</link>でおいしく萎れさせた<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MICROWAVEDLETTUCE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MICROWAVEDLETTUCE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MICROWAVEDLETTUCE\">Microwaved Lettuce</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MICROWAVEDLETTUCE\">レンチンレタス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MICROWAVEDLETTUCE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MICROWAVEDLETTUCE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link> scrumptiously wilted in the <link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">Gamma Ray Oven</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">ガンマ線オーブン</link>でおいしく萎れさせた<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHBAR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHBAR.DESC"
msgid ""
"An edible, putrefied mudslop.\n"
"\n"
"Mush Bars are preferable to starvation, but only just barely."
msgstr ""
"食用の、腐った泥状の塊です。\n"
"\n"
"餓死するよりはマッシュバーの方がましです。ほんの少しだけ。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHBAR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHBAR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MUSHBAR\">Mush Bar</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MUSHBAR\">マッシュバー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHBAR.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHBAR.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"An edible, putrefied mudslop.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MUSHBAR\">Mush Bar</link>s are preferable to starvation, but only just barely."
msgstr ""
"食用の、腐った泥状の塊です。\n"
"\n"
"餓死するよりは<link=\"MUSHBAR\">マッシュバー</link>の方がましです。ほんの少しだけ。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOM.DESC"
msgid "An edible, flavorless fungus that grew in the dark."
msgstr "暗闇の中で育つ、風味のない食用キノコです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MUSHROOM\">Mushroom</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MUSHROOM\">キノコ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"MUSHROOMWRAP\">Mushroom Wrap</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"MUSHROOMWRAP\">キノコのレタス包み</link>の乾燥レーションです。<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>として扱うには水で戻す必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"乾燥レーションは賞味期限がありません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MUSHROOMWRAP\">Dried Mushroom Wrap</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MUSHROOMWRAP\">乾燥 キノコのレタス包み</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.DESC"
msgid ""
"Flavorful <link=\"MUSHROOM\">Mushrooms</link> wrapped in <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It has an earthy flavor punctuated by a refreshing crunch."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>につつまれた、風味豊かな<link=\"MUSHROOM\">キノコ</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"土のような風味が、心地よい歯ごたえによって引き立ちます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MUSHROOMWRAP\">Mushroom Wrap</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MUSHROOMWRAP\">キノコのレタス包み</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSHROOMWRAP.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Flavorful <link=\"MUSHROOM\">Mushrooms</link> wrapped in <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>につつまれた、風味豊かな<link=\"MUSHROOM\">キノコ</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSSELTONGUE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSSELTONGUE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Edible tongue of a <link=\"MUSSELSPROUT\">Mussel Sprout</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It's bitter and chewy, but better than starvation."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"MUSSELSPROUT\">ムールの芽</link>の食べられる下足です。\n"
"\n"
"苦くて堅いですが、飢え死にするよりマシです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSSELTONGUE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSSELTONGUE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MUSSELTONGUE\">Mussel Tongue</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MUSSELTONGUE\">ムールの舌</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSSELTONGUE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.MUSSELTONGUE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Uncooked meat from a <link=\"MUSSELSPROUT\">Mussel Sprout</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"MUSSELSPROUT\">ムールの芽</link>の実調理の肉です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NIGIRI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NIGIRI.DESC"
msgid ""
"Tenderized <link=\"SQUIDMEAT\">Calamari</link> and <link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">Liceloaf</link> wrapped in <link=\"NORI\">Nori</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Expert preparation highlights the meat's delicate sweetness and soft, chewy texture."
msgstr ""
"柔らかく調理した<link=\"SQUIDMEAT\">ゲソ</link>に<link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">ライスローフ</link>を合わせ、<link=\"NORI\">海苔</link>で巻いたものです。\n"
"\n"
"熟練の調理技術により、肉本来の繊細な甘みと、柔らかくもっちりとした食感が際立ちます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NIGIRI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NIGIRI.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NIGIRI\">Nigiri</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NIGIRI\">握り寿司</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NIGIRI.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NIGIRI.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Tenderized <link=\"SQUIDMEAT\">Calamari</link> with <link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">Liceloaf</link> and <link=\"NORI\">Nori</link>."
msgstr "柔らかく調理した<link=\"SQUIDMEAT\">ゲソ</link>に<link=\"BASICPLANTBAR\">ライスローフ</link>を合わせ、<link=\"NORI\">海苔</link>で巻いたものです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NORI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NORI.DESC"
msgid ""
"A bundle of slightly salty dried greenery from a <link=\"SEATREE\">Tower Kelp</link> or <link=\"SEAFAIRY\">Kelpole</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It's most commonly used as an ingredient in higher-tier dishes."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"SEATREE\">タワーケルプ</link>または<link=\"SEAFAIRY\">ケルポール</link>から採取した、やや塩味の効いた乾燥海藻の束です。\n"
"\n"
"主に高級料理の材料として用いられます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NORI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.NORI.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"NORI\">Nori</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"NORI\">海苔</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.OILFLOATEREGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.OILFLOATEREGG.DESC"
msgid ""
"An egg laid by a <link=\"OILFLOATER\">Slickster</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If incubated, it will hatch into a <link=\"OILFLOATER\">Slickster Larva</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"OILFLOATER\">スリックスター</link>の卵です。\n"
"\n"
"孵化すると、<link=\"OILFLOATER\">スリックスター幼体</link>が誕生します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.OILFLOATEREGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.OILFLOATEREGG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"OILFLOATER\">Slickster Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"OILFLOATER\">スリックスターの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.OILFLOATEREGG.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.OILFLOATEREGG.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "An egg laid by a <link=\"OILFLOATER\">Slickster</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"OILFLOATER\">スリックスター</link>の卵です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PANCAKES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PANCAKES.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sweet discs made from <link=\"RAWEGG\">Raw Egg</link> and <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>.\n"
"\n"
"They're so thick!"
msgstr ""
"<link=\"RAWEGG\">卵の中身</link>と<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">雪ん小麦の種籾</link>から作られた甘い円盤です。\n"
"\n"
"とても分厚いです！"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PANCAKES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PANCAKES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PANCAKES\">Soufflé Pancakes</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PANCAKES\">スフレパンケーキ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PANCAKES.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PANCAKES.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Sweet discs made from <link=\"RAWEGG\">Raw Egg</link> and <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"RAWEGG\">卵の中身</link>と<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">雪ん小麦の種籾</link>から作られた甘い円盤です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PASTA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PASTA.DESC"
msgid "pasta made from egg and wheat"
msgstr "玉子と麦から出来たパスタです"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PASTA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PASTA.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PASTA\">Pasta</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PASTA\">パスタ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PASTA.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PASTA.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "pasta made from egg and wheat"
msgstr "玉子と麦から出来たパスタです"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PEMMICAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PEMMICAN.DESC"
msgid ""
"<link=\"MEAT\">Meat</link> and <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link> pounded into a calorie-dense brick with an exceptionally long shelf life.\n"
"\n"
"Survival never tasted so good."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"MEAT\">肉</link>と<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>を叩いて固め、高カロリーの塊にすることで、保存期間を非常に長くしました。\n"
"\n"
"生き延びることがこんなにも素晴らしいことだとは思いませんでした。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PEMMICAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PEMMICAN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PEMMICAN\">Pemmican</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PEMMICAN\">ペミカン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PEMMICAN.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PEMMICAN.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"MEAT\">Meat</link> and <link=\"TALLOW\">Tallow</link> pounded into a nutrient-dense brick with an exceptionally long shelf life."
msgstr "<link=\"MEAT\">肉</link>と<link=\"TALLOW\">獣脂</link>を叩いて固め、高カロリーの塊にすることで、保存期間を非常に長くしました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PICKLEDMEAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PICKLEDMEAL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Meal Lice preserved in vinegar.\n"
"\n"
"It's a rarely acquired taste."
msgstr ""
"ミールライスを酢で保存したものです。\n"
"\n"
"めったに味わえない味覚です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PICKLEDMEAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PICKLEDMEAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PICKLEDMEAL\">Pickled Meal</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PICKLEDMEAL\">ピクルス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PICKLEDMEAL.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PICKLEDMEAL.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">Meal Lice</link> regrettably preserved in vinegar."
msgstr "これでもかと酢に漬け込まれた<link=\"BASICPLANTFOOD\">ミールライス</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PLANTMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PLANTMEAT.DESC"
msgid "Planty plant meat from a plant. How nice!"
msgstr "植物由来の植物性植物肉です。素晴らしい！"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PLANTMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PLANTMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PLANTMEAT\">Plant Meat</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PLANTMEAT\">植物肉</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.POPCORN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.POPCORN.DESC"
msgid ""
"<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link> popped in a <link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">Gamma Ray Oven</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Completely devoid of any fancy flavorings."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"GAMMARAYOVEN\">ガンマ線オーブン</link>で弾けさせた<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">雪ん小麦の種籾</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"調味料は一切使われていません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.POPCORN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.POPCORN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"POPCORN\">Popcorn</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"POPCORN\">ポップコーン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.POPCORN.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.POPCORN.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Gamma-radiated <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>."
msgstr "ガンマ線を照射した<link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">雪ん小麦の種籾</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PREHISTORICPACUFILLET.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PREHISTORICPACUFILLET.DESC"
msgid "An uncooked fillet from a very dead <link=\"PREHISTORICPACU\">Jawbo</link>. It has a silky texture."
msgstr "死んだばかりの<link=\"PREHISTORICPACU\">ジョーボ</link>から獲れた、未調理の新鮮な切り身です。さらさらとした食感です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PREHISTORICPACUFILLET.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PREHISTORICPACUFILLET.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PREHISTORICPACUFILLET\">Jawbo Fillet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PREHISTORICPACUFILLET\">ジョーボの切り身</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PRICKLEFRUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PRICKLEFRUIT.DESC"
msgid "A sweet, mostly pleasant-tasting fruit covered in prickly barbs."
msgstr "甘く、実に心地よい味わいの実です。逆棘に覆われています。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PRICKLEFRUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PRICKLEFRUIT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">ブリッスル ベリー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PUFTEGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PUFTEGG.DESC"
msgid ""
"An egg laid by a <link=\"PUFT\">Puft</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If incubated, it will hatch into a <link=\"PUFT\">Puftlet</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"PUFT\">パフ</link>の卵です。\n"
"\n"
"孵化すると、<link=\"PUFT\">パフ幼体</link>が誕生します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PUFTEGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PUFTEGG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PUFT\">Puft Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PUFT\">パフの卵</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PUFTEGG.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.PUFTEGG.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "An egg laid by a <link=\"PUFT\">Puft</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"PUFT\">パフ</link>の卵です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"QUICHE\">Mushroom Quiche</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"QUICHE\">キノコキッシュ</link>の乾燥レーションです。<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>として扱うには水で戻す必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"乾燥レーションは賞味期限がありません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"QUICHE\">Dried Mushroom Quiche</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"QUICHE\">乾燥キノコキッシュ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.DESC"
msgid ""
"<link=\"COOKEDEGG\">Omelette</link>, <link=\"FRIEDMUSHROOM\">Fried Mushroom</link> and <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link> piled onto a yummy crust.\n"
"\n"
"Somehow, it's both soggy <i>and</i> crispy."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"COOKEDEGG\">オムレツ</link>と<link=\"FRIEDMUSHROOM\">焼きキノコ</link>、<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>を美味しい生地に積み重ねました。\n"
"\n"
"しっとりしており、<i>それでいて</i>サクサクです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"QUICHE\">Mushroom Quiche</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"QUICHE\">キノコキッシュ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.QUICHE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"COOKEDEGG\">Omelette</link>, <link=\"FRIEDMUSHROOM\">Fried Mushroom</link> and <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link> piled onto a yummy crust."
msgstr "<link=\"COOKEDEGG\">オムレツ</link>と<link=\"FRIEDMUSHROOM\">焼きキノコ</link>、<link=\"LETTUCE\">レタス</link>を美味しい生地に積み重ねました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.RAWEGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.RAWEGG.DESC"
msgid ""
"A raw Egg that has been cracked open for use in <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> preparation.\n"
"\n"
"It will never hatch."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>の下拵えで割られた卵の中身です。\n"
"\n"
"孵化することはありません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.RAWEGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.RAWEGG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"RAWEGG\">Raw Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"RAWEGG\">卵の中身</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.RAWEGG.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.RAWEGG.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A raw egg that has been cracked open for use in <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> preparation."
msgstr "<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>の下拵えで割られた卵の中身です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ROTPILE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ROTPILE.DESC"
msgid ""
"An inedible glop of former foodstuff.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"COMPOST\">Rot Pile</link>s break down into <link=\"TOXICSAND\">Polluted Dirt</link> over time."
msgstr ""
"かつて食べ物だったものの成れの果てで、食べられません。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"COMPOST\">腐った塊</link>は時間とともに<link=\"TOXICSAND\">汚染土</link>に分解されます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ROTPILE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.ROTPILE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COMPOST\">Rot Pile</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COMPOST\">腐った塊</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"SALSA\">Stuffed Berry</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"SALSA\">ベリーの香辛料詰め</link>の乾燥レーションです。<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>として扱うには水で戻す必要があります。\n"
"\n"
"乾燥レーションは賞味期限がありません。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALSA\">Dried Stuffed Berry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALSA\">乾燥 ベリーの香辛料詰め</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DESC"
msgid "A baked <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link> stuffed with delectable spices and vibrantly flavored."
msgstr "<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">ブリッスル ベリー</link>に美味しいスパイスを詰めて焼き上げ、鮮やかな味わいに仕上げました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALSA\">Stuffed Berry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALSA\">ベリーの香辛料詰め</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A baked <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link> stuffed with delectable spices and vibrantly flavored."
msgstr "<link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">ブリッスル ベリー</link>に美味しいスパイスを詰めて焼き上げ、鮮やかな味わいに仕上げました。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"An extremely salty snack harvested from a <link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">Sodicane</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Visiting a <link=\"WATERCOOLER\">Water Cooler</link> will counteract the <link=\"IDFOODEFFECTS\">Thirst</link> caused by eating Salty Sticks."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">ソーディケーン</link>から収穫された、非常に塩辛いスナックです。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"WATERCOOLER\">ウォータークーラー</link>に立ち寄ると、プレッツェルを食べた後に感じる<link=\"IDFOODEFFECTS\">喉の渇き</link>を和らげることができます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALTYSTICKSFOOD\">Salty Sticks</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALTYSTICKSFOOD\">プレッツェル</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.DESC"
msgid "An uncooked chunk of very dead <link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Sanishell</link>. Yum!"
msgstr "死んだばかりの<link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">サニシェル</link>から獲れた、未調理の新鮮な剥き身です。美味い！"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SHELLFISHMEAT\">Raw Shellfish</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SHELLFISHMEAT\">生の剥き身</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.DESC"
msgid "A cooked stack of tough meat that's been marinated and slow-smoked to tender perfection."
msgstr "硬い肉をマリネし、じっくりと燻製して柔らかく仕上げた一品です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT\">Tender Brisket</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT\">柔らかバラ肉</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A stack of tender, slow-smoked meat."
msgstr "柔らかく、じっくりと燻製された肉の塊です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.DESC"
msgid ""
"A buttery smoked fish fillet.\n"
"\n"
"It flakes nicely when pulled apart with a fork."
msgstr ""
"バター風味の魚の燻製です。\n"
"\n"
"フォークでほぐすと、きれいにほぐれます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMOKEDFISH\">Smoked Fish</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMOKEDFISH\">魚の燻製</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A buttery smoked fish fillet."
msgstr "バター風味の魚の燻製です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.DESC"
msgid "Crisp vegetables stuffed with herbs and smoked for hours."
msgstr "ハーブを詰めて何時間も燻製にしたカリカリの野菜です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMOKEDVEGETABLES\">Veggie Poppers</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMOKEDVEGETABLES\">ベジポッパー</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Crisp vegetables stuffed with herbs."
msgstr "ハーブを詰め込んだカリカリの野菜です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"SPICEBREAD\">Pepper Bread</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"SPICEBREAD\">ペッパーブレッド</link>の乾燥レーションです。<link=\"FOOD\">食糧</link>として扱うには水で戻す必要があります。\n"
"\n"
