msgid ""
"A bland curd made from <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It has an unusual but pleasant consistency."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">ノッシュ豆</link>をつぶして固めた、薄味の食べ物です。\n"
"\n"
"独特ですが、気持ちの良い口当たりです。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.NAME
