#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.URCHIN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.URCHIN.DESC"
msgid ""
"Pinpoki are aquatic organisms grown in <link=\"URCHINPLANT\">Pinpokets</link>.\n"
"\n"
"They can be processed into <link=\"DIAMOND\">Diamond</link> or <link=\"URCHINMEAT\">Uni</link>, or used as <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>."
msgstr ""
"ピンポキは、<link=\"URCHINPLANT\">ピンポケット</link>で育てられる水棲動物です。\n"
"\n"
"砕いて<link=\"DIAMOND\">ダイヤモンド</link>や<link=\"URCHINMEAT\">ウニ</link>にしたり、<link=\"DECOR\">観賞用</link>に使えます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.URCHIN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.URCHIN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"URCHIN\">Pinpoki</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"URCHIN\">ピンポキ</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.WOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.WOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Natural resource harvested from certain <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> and <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Used in construction or <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link> production."
msgstr ""
"特定の<link=\"CREATURES\">動物</link>および<link=\"PLANTS\">植物</link>から採取される天然資源です。\n"
"\n"
"建築または<link=\"HEAT\">熱</link>生成に使用されます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.WOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.WOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WOOD\">木材</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.GINGER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.GINGER.DESC"
msgid "A chewy, fibrous rhizome with a fiery aftertaste."
msgstr "燃えるような後味が残る、噛みごたえのある繊維質の地下茎です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.GINGER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.GINGER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">Tonic Root</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GINGERCONFIG\">強壮ウコン</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.KELP.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.KELP.DESC"
msgid ""
"The leaf of a <link=\"KELPPLANT\">Seakomb</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can be processed into <link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</link> or used as an ingredient in <link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">Allergy Medication</link>."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"KELPPLANT\">シーコンブ</link>の葉です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"PHYTOOIL\">植物油</link>に加工したり、<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE \">アレルギー薬</link>の素材として使えます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.KELP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.KELP.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"KELP\">Seakomb Leaf</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"KELP\">シーコンブの葉</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.DESC"
msgid ""
"A medicinal flower that soothes most minor maladies.\n"
"\n"
"It is exceptionally fragrant."
msgstr ""
"大抵の軽い病を和らげる、薬効のある花です。\n"
"\n"
"とても良い香りがします。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INGREDIENTS.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SWAMPLILYFLOWER\">Balm Lily Flower</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPLILYFLOWER\">バームリリーの花</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.DESC"
msgid ""
"Provides a small amount of lubricating <link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">Gear Oil</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Can be produced at the <link=\"APOTHECARY\">Apothecary</link>."
msgstr ""
"潤滑用の<link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">ギアオイル</link>を少量提供します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"APOTHECARY\">調剤所</link> で生産できます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUBRICATIONSTICK\">Gear Balm</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUBRICATIONSTICK\">ギア軟膏</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A self-administered mechanical lubricant for Duplicants with bionic parts."
msgstr "バイオニックパーツを備えた複製人間用の自己投与式機械潤滑剤です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.SUBHEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.LUBRICATIONSTICK.SUBHEADER"
msgid "Mechanical Lubricant"
msgstr "機械潤滑剤"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_BASIC.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_BASIC.DESC"
msgid ""
"An explosive projectile designed to defend against meteor showers.\n"
"\n"
"Must be launched by a <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Meteor Blaster</link>."
msgstr ""
"流星群からの防衛に設計された炸裂弾。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">隕石ブラスター</link>から発射して使います。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_BASIC.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_BASIC.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MISSILEBASIC\">Blastshot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MISSILEBASIC\">ブラストショット</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE.DESC"
msgid ""
"A long-range explosive projectile that defends against distant space objects.\n"
"\n"
"Must be launched by <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Meteor Blaster</link>."
msgstr ""
"遠方から飛来する宇宙物体から身を守る長距離爆発弾です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">隕石ブラスター</link>から発射して使います。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MISSILELONGRANGE\">Intracosmic Blastshot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MISSILELONGRANGE\">宙間ブラストショット</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE_VANILLADLC4.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE_VANILLADLC4.DESC"
msgid ""
"A long-range explosive projectile that defends against distant space objects.\n"
"\n"
"Must be launched by <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Meteor Blaster</link>."
msgstr ""
"遠方から飛来する宇宙物体から身を守る長距離爆発弾です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">隕石ブラスター</link>から発射して使います。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE_VANILLADLC4.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.MISSILE_LONGRANGE_VANILLADLC4.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MISSILELONGRANGEVANILLADLC4\">Intracosmic Blastshot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MISSILELONGRANGEVANILLADLC4\">宙間ブラストショット</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ADVANCEDCURE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ADVANCEDCURE.DESC"
msgid "A doctor-administered cure for severe ailments."
msgstr "重病に医師が処方する薬です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ADVANCEDCURE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ADVANCEDCURE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">Serum Vial</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">血清</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ADVANCEDCURE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ADVANCEDCURE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"An extremely powerful medication created to treat severe <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>. <link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">Serum Vial</link> is very effective against <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">Zombie Spores</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be administered by a Duplicant with the <link=\"MEDICINE3\">Advanced Medical Care</link> Skill."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"DISEASE\">重病</link>に対処するために作り出された極めて強力な医薬品です。 <link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">血清</link>は <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">ゾンビ胞子</link>に極めて効果的です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MEDICINE3\">高度な医療看護</link>スキルを持つ複製人間によって取り扱われる必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ANTIHISTAMINE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ANTIHISTAMINE.DESC"
msgid "Suppresses and prevents allergic reactions."
msgstr "アレルギー反応を抑制し、阻害します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ANTIHISTAMINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ANTIHISTAMINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">Allergy Medication</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">アレルギー薬</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ANTIHISTAMINE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.ANTIHISTAMINE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A strong antihistamine Duplicants can take to halt an allergic reaction. <link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">Allergy Medication</link> will also prevent further reactions from occurring for a short time after ingestion."
msgstr "アレルギー反応を止めるために複製人間が服用する強い抗ヒスタミン薬です。<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">アレルギー薬</link>を摂取すると、短期間アレルギー反応を抑制する効果もあります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICBOOSTER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICBOOSTER.DESC"
msgid "Minorly reduces the chance of becoming sick."
msgstr "病気になる可能性をわずかに減少させます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICBOOSTER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICBOOSTER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICBOOSTER\">Vitamin Chews</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICBOOSTER\">ビタミンガム</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICBOOSTER.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICBOOSTER.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"A supplement that minorly reduces the chance of contracting a <style=\"KKeyword\">Germ</style>-based <link=\"DISEASE\">Disease</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be taken daily."
msgstr ""
"<style=\"KKeyword\">病原菌</style>由来の<link=\"DISEASE\">病気</link>にかかる可能性をわずかに減少させるサプリメントです。\n"
"\n"
"毎日飲む必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICCURE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICCURE.DESC"
msgid "A simple, easy-to-take remedy for minor germ-based diseases."
msgstr "病原菌由来の軽度の病気のための、飲みやすい薬です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICCURE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICCURE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICCURE\">Curative Tablet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICCURE\">治療用錠剤</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICCURE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICCURE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"Duplicants can take this to cure themselves of minor <style=\"KKeyword\">Germ</style>-based <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Curative Tablets are very effective against <link=\"FOODPOISONING\">Food Poisoning</link>."
msgstr ""
"複製人間は、<style=\"KKeyword\">病原菌</style>由来の軽度の<link=\"DISEASE\">病気</link>なら、これを飲んで自分で治すことができます。\n"
"\n"
"治療用錠剤は、<link=\"FOODPOISONING\">食中毒</link>に極めて効果的です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICRADPILL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICRADPILL.DESC"
msgid "Increases a Duplicant's natural radiation absorption rate."
msgstr "複製人間の建築速度をかなり上昇させます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICRADPILL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICRADPILL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BASICRADPILL\">Basic Rad Pill</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BASICRADPILL\">基本除染薬</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICRADPILL.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.BASICRADPILL.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"A supplement that speeds up the rate at which a Duplicant body absorbs radiation, allowing them to manage increased radiation exposure.\n"
"\n"
"Must be taken daily."
msgstr ""
"複製人間が放射線障害を緩和する速度を高め、増加した放射線被曝量を抑えるサプリメントです。\n"
"\n"
"毎日飲む必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.DESC"
msgid "Significantly reduces the chance of becoming sick."
msgstr "病気になる可能性を著しく減少させます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER\">Immuno Booster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER\">免疫増強剤</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"A supplement that significantly reduces the chance of contracting a <style=\"KKeyword\">Germ</style>-based <link=\"DISEASE\">Disease</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be taken daily."
msgstr ""
"<style=\"KKeyword\">病原菌</style>由来の<link=\"DISEASE\">病気</link>にかかる可能性を著しく減少させるサプリメントです。\n"
"\n"
"毎日飲む必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATECURE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATECURE.DESC"
msgid "A doctor-administered cure for moderate ailments."
msgstr "中程度の病気に医師が処方する薬です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATECURE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATECURE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"INTERMEDIATECURE\">Medical Pack</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"INTERMEDIATECURE\">パック入りの薬</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATECURE.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATECURE.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"A doctor-administered cure for moderate <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>. <link=\"INTERMEDIATECURE\">Medical Pack</link>s are very effective against <link=\"SLIMESICKNESS\">Slimelung</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be administered by a Duplicant with the <link=\"MEDICINE2\">Bedside Manner</link> Skill."
msgstr ""
"中程度の<link=\"DISEASE\">病気</link>に医師が処方する薬です。 <link=\"INTERMEDIATECURE\">パック入りの薬</link>は<link=\"SLIMESICKNESS\">腐肺病</link>に非常に効果的です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MEDICINE2\">患者の扱い</link>スキルをもつ複製人間によって取り扱われる必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATERADPILL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATERADPILL.DESC"
msgid "Increases a Duplicant's natural radiation absorption rate."
msgstr "複製人間の建築速度をかなり上昇させます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATERADPILL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATERADPILL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"INTERMEDIATERADPILL\">Intermediate Rad Pill</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"INTERMEDIATERADPILL\">中級除染薬</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATERADPILL.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.INTERMEDIATERADPILL.RECIPEDESC"
msgid ""
"A supplement that speeds up the rate at which a Duplicant body absorbs radiation, allowing them to manage increased radiation exposure.\n"
"\n"
"Must be taken daily."
msgstr ""
"複製人間が放射線障害を緩和する速度を高め、増加した放射線被曝量を抑えるサプリメントです。\n"
"\n"
"毎日飲む必要があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.PLACEBO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.PLACEBO.DESC"
msgid ""
"A general, all-purpose <link=\"MEDICINE\">Medicine</link>.\n"
"\n"
"The less one knows about it, the better it works."
msgstr ""
"一般的な、何にでも効く<link=\"MEDICINE\">薬</link>です。\n"
"\n"
"この薬について知識がない人ほど、効果があります。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.PLACEBO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.PLACEBO.NAME"
msgid "Placebo"
msgstr "プラセボ薬"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.PLACEBO.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.PILLS.PLACEBO.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "All-purpose <link=\"MEDICINE\">Medicine</link>."
msgstr "何にでも効く<link=\"MEDICINE\">薬</link>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.RADIATION.HIGHENERGYPARITCLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.RADIATION.HIGHENERGYPARITCLE.DESC"
msgid "A concentrated field of <style=\"KKeyword\">Radbolts</style> that can be largely redirected using a <link=\"HIGHENERGYPARTICLEREDIRECTOR\">Radbolt Reflector</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"HIGHENERGYPARTICLEREDIRECTOR\">RADボルト反射装置</link>で大部分を反射できる、高濃度の<style=\"KKeyword\">RADボルト</style>です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.RADIATION.HIGHENERGYPARITCLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.RADIATION.HIGHENERGYPARITCLE.NAME"
msgid "Radbolts"
msgstr "RADボルト"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.RAILGUNPAYLOAD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.RAILGUNPAYLOAD.DESC"
msgid ""
"Contains resources packed for interstellar shipping.\n"
"\n"
"Can be launched by a <link=\"RAILGUN\">Interplanetary Launcher</link> or unpacked with a <link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOADOPENER\">Payload Opener</link>."
msgstr ""
"星間輸送用に梱包された資源です。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"RAILGUN\">星間ランチャー</link>で打ち上げるか、<link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOADOPENER\">貨物オープナー</link>で開封します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.RAILGUNPAYLOAD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.RAILGUNPAYLOAD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOAD\">Interplanetary Payload</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOAD\">星間貨物</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.MACHINERY_SPICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.MACHINERY_SPICE.DESC"
msgid "Improves operating skills when ingested."
msgstr "摂取すると操作スキルが向上します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.MACHINERY_SPICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.MACHINERY_SPICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MACHINERYSPICE\">Machinist Spice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MACHINERYSPICE\">機械いじりのスパイス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PILOTING_SPICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PILOTING_SPICE.DESC"
msgid "Provides a boost to piloting abilities."
msgstr "操縦能力にブーストをかけます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PILOTING_SPICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PILOTING_SPICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PILOTINGSPICE\">Rocketeer Spice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PILOTINGSPICE\">ロケット乗りのスパイス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PRESERVING_SPICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PRESERVING_SPICE.DESC"
msgid "Slows the decomposition of perishable foods."
msgstr "日持ちのしない料理の腐敗を緩やかにします。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PRESERVING_SPICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.PRESERVING_SPICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"PRESERVINGSPICE\">Freshener Spice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PRESERVINGSPICE\">清涼スパイス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.STRENGTH_SPICE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.STRENGTH_SPICE.DESC"
msgid "Strengthens even the weakest of muscles."
msgstr "最も弱い筋肉さえも強化します。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.STRENGTH_SPICE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.SPICES.STRENGTH_SPICE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STRENGTHSPICE\">Brawny Spice</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STRENGTHSPICE\">筋肉自慢のスパイス</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.DESC"
msgid ""
"Provides a small amount of extra-silky lubricating <link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">Gear Oil</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Can be produced at the <link=\"APOTHECARY\">Apothecary</link>."
msgstr ""
"潤滑用の<link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">ギアオイル</link>を少量提供します。\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"APOTHECARY\">調剤所</link> で生産できます。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK\">Tallow Gear Balm</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK\">獣脂ギア軟膏</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "An advanced self-administered mechanical lubricant for Duplicants with bionic parts."
msgstr "バイオニックパーツを備えた複製人間用の自己投与式機械潤滑剤です。"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.SUBHEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.TALLOWLUBRICATIONSTICK.SUBHEADER"
msgid "Mechanical Lubricant"
msgstr "機械潤滑剤"

