#. STRINGS.LORE.BUILDINGS.SET_OBJECT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.LORE.BUILDINGS.SET_OBJECT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"<smallcaps><b>Reminder to All Personnel!</b>\n"
"From: <b>Admin</b><alpha=#AA><admin@gravitas.nova></color>\n"
"TO: <b>All</b></smallcaps>\n"
"------------------\n"
"<indent=5%>\n"
"To all employees;\n"
"\n"
"The Gravitas Facility does not officially host a \"Bring Your Child To Work Day\" office event. We ask that personnel please do not bring children into top secret research departments, and especially that they do not let said children play with the high velocity particle accelerators.\n"
"\n"
"We thank you for your understanding.</indent>"
msgstr ""
"<smallcaps><b>全従業員への注意喚起</b>\n"
"From: <b>管理室</b><alpha=#AA><admin@gravitas.nova></color>\n"
"TO: <b>All</b></smallcaps>\n"
"------------------\n"
"<indent=5%>\n"
"\n"
"従業員の皆さんへ\n"
"\n"
"グラビタス研究所は公式に「こども職場見学」イベントを行っていません。特に我々はお子さんを極秘研究部門へ入室させたり、超高速粒子加速装置で遊ばせないようにお願いするものです。\n"
"\n"
"皆さんのご理解、ご協力に感謝します。</indent>"

