#. STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.PRIORITIESMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.PRIORITIESMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid "Duplicants will choose where to work based on the priority of the errands that I give them. I can open the <b>Priorities Screen</b> {Hotkey/ManagePriorities} to set their <style=\"KKeyword\">Duplicant Priorities</style>, and the <b>Priority Tool</b> {Hotkey/Prioritize} to fine tune <style=\"KKeyword\">Building Priority</style>. Many buildings will also let me change their Priority level when I select them."
msgstr "複製人間は割り当てた作業の優先度を基にどこで働くかを決める。<b>優先度パネル</b> {Hotkey/ManagePriorities} を開いて<style=\"KKeyword\">複製人間ごとの優先度</style>を設定し、<b>優先度ツール</b> {Hotkey/Prioritize} で割り当てた<style=\"KKeyword\">設備の優先度</style>設定が出来る。多くの設備は選択すると優先度を変更する事も出来る。"

