#. STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.WELCOMEMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.WELCOMEMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid ""
"I can use the <b>Dig Tool</b> {Hotkey/Dig} and the <b>Build Menu</b> in the lower left of the screen to begin planning my first construction tasks.\n"
"\n"
"Once I've placed a few errands my Duplicants will automatically get to work, without me needing to direct them individually."
msgstr ""
"<b>採掘ツール</b> {Hotkey/Dig} と画面左下の<b>建築メニュー</b>から初めての建築タスクの計画を開始出来る。\n"
"\n"
"作業を幾つか割り当てると、自分で個別に指示をしなくても複製人間は自動的に働き始める。"

