msgid "<link=\"GLASSES\">Glassy</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GLASSES\">ガラス質</link>"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.GLASSES_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.GLASSES_DESC"
msgid ""
"Glassy materials are smooth and transparent, allowing <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> to pass through them.\n"
"\n"
"They are useful in the construction of buildings that require internal illumination, as well as those that display their currently stored resources."
msgstr ""
"ガラス質の素材は滑らかで透明であり、<link=\"LIGHT\">光</link>が透過します。\n"
"\n"
"これらは、内部照明が必要な設備や、現在保管されている資源を表示する設備の建築に役立ちます。"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.HABITAT_MODULE
