#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.PRECIOUSROCK_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.PRECIOUSROCK_DESC"
msgid ""
"Precious rocks are raw minerals. Their extreme hardness produces durable <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Some precious rocks are inherently attractive even in their natural, unfinished form."
msgstr ""
"希少岩石は鉱物の原石です。非常に硬いため、恒久的な<link=\"DECOR\">装飾</link>を生み出します。\n"
"\n"
"希少岩石の中には自然のままの姿であってさえ本質的に魅力的なものもあります。"

