msgstr "大宴会場"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.BANQUETHALL.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.BANQUETHALL.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Eating in a Banquet Hall will dramatically improve Duplicants' Morale"
msgstr "大宴会場で食事を摂ることで、複製人間の士気が飛躍的に高まります"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.BARRACKS.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.BARRACKS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A basic communal sleeping area for up-and-coming colonies.\n"
"\n"
"Sleeping in Barracks will improve Duplicants' Morale."
msgstr ""
"新進気鋭のコロニーにぴったりな、共用の簡易な就寝場所です。\n"
"\n"
"宿舎で睡眠を取ることで、複製人間の士気が高まります。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.BARRACKS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.BARRACKS.EFFECT"
msgid "- Morale bonus"
msgstr "- 士気ボーナス"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.BARRACKS.NAME
