#. STRINGS.UI.CODEX.GEYSERS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.CODEX.GEYSERS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Geysers and Fumaroles emit elements at variable intervals. They provide a sustainable source of material or kinetic energy, albeit typically in low volumes.\n"
"\n"
"The variable factors of a geyser are:\n"
"\n"
"    • Emission element \n"
"    • Emission temperature \n"
"    • Emission mass \n"
"    • Cycle length \n"
"    • Dormancy duration \n"
"    • Disease emitted"
msgstr ""
"間欠泉や噴気口は様々な間隔で元素を放出します。産出量は低いものの、素材や運動エネルギーの安定した供給源となります。\n"
"\n"
"間欠泉が持つ様々な特性は次の通りです:\n"
"\n"
"    • 放出する元素 \n"
"    • 放出する温度 \n"
"    • 放出する総量 \n"
"    • 活動期間 \n"
"    • 休眠期間 \n"
"    • 病原菌の放出"

