msgstr "<style=\"KKeyword\">{Job}</style>作業種別で並べ替え"

#. STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TITLE"
msgid "MANAGE DUPLICANT PRIORITIES"
msgstr "複製人間の優先度管理"

#. STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TOGGLE_ADVANCED_MODE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TOGGLE_ADVANCED_MODE"
msgid "Enable Proximity"
msgstr "近接設定有効"

#. STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TOGGLE_ADVANCED_MODE_TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TOGGLE_ADVANCED_MODE_TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"<b>Errand Proximity Settings</b>\n"
"\n"
"Enabling Proximity settings tells my Duplicants to always choose the closest, most urgent errand to perform.\n"
"\n"
"When disabled, Duplicants will choose between two high priority errands based on a hidden priority hierarchy instead.\n"
"\n"
"Enabling Proximity helps cut down on travel time in areas with lots of high priority errands, and is useful for large colonies."
msgstr ""
"<b>近接作業設定</b>\n"
"\n"
"近接設定を有効にすると、複製人間は常に最も近く、最も優先度が高い作業を選ぶようになります。\n"
"\n"
"無効にすると、複製人間は優先度の高い2つの作業を距離にかかわらず隠し優先度で比較して選ぶようになります。\n"
"\n"
"近接設定は優先度の高い作業がたくさんある地帯において移動時間を短縮することができ、大きなコロニーで効果があります。"

#. STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TOOLTIP_TOGGLE_ALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TOOLTIP_TOGGLE_ALL"
msgid "Set priority of all Errand Types colonywide"
msgstr "コロニー全体の全ての作業の優先度を設定します"

#. STRINGS.UI.JOBSSCREEN.TRAIT_DISABLED
