#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICBASEGAME.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICBASEGAME.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A salty water-rich starting world with abundant food resources.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Marinea's biodiversity makes reliable food production more attainable for new colonies, provided they can navigate its ubiquitous liquid pools. Construction materials are a bit limited.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""
"塩水と食料資源が豊富な開始惑星です。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>マリネアの生物多様性のおかげで、たくさんの水たまりをうまく切り抜けられれば安定した食糧生産が一層実現しやすくなります。建築資材はやや限られています。</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICBASEGAME.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICBASEGAME.NAME"
msgid "Marinea"
msgstr "マリネア"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICCLASSIC.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICCLASSIC.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A salty water-rich starting world with abundant food resources.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Marinea's biodiversity makes reliable food production more attainable for new colonies, provided they can navigate its ubiquitous liquid pools. Construction materials are a bit limited.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""
"塩水と食料資源が豊富な開始惑星です。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>マリネアの生物多様性のおかげで、たくさんの水たまりをうまく切り抜けられれば安定した食糧生産が一層実現しやすくなります。建築資材はやや限られています。</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICCLASSIC.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICCLASSIC.NAME"
msgid "Marinea Asteroid"
msgstr "マリネア小惑星"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICMIXING.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICMIXING.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A fragment of an aquatic starting world. It has abundant food resources.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Marinea's biodiversity makes reliable food production more attainable for new colonies, provided they can navigate its many liquid pools. Construction materials are a bit limited.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""
"水界をテーマとした開始惑星の断片です。食料資源が豊富です。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>マリネアの生物多様性のおかげで、至る所にひろがる水たまりをうまく切り抜けられれば安定した食糧生産が一層実現しやすくなります。建築資材はやや限られています。</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICMIXING.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICMIXING.NAME"
msgid "Marinea Fragment"
msgstr "マリネアの破片"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICSPACEDOUT.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICSPACEDOUT.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A smaller inundated starting world with abundant food resources.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Marinea's biodiversity makes reliable food production more attainable for new colonies, provided they can navigate its ubiquitous liquid pools. Construction materials are a bit limited.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""
"水没した食料資源が豊富な小さな開始惑星です。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>マリネアの生物多様性のおかげで、至る所にひろがる水たまりをうまく切り抜けられれば安定した食糧生産が一層実現しやすくなります。建築資材はやや限られています。</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICSPACEDOUT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.AQUATICSPACEDOUT.NAME"
msgid "Marinea Minor"
msgstr "小マリネア"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.BADLANDS.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.BADLANDS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A barren location with an overabundance of mineral resources.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>The rocky terrain of The Badlands poses no immediate threats, but sparse resource availability will make expansion and technological progress challenging.</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"有り余るほどの鉱物資源に満ちた、不毛な場所です。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>バッドランドの岩だらけの地形に差し迫った危険はありませんが、資源の種類が限られているため、拡張と技術の進歩には困難が伴うでしょう。</smallcaps>\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.BADLANDS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.BADLANDS.NAME"
msgid "The Badlands"
msgstr "バッドランド"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.BIGEMPTY.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.BIGEMPTY.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A big ol' biome-free spacerock for claustrophobic devs."
msgstr "狭苦しいのが嫌いな開発者向けの、バイオームなしの広大な宇宙岩石です。"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.BIGEMPTY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.BIGEMPTY.NAME"
msgid "Big Empty FOR DEVS"
msgstr "開発者向けの大きな空き地"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAME.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAME.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"A frosty location with sub-zero temperatures throughout.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Duplicants who work in Ceres's sub-zero temperatures will need to wear or build warming equipment. Abundant natural fuel sources could lead to a well-powered colony.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""
"隅から隅まで氷点下の凍った場所です。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>複製人間がケレスの氷点下の中で働く時には温める装備を着るか作る必要があります。豊富な天然の燃料源が潤沢な電力のコロニーに導くでしょう。</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAME.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAME.NAME"
msgid "Ceres"
msgstr "ケレス"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAMESHATTERED.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAMESHATTERED.DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The heavily damaged remnants of a frosty location with sub-zero temperatures throughout.\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>Exploring the rubble of Blasted Ceres's sub-zero temperatures is particularly challenging, yet natural fuel sources provide a valuable payoff.</smallcaps>"
msgstr ""
"酷く破壊されてしまった全体が氷点下の凍った残骸です。\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps>粉砕されたケレスの氷点下の瓦礫を探索するのはとりわけ困難ですが、天然の燃料源から価値ある見返りが得られるでしょう。</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAMESHATTERED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.WORLDS.CERESBASEGAMESHATTERED.NAME"
msgid "Blasted Ceres"
msgstr "粉砕されたケレス"

